<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LEV" style="id">- Makua Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Alawi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ikitabu ya Alawi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Alawi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ala</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ikitabu ya</para>
  <para style="mt1">Alawi</para>
  <para style="imt">Nlhove no uhoolhelha</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LEV 1" />
  <para style="s1">Malheheriyo anaacha isadaka cho upahiya vamooroni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 1:1" />Apwiiya Nlhuku yaheehana ashinna Musa ni waarerihana u Nihema Nitakatifu, <verse eid="LEV 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 1:2" />nkayaalhehera malheheriyo o waahimeria attu o Israeli wiira,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 1:2">“Ntu athananaka ukumiha isadaka yo mwannama wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, yoyo mwannama uyo anthanlheke ukhuma nkutiro awe wo ing'ope, wo ikhondoro ama wo ipuri.<verse eid="LEV 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 1:3" />“Yakhalhaka ntu nookumiha isadaka awe wo upahiya vamooroni, athanlheke ndume no mwannama o uhiremara ukhuma munkutironi mwawe. Akumihereke vakhiviru ni nlhako wo Nihema Nitakatifu wiira arumelhelhiye ni Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 1:4" />Eesheke moono awe vamuruni wo mwannama o isadaka yo upahiya, inothanana awe irumelhelhiye wo nlhatu no uthamiha uwonya wawe yoyo ntu uyo. <verse eid="LEV 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 1:5" />Yamalhaka ahitheke nenno nd'ume no ing'ope nno umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. Ni ayo opochera ishaani o iyari i Naharuni anookusha iphome ni umichamicha vamadhubahuni mipata chonkhaye, vakhiviru ni nlhako wo Nihema Nitakatifu. <verse eid="LEV 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 1:6" />Amalhihaka, ankusheke yoyo mwannama o isadaka yo upahiya uyo ni unkhavan nrapalha ni untupulhacha ipilhipicha chinchi. <verse eid="LEV 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 1:7" />Ni yayo opochera ishaani o iyari i Naharuni ayo aphakeke ikhuni vachulhu madhubahu ni uparihelha vamooroni. <verse eid="LEV 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 1:8" />Yamalhaka, opochera ishaani o iyari i Naharuni ayo akusheke ivipande cho inama, muru ni makhura ni weesha vachulhu ikhuni vachulhu madhubahu vawo. <verse eid="LEV 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 1:9" />Ntu nokumiha isadaka uyo ahapiheke marupo ni mieto cho utulhi cho yoyo mwannama uyo wo maashi. Yamalhaka opochera ishaani apaheke isadaka vamadhubahuni. Yeyo phi isadaka yo upahiya wo mooro irii ni nihiriri noombone ninaachivelha Apwiiya Nlhuku.<verse eid="LEV 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 1:10" />“Yakhalhaka ntu nookumiha isadaka awe yo upahiya vamooroni iyo ukhuma nkutiro awe wo ikhondoro ama wo ipuri, paahi athanlheke n'dume no uhiremara variwoothe. <verse eid="LEV 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 1:11" />Anhithelheke mpata wo uchulhu wo madhubahu, umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, ni opochera ishaani o iyari i Naharuni ayo anoomichamicha iphome vamadhubahuni mipata chaya chonkhaye. <verse eid="LEV 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 1:12" />Yamalhaka ntu uyo antupulhacheke ipilhipicha ni weesha muru vamoka ni makhura aya, ni opochera ishaani ayo yeesheke vamooroni vachulhu madhubahu vawo. <verse eid="LEV 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 1:13" />Nansho ntu uyo ahapiheke marupo ni mieto cho utulhi wo maashi. Opochera ishaani apaheke mpaka uvia chonkhaye chiyo vachulhu madhubahu vawo. Yeyo phi isadaka yo upahiya vamooroni yo nihiriri noombone ninaachivelha Apwiiya Nlhuku.<verse eid="LEV 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 1:14" />“Yakhalhaka nokumiha wa Apwiiya Nlhuku isadaka yo upahiya yo ashaanuni, paahi awiiheke isadaka yo nchiya ama nikhandi no ikhunda. <verse eid="LEV 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 1:15" />Opochera ishaani ammwiiheke yoyo mwaashanuni uyo umadhubahuni, anchipulheke muru awe ni umpaha vachulhu madhubahu. Iphome awe imichiyeke mpararini mwo madhubahu. <verse eid="LEV 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 1:16" />Athamiheke ithothohiro awe vamoka ni chittu cho unanara chaya ni urihelha mpata unosha nchuwa wo madhubahu unorihelhiya ituura. <verse eid="LEV 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 1:17" />Ammareke mapupha ni umphulha, nansho ahintupulhanihe ivipande piilhi. Yamalhaka opochera ishaani ampaheke vamadhubahuni, vachulhu ikhuni. Yeyo phi isadaka yo upahiya vamooroni yo nihiriri noombone ninaachivelha Apwiiya Nlhuku.”<verse eid="LEV 1:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LEV 2" />
  <para style="s1">Isadaka cho choolhia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 2:1" />“Ntu riyoothe awiihaka isadaka yo choolhia wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, yeyo isadaka iyo ikhalheke yo iphepa yo shilhia. Amiinelheke makhura o izeituni ni ubani vachulhu. <verse eid="LEV 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 2:2" />Yamalhaka awiiheke wa yayo opochera ishaani o iyari i Naharuni ayo. Akusheke nthatha nimoka no yeyo iphepa yo shilhia irii ni makhura ni ubani iyo ni waarwehelha opochera ishaani mmoka aya anohalha upaha vachulhu madhubahu, ikhalhe isadaka yo wooniha wiira isadaka phi yawaya Apwiiya Nlhuku. Yeyo phi isadaka yo upahiya irii ni nihiriri noombone ninaachivelha Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 2:3" />Inohalha iyo, yeyo phi isadaka yawaya opochera ishaani. Yeyo phi mpatta ntakatifu chinene wo isadaka inokumihiya wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, wo upahiya vamooroni.<verse eid="LEV 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 2:4" />“Yakhalhaka ntu nookumiha wa Apwiiya Nlhuku isadaka yo choolhia chooshiye viikho, chechiyo chikhalheke maandazi ama mikatte chihihelhiye ihengedure cho iphepa yo shilhia ithakanihiye ni makhura o izeituni, ama yo mikatte cho uvevialha chihihelhiye ihengedure.<verse eid="LEV 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 2:5" />“Yakhalhaka isadaka inokumiha inyu phi yo nkatte wooshiye wo uhikhalha makhura, yoyo ukhalheke wo iphepa yo shilhia ithakanihiye ni makhura o izeituni nansho wo uhihelhiya ihengedure. <verse eid="LEV 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 2:6" />Chechiyo mikatte chiyo chimianihiyeke ni umiinelhiya makhura, yeyo phi isadaka yo choolhia.<verse eid="LEV 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 2:7" />“Yakhalhaka isadaka inokumiha inyu phi yo mikatte chaapeiye munsufuriyani, yeyo ikhalheke yo iphepa yo shilhia ni uhelhiya makhura. <verse eid="LEV 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 2:8" />Mmwiiheke isadaka yo choolhia ikooroshiye wo chechiyo chittu chiyo umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, ni opochera ishaani arweeheke umadhubahuni. <verse eid="LEV 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 2:9" />Opochera ishaani anookusha mpatta wo yeyo isadaka iyo ikhalhaka phi isadaka yo wooniha wiira isadaka phi chawaya Apwiiya Nlhuku ni upahiya vachulhu madhubahu. Yeyo phi isadaka yo upahiya vamooroni irii ni nihiriri noombone ninaachivelha Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 2:10" />Mpatta wo isadaka yo choolhia unohalha, phi wawaya opochera ishaani. Yoyo phi mpatta ntakatifu chinene, ukhalhawaya ukhumme wo isadaka inokumihiya wa Apwiiya Nlhuku wo upahiya vamooroni.<verse eid="LEV 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 2:11" />“Isadaka iriyoothe yo choolhia inohalha inyu ukumiha wa Apwiiya Nlhuku inothananiya wiira ikhalheke yo ukooroshiya wo uhihelhiya ihengedure. Ukhalhawaya nhochiichihiya ukumiha isadaka yo upahiya vamooroni ihelhiye ihengedure mena urawo. <verse eid="LEV 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 2:12" />Mmwiiheke wa Apwiiya Nlhuku isadaka yo milhipu yo choolhia chinyu kila iyaakha. Nansho chechiyo khachinopahiya umadhubahuni thoko cho nihiriri ninaachivelha chilhe. <verse eid="LEV 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 2:13" />Nlhukeke maakha isadaka chinyu chonkhaye cho choolhia. Nhihiye mena ulhuka maakha isadaka chinyu cho choolhia ukhalhawaya maakha phi nooniha malhehano apannge awe Nlhuku vamoka ni mwaattiva. <verse eid="LEV 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 2:14" />Vanowiiha inyu isadaka yo milhipu yo choolhia chinyu wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, mmwiiheke chinooshiye mmachaashini mwaya. Ama nkumiheke mikatte cho wooshiya chikooroshiye wo iphepa yo ingaano yo ushilhia. <verse eid="LEV 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 2:15" />Nhelheke makhura ni ubani. Yeyo phi isadaka yo choolhia. <verse eid="LEV 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 2:16" />Opochera ishaani apaheke mpatta wo isadaka yo choolhia iwotiye ni makhura vamoka ni ubani waya wonkhaye, ikhalhe isadaka yo wooniha wiira isadaka yawaya Apwiiya Nlhuku. Yeyo phi isadaka inokumihiya wa Apwiiya Nlhuku wo mooro.”<verse eid="LEV 2:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LEV 3" />
  <para style="s1">Isadaka cho ukhalha wo mpuha ni Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 3:1" />“Yakhalhaka ntu nookumiha isadaka yo ukhalha wo mpuha ni mii, ni isadaka awe iyo yakhalhaka ing'ope n'dume ama ithiyana paahi, yoyo mwannama uyo hiremare variwoothe. <verse eid="LEV 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 3:2" />Ntu uyo eesheke moono awe vamuruni wo mwannama uyo ni unhitha vakhiviru ni nlhako wo Nihema Nitakatifu. Ni ayo opochera ishaani o iyari i Naharuni akusheke iphome ni unyunyeriha mipata chonkhaye cho madhubahu. <verse eid="LEV 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 3:3" />Yamalhaka, opochera ishaani athamiheke makhura onkhaye anokhunelha marupo o mwannama o isadaka yo uwiiha mpuha iyo, akusheke apaheke vamooroni umadhubahuni, ukhalha isadaka inokumihiya wa Apwiiya Nlhuku wo mooro. <verse eid="LEV 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 3:4" />Chiicho, athamiheke imphio piilhi ni makhura aya vamoka ni ithayi yoombone ya ahapa. <verse eid="LEV 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 3:5" />Ni yamalhakaru, iyari i Naharuni anoopaha vamadhubahuni vamoka ni isadaka yo upahiya irii vachulhu ikhuni chinopharelha mooro, yeyo phi isadaka yo upahiya vamooroni mpaka uvia irii ni nihiriri noombone ninaachivelha Apwiiya Nlhuku.<verse eid="LEV 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 3:6" />“Yakhalhaka yeyo isadaka yo waathanihiya iyo inokumihiya wa Apwiiya Nlhuku iyo ikhumme nkutiro wo ikhondoro ama wo ipuri, paahi athanlheke ilhopwana ama ithiyana ihiremanre. <verse eid="LEV 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 3:7" />Yakhalhaka ntu nonkhumiha mwaakhondoro ukhalha isadaka awe yo umwaathaniha wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, paahi ankumiheke, <verse eid="LEV 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 3:8" />eesheke moono awe vamuruni wo yoyo mwannama uyo ni unhitha vakhiviru ni Nihema Nitakatifu. Opochera ishaani o iyari i Naharuni anoomichamicha iphome vamadhubahuni mipata chaya chonkhaye. <verse eid="LEV 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 3:9" />Yamalhaka, ukhuma wo yeyo isadaka yo ukhalha wo mpuha ni Apwiiya Nlhuku wo mooro iyo, opochera ishaani awiiheke chi chittu chi, makhura awe, mwiilha wo makhura wonkhaye utupulhiye vanaatameria chinene nthana vamoka ni makhura onkhaye anokhunelha marupo ni makhura onkhaye o mmirimani, <verse eid="LEV 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 3:10" />ni imphio piilhi chilhe ni makhura aya vamoka ni ithayi yoombone ya ahapa. <verse eid="LEV 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 3:11" />Mmoka aya opochera ishaani anoopaha mooro chechiyo chonkhaye vachulhu madhubahu thoko isadaka yo yolhia inokumihiya wa Apwiiya Nlhuku wo mooro.<verse eid="LEV 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 3:12" />“Yakhalhaka isadaka awe iyo ipuri, paahi akumiheke umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku <verse eid="LEV 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 3:13" />neeshilhe moono awe vamuruni wo mwannama uyo ni unhitha vakhiviru ni Nihema Nitakatifu. Ni mmoka o iyari i Naharuni noomichamicha iphome vamadhubahuni mipata chaya chonkhaye. <verse eid="LEV 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 3:14" />Yamalhakaru, athamiheke makhura onkhaye anokhuneelha marupo o yoyo mwannama uyo, <verse eid="LEV 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 3:15" />ni imphio piilhi chilhe ni makhura aya vamoka ni ithayi yoombone yo ahapa. <verse eid="LEV 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 3:16" />Opochera ishaani apaheke vamooroni vachulhu madhubahu thoko choolhia chinokumihiya isadaka wa Apwiiya Nlhuku wo mooro wiira chinukhelhe nihiriri ninaachivelha Apwiiya Nlhuku. Makhura onkhaye a Apwiiya Nlhuku.<verse eid="LEV 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 3:17" />“Paahi etu mahuku onkhaye ni vakittu variwoothe vanohalha inyu ukhalha, nnothananiya uvarechesha alha malheheriyo alha, nhilhie mena makhura ama iphome yo mwannama riyoothe.”<verse eid="LEV 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LEV 4" />
  <para style="s1">Isadaka wo nlhatu no uwonya wo uhichuwelha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 4:1" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeerelha ashinna Musa wiira, <verse eid="LEV 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 4:2" />“Mwaahimerieke attu o israeli wiira, yakhalhaka ntu howonya wo uhichuwelha, nkaapanga ittu ichichihiye ni malheheriyo a Apwiiya Nlhuku, apangeke thoko cho.<verse eid="LEV 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 4:3" />“Yakhalhaka Opochera ishaani Olhupalhe phi wonyilhe, nkayaahelha attu muuttekani, paahi yayo akumiheke wa Apwiiya Nlhuku n'dume nikani no ing'ope nihiremanre variwoothe, nikhalhe isadaka yo uthamiha uwonya waya uwo. <verse eid="LEV 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 4:4" />Awiiheke yeyo n'dume nikani no ing'ope nno vakhiviru ni Nihema Nitakatifu, umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. Eesheke moono aya vamuruni wo n'dume nikani no ing'ope nno ni uhitha umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 4:5" />Yamalhaka, yayo Opochera ishaani Olhupalhe ayo akusheke iphome vakani ni ukelhana nhina Nihema Nitakatifu. <verse eid="LEV 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 4:6" />Ahelheke nikokho naya mphomeni mmo ni unyunyihera mikwaha saba umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku umihoolho wo nipaziya no Vakittu Vatakatifu. <verse eid="LEV 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 4:7" />Yamalhaka, akusheke iphome ikina ni uhika inyaka cho madhubahu o ututumiheriya ubani wo nihiriri nomboone umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku u Nihema Nitakatifu. Iphome inohalha iyo arihelheke varii ikhalhelho yo madhubahu o upaheriya isadaka arii vathe vakhiviru ni nlhako wo Nihema Nitakatifu. <verse eid="LEV 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 4:8" />Yamalhaka athamiheke makhura onkhaye o yeyo ing'ope iyo. Makhura anokhunelha marupo ni arii nhina, <verse eid="LEV 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 4:9" />imphio piilhi ni makhura arii vachulhu aya, arii nnyununi, ni alhe avarananne ni imphio ni ahapa, chikhalhaka phi chittu chinothamihiya wa mwannama o isadaka yo waathanihiya. <verse eid="LEV 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 4:10" />Yamalhaka vavawo, opochera ishaani akusheke ni upaha mooro vachulhu madhubahu o upaheriya isadaka, thoko chineeriya wo isadaka yo mwannama nokumihiya isadaka yo uthamiha uwonya. <verse eid="LEV 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 4:11" />Nansho nrapalha no yeyo ing'ope iyo, inama, muru, mieto, inama cho mmirimani vamoka ni mavi aya, <verse eid="LEV 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 4:12" />yaani inama yonkhaye ihanlhe, arweeheke ni upaha mooro uchereshere nikambi. Apaheke vamooroni vachulhu ikhuni chinopharelha mooro, vavawo vakittu vanorihelhiya itura varumelhelhiye ni Apwiiya Nlhuku vawo.<verse eid="LEV 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 4:13" />“Yakhalhaka nlhoko wonkhaye wa attu o Israeli uhowonya wo uhichuwelha, wo upanga ittu ichiichihiye ni malheheriyo a Apwiiya Nlhuku, <verse eid="LEV 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 4:14" />phiyaru uwonya uwo wachuwaniaka, nlhoko wonkhaye ukumiheke n'dume nikani no ing'ope nikhalhe isadaka yo uthamiha uwonya uwo. Awiiheke vakhiviru ni Nihema Nitakatifu. <verse eid="LEV 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 4:15" />Ashulhupalhe ahoolhelhi o nlhoko wa attu eesheke miono chaya vamuruni wo n'dume nikani no ing'ope nno, yamalhaka nihithiyeke umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 4:16" />Opochera ishaani Olhupalhe awiiheke iphome yo yeyo ing'ope iyo nhina Nihema Nitakatifu. <verse eid="LEV 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 4:17" />Ahelheke nikokho naya mphomeni mmo ni unyunyihera mikwaha saba umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku umihoolho wo nipaziya no Vakittu Vatakatifu. <verse eid="LEV 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 4:18" />Yamalhaka ahikeke iphome ikhona cho madhubahu arii Nihema Nitakatifu umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. Iphome ihanlhe iyo ariheke vathi varii ikhalhelho yo madhubahu o upaheriya isadaka arii vakhiviru ni nlhako wo Nihema Nitakatifu. <verse eid="LEV 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 4:19" />Akusheke makhura onkhaye o mwannama uyo ni upahera vachulhu madhubahu. <verse eid="LEV 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 4:20" />Chiicho tho, apangeke wo ing'ope n'dume iyo thoko chipannge aya ikina yo isadaka yo uthamiha uwonya ilhe. Paahi Opochera ishaani ayo anoopanga yeyo ittu iyo wo nlhatu wo uhiyereriya uwonya uwo, ni attu ayo anoohiyereriya. <verse eid="LEV 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 4:21" />Yamalhaka akusheke inama ihanlhe yo ing'ope n'dume iyo ni ukelhana uchereshere nikambi ni upaha vamooroni thoko chipannge aya wo ikina yo uthamiha uwonya waya anene ilhe. Yeyo phi isadaka yo uthamiha uwonya wa attu onkhaye.<verse eid="LEV 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 4:22" />“Yakhalhaka nholhelhi howonya wo uhichuwelha wo upanga ittu ichichihiye ni malheheriyo a Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku awe, nkaatteka, <verse eid="LEV 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 4:23" />vanohalha awe uchuwelhihiya uwonya upannge awe uwo, awiiheke isadaka awe yo ipuri ilhopwana yo uhiremara. <verse eid="LEV 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 4:24" />Eesheke moono aya vamuruni wo ipuri iyo ni uhitha vakittu vanohithelhiya isadaka yo upahiya umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. Yeyo phi isadaka yo uthamiha uwonya. <verse eid="LEV 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 4:25" />Ni opochera ishaani ahelheke nikokho naya mphomeni mwo isadaka yo uthamiha uwonya ni uhika inyaka cho madhubahu o upaheriya isadaka. Iphome inohalhelha iyo arihelheke urii ikhalhelho yo madhubahu o upaheriya isadaka. <verse eid="LEV 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 4:26" />Yamalhaka, apaheke makhura onkhaye o ipuri n'dume nno umadhubahuni, thoko chinopanga aya wo makhura o mwannama o isadaka yo uwiiha mpuha. Wo yeyo iphiro iyo opochera ishaani ampangelheke nholhelhi thoko chiichammo wo uthamiha nlhatu wawe wo uwonya, ni uyo noohiyereriya.<verse eid="LEV 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 4:27" />“Yakhalhaka ntu riyoothe nkina howonya wo uhichuwelha, wo upanga ittu ichiichihiye ni malheheriyo a Apwiiya Nlhuku, yoyo hotteka, <verse eid="LEV 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 4:28" />vanohalha awe uchuwelha wiira howonya, awiiheke isadaka yo ipuri nkhoolho ihiremanre wo nlhatu no uthamiha uwonya upannge awe. <verse eid="LEV 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 4:29" />Eesheke moono aya vamuruni wo ipuri iyo ni uhitha vakittu vanohithelhiya isadaka yo upahiya umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. Yeyo phi isadaka yo uthamiha uwonya. <verse eid="LEV 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 4:30" />Ni opochera ishaani ahelheke nikokho naya mphomeni mwo isadaka yo uthamiha uwonya ni uhika inyaka cho madhubahu o upaheriya isadaka. Iphome inohalhelha iyo arihelheke urii ikhalhelho yo madhubahu o upaheriya isadaka. <verse eid="LEV 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 4:31" />Athamiheke makhura onkhaye o ipuri iyo thoko chinothamiha aya makhura yo mwannama o isadaka cho uwiiha mpuha, ni opochera ishaani anoopaha vamadhubahuni, ni nihiriri naya noombone ninowaachivelha Apwiiya Nlhuku. Wo yeyo iphiro iyo opochera ishaani anompangelha yoyo ntu uyo ittu yo waathaanihiya, ni uyo noohiyereriya.<verse eid="LEV 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 4:32" />“Yakhalhaka yoyo ntu uyo nommwiiha mwaakhondoro wo nlhatu wo isadaka yo uthamiha uwonya, paahi ammwiiheke mwaakhondoro nthiyana o uhiremara. <verse eid="LEV 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 4:33" />Eesheke moono awe vamuruni wo yoyo mwaakhondoro o isadaka yo uthamiha uwonya uyo, ni unhitha vakittu vanohithelhiya ashinama o isadaka yo upahiya. <verse eid="LEV 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 4:34" />Ni opochera ishaani ahelheke nikokho naya mphomeni mwo isadaka yo uthamiha uwonya ni uhika inyaka cho madhubahu o upaheriya isadaka. Iphome inohalhelha iyo arihelheke urii ikhalhelho yo madhubahu o upaheriya isadaka. <verse eid="LEV 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 4:35" />Yamalhaka, athamiheke makhura onkhaye thoko chinothamihiya aya makhura o ikhondoro yo isadaka yo uwiiha mpuha, ni opochera ishaani anoopaha vachulhu madhubahu, vamoka ni isadaka chinokumihiya wa Apwiiya Nlhuku wo mooro. Ni wowo yeyo iphiro iyo, opochera ishaani anompangelha yoyo ntu uyo ittu yo waathaanihiya, ni uyo noohiyereriya.”<verse eid="LEV 4:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LEV 5" />
  <para style="s1">Isadaka chikina cho uthamiha uwonya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 5:1" />Isadaka cho uthamiha uwonya chikumihiyeke yakhalhaka: “Ntu riyoothe nowiihaniya wiipuwa wiira ahimiecheshe mwaha woonilhe awe ama wiiwa, ni uyo nkaakhota wuulhumacha ittu, paahi wowo phi uhilhoka, ni uyo noohukumulhiya ni utwarushiya.<verse eid="LEV 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 5:2" />“Ama yakhalhaka ntu riyoothe munlhokoni mwinyu honyalha wo iphiro chihinolhoka ulhapelha mmihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku wo uhichuwelha, wo uvara ittu iriyoothe yo unyalha, ikhalhe ntembo wo mwannama o mwiithuphini ama o uhuwiya ama ashimwettu o wiipurulha, nookhalha ntu o utteka.<verse eid="LEV 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 5:3" />“Ama, ntu avaraka ittu iriyoothe yo unyalha inokhuma mwiiruttuni mwa ntu, ikhalhe iriyoothe inooria unnyalhiha, vanohalha awe uchuwelha vawo nookhalha ntu o utteka.<verse eid="LEV 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 5:4" />“Tho, yakhalhaka ntu noolhupelha upanga ittu iriyoothe, yoombone ama yo uhilhoka, wo uhupuwelha thoko, vanohalha awe uchuwelha vawo, nookhalha ntu o utteka.<verse eid="LEV 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 5:5" />“Paahi ntu vanotteka awe chittu chinaacha chechiyo miaha chiyo, noothananiya wiira arumelhelhe uwonya upannge awe uwo, <verse eid="LEV 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 5:6" />ni uyo awiiheke wa Apwiiya Nlhuku isadaka awe yo uthamiha utteka uwo. Wo nlhatu no uwonya upannge awe awiiheke ikhondoro nkholho ama ipuri nkholho inokhuma munkutironi mwawe, awe aakumiha isadaka yo uthamiha uwonya. Ni opochera ishaani anompangelha ittu yo umwathaaniha wo nlhatu wo uwonya wawe uwo.<verse eid="LEV 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 5:7" />“Nansho yakhalhaka kharina ikhondoro ama ipuri yo ukumiha isadaka yo uthamiha utteka wo nlhatu wo uwonya upannge awe, paahi aawiihereke Apwiiya Nlhuku ikhunda piilhi ama makhandi meelhi o machiya. Nimoka wo nlhatu wo isadaka yo uthamiha uwonya, ni nikina wo nlhatu no isadaka yo upahiya vamooroni. <verse eid="LEV 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 5:8" />Aawiiheke wo opochera ishaani, ni ayo opochera ishaani anookumiha nimoka nikhalhe isadaka yo uthamiha uwonya wo uchipulha ishiko aya wo uhitupulha muru aya. <verse eid="LEV 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 5:9" />Amichamichereke iphome aya mpararini mwo madhubahu ni iphome ikina inohalha yonkhaye arihelheke varii ikhalhelho yo madhubahu. Yeyo phi isadaka yo uthamiha uwonya. <verse eid="LEV 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 5:10" />Yamalhaka akumiheke no nayelhi nne ukhalha isadaka yo upahiya wo ulhikaana ni malheheriyo chinohimia aya. Opochera ishaani anompangelha yoyo ntu uyo ittu yo umwaathaniha wo nlhatu no uwonya wawe, ni uyo noohiyerera.<verse eid="LEV 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 5:11" />“Yakhalhaka kharina ikhunda piilhi ama makhandi o machiya meelhi o ukumiha isadaka yo uthamiha uwonya upannge aya, paahi, awiiheke iphepa ikilo imoka. Nansho hihelhe makhura mena ubani ukhalhawaya phi isadaka yo uthamiha uwonya. <verse eid="LEV 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 5:12" />Awiiheke wa opochera ishaani, ni ayo anookusha yeyo iphepa iyo nthatha nimoka ni upaha vachulhu madhubahu ukhalha yo wooniha wiira isadaka yonkhaye phi yawaya Apwiiya Nlhuku, thoko isadaka yo choolhia inokumihiya wa Apwiiya Nlhuku wo mooro. Yeyo phi isadaka yo uthamiha uwonya. <verse eid="LEV 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 5:13" />Paahi opochera ishaani anompangelha yoyo ntu uyo ittu yo waathanihiya wo nlhatu wo uwonya wawe, ni uyo noohiyereriya. Iphepa inohalha iyo inokhalha yawaya opochera ishaani thoko chinolheheriya vanaachiya isadaka yo choolhia.”<verse eid="LEV 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isadaka cho ulhivelhelhihera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 5:14" />Tho, Apwiiya Nlhuku aheerelha ashinna Musa wiira, <verse eid="LEV 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 5:15" />“Yakhalhaka ntu riyoothe nootteka ni uwonya wo uhichuwelha inaacha ukumiha chittu chitakatifu chinokumihiya wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, awiiheke ikhondoro ilhopwana ihiremanre ukhuma munkutironi mwawe. Inyuva mphimeke wo ulhikaana ni maphimelhiyo o isiliva anochuwania u Nihema Nitakatifu. Yeyo phi isadaka yo uthamiha utteka. <verse eid="LEV 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 5:16" />Wo uthepa yayo, yoyo ntu uyo alhiveke ihasara yonkhaye ikhumelhelhinhe awe inaacha chittu chitakatifu wo wuncherera mpatta mmoka wo mipatta mithanu chinothananiya, ni waavaha opochera ishaani chonkhaye. Paahi opochera ishaani ampangelheke ittu umwaathaniha wo nlhatu no wowo uwonya uwo wo yeyo ikhondoro ilhopwana irii isadaka yo uthamiha utteka iyo, ni uyo noohiyereriya.<verse eid="LEV 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 5:17" />“Yakhalhaka ntu riyoothe howonya wo uhichuwelha, wo uhiya uvarechesha malheheriyo ariyoothe a Apwiiya Nlhuku yoyo hotteka, ni uyo nootwarushiya wo utteka wawe uwo. <verse eid="LEV 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 5:18" />Vanochuwelha awe, awiiheke wa opochera ishaani ikhondoro ilhopwana ihiremanre ukhuma munkutironi mwawe, mwannama uyo alhikaanihiyaka ni isadaka yo mwannama o ulhivelhelhilhera utteka ilhe. Ni opochera ishaani anompangelha yoyo ntu uyo ittu yo waathanihiya wo uwonya uttekilhe awe, ni uyo noohiyereriya. <verse eid="LEV 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 5:19" />Yeyo phi isadaka yo ulhivelhelhihera milhatu cho uwonya, chittekilhe awe umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku.”<verse eid="LEV 5:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LEV 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 6:1" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeerelha ashinna Musa wiira, <verse eid="LEV 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 6:2" />“Yakhalhaka ntu riyoothe howonya wo waathepiacha amwaatamana awe vachulhu ittu yeeshiye imboote uwannyawe, ama, unthurulha ama umwaakha nkhunanawe, yoyo hotteka. <verse eid="LEV 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 6:3" />Ama uvitha ittu ya amwaatamana awe yaapotenre, eeraka wiira khoonne, ama noolhupelha wo woothacha wo ittu iriyoothe nkaaattekiha attu, yoyo hotteka. <verse eid="LEV 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 6:4" />Yoyo vanowonya awe munlhokoni mwo yayo, noothananiya wiira anhokolhoshereke mwanene ittu iyilhe awe ama ipantte awe wo waakha iyo, ama ittu yeesheriye awe imboote, ama ittu ya amwaatamana awe yaapotenre ni uyo nkaavitha, ama ittu iriyoothe ilhupenlhe awe wo woothacha. <verse eid="LEV 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 6:5" />Vanohalha uchuwelha utteka wawe vawo, anlhiveke mwanene uyo ittu yoothene ni wuncherera mpatta mmoka wo mipatta nthanu vachulhu waya, nihuku ninorweeha awe isadaka awe yo uthamiha utteka. <verse eid="LEV 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 6:6" />Yamalhaka awiiheke wa opochera ishaani ikhondoro ilhopwana ama ipuri ilhopwana ihiremanre, akumiheke wa Apwiiya Nlhuku isadaka yo uthamiha uwonya, inolhikaana ni ibei inothananiya u Nihema Nitakatifu wo mwannama o isadaka yo uthamiha utteka wawe. <verse eid="LEV 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 6:7" />Opochera ishaani anompangelha yoyo ntu uyo ittu yo waathanihiya umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, ni uyo noohiyereriya utteka wawe.”<verse eid="LEV 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Malheheriyo makina o isadaka cho upahiya mpaka uvia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 6:8" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeerelha ashinna Musa, <verse eid="LEV 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 6:9" />“Mwaavaheke Naharuni ni achishaana aya alha malheheriyo alha. Alha phi malheheriyo anaacha ukumihiya isadaka yo upahiya vamooroni. Isadaka yo upahiya vamooroni ikhalheke vamooroni vachulhu madhubahu uhiyu wonkhaye mpaka wichishu, ni mooro aya uthotheriyeke, upharelheke wo uhitiphia. <verse eid="LEV 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 6:10" />Washaakaru, opochera ishaani anawanre nkogo aya wo opochera ishaani, ikuwo yooteelha ni isuruwali fupi aya yo ikuwo yooteelha, akusheke itura yo isadaka ilhe ukhuma umadhubahuni ni weesha uchereshere madhubahu. <verse eid="LEV 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 6:11" />Tho, amalhaka vavawo, arulheke nkogo aya ni uwara nkina, arweeheke itura iyo vathe, uchereshere nikambi vakittu varumelhelhiye ni Apwiiya Nlhuku valhe. <verse eid="LEV 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 6:12" />Mooro wo madhubahu uyo uthepeke upharelha, uhitipihiye mena. Kila nihuku wichishu opochera ishaani athotherieke ikhuni vamooroni vawo ni vachulhu vaya vawo, eesheke isadaka yo upahiya iyo, ahinaaya upaha makhura o isadaka yo uwiiha mpuha. <verse eid="LEV 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 6:13" />Mooro unothananiya wiira uthepeke upharelha ikatema yoothe vachulhu madhubahu vawo wo uhitipihiya mena.<verse eid="LEV 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Malheheriyo makina anaacha isadaka cho choolhia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 6:14" />“Anottwara alha phi malheheriyo makina anaacha isadaka cho choolhia. Iyari i Naharuni phi o ukumiha isadaka wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, vachulhu madhubahu. <verse eid="LEV 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 6:15" />Ni mmoka a opochera ishaani ayo akusheke nthatha nimoka no iphepa yo isadaka yo choolhia vamoka ni makhura ni ubani wonkhaye ni urimeelhihiya vachulhu madhubahu thoko isehemu yo nuupusho, nihiriri naya ninowaachivelha Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 6:16" />Opochera ishaani Naharuni ni iyari aya, akusheke iphepa inohalha iyo ni ukoorosha nkatte wo uhihelhiya ihengedure. Alhelhieke untenjeni, u Nihema Nitakatifu. <verse eid="LEV 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 6:17" />Uhihelhiye ihengedure mena vanooshiya aya. Kihaavaha yeyo ukhuma isadaka chinokikumihera aya wo mooro. Thoko chiri aya isadaka chikina cho uthamiha uwonya ni cho uthamiha utteka, ni iyo phi isadaka itakatifu chinene. <verse eid="LEV 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 6:18" />Achishaana ashilhopwana a Naharuni phi vekha aya anophwanelhiya ulhia yeyo, ukhalhawaya yeyo phi yolhia yeeshiye wo nlhatu waya mahuku onkhaye, ukhuma isadaka chinokumiheriya Apwiiya Nlhuku wo mooro. Ntu riyoothe nkina nohalha uvara yeyo yolhia iyo, nookhalha ntakatifu.”<verse eid="LEV 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 6:19" />Tho, Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeerelha ashinna Musa wiira, <verse eid="LEV 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 6:20" />“Mwaahimerieke Naharuni ni achishaana aya ashilhopwana wiira, anoothananiya ukumiha wa Apwiiya Nlhuku ikilo imoka yo iphepa yo shilhia nihuku naya no uhikiya makhura ukhalha opochera ishaani, wichishu akumiheke nusu, ni uchechilho nusu ikina. <verse eid="LEV 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 6:21" />Yeyo iphepa iyo athakaniheke ni makhura ni wooshiya viikho nchikalaangoni. Yamalhaka, mmwiiheke inamianihiye ivipande vipande ni ukumihiya wa Apwiiya Nlhuku wo upahiya vamadhubahuni. Ni nihiriri no isadaka iyo ninowaachivelha Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 6:22" />Mwaamwana mwanlhopwana a Naharuni thanlhiye uvara ntheko wo Opochera ishaani Olhupalhe, akumiheke wa Apwiiya Nlhuku yeyo isadaka iyo. Yayo phi malheheriyo o mahuku o uhimalha, ni isadaka yonkhaye inoopahiya vamooroni mpaka uvia. <verse eid="LEV 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 6:23" />Isadaka iriyoothe yo choolhia ikumihiye ni opochera ishaani, inoopahiya yonkhaye, khinolhiya mena.”<verse eid="LEV 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Malheheriyo makina o isadaka cho uthamiha uwonya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 6:24" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeerelha ashinna Musa wiira, <verse eid="LEV 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 6:25" />“Mwaahimerieke Naharuni ni achishaana aya wiira anottwara alha phi malheheriyo anaacha isadaka yo uthamiha uwonya. Vakittu mwannama o isadaka yo upahiya vanohithelhiya awe, phi vavawo vanohalha uhithiya mwannama o isadaka yo uthamihiya uwonya. Yeyo phi isadaka itakatifu chinene. <verse eid="LEV 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 6:26" />Opochera ishaani anokumiha yeyo isadaka iyo phi nohalha ukhuura, untenjeni, u Nihema Nitakatifu. <verse eid="LEV 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 6:27" />Ntu ama ittu iriyoothe inohalha uvara yeyo inama iyo inookhalha itakatifu. Ikuwo iriyoothe inohalha umorelhiya ni iphome yo yeyo isadaka iyo, paahi yeyo ikuwo iyo ipuputtiyeke vakittu varumelhelhiye ni Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 6:28" />Iyoopwe inohalha uterekhelhiya yeyo inama iyo, inoopweshiya. Nansho yakhalhaka ivyombo chiyo cho shaba, paahi chinookuttiya ni uhapihiya ni maashi. <verse eid="LEV 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 6:29" />Kila nlhopwana o iyari ya opochera ishaani yeekha aya phinohiyeriya ulhia yeyo inama iyo, ukhalhawaya yeyo phi isadaka itakatifu chinene. <verse eid="LEV 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 6:30" />Nansho kila isadaka iriyoothe yo uthamiha uwonya iphome aya inowiihiya u Nihema Nitakatifu, wiira ilhapelhelhiye wo nlhatu no waathanihiya, inama aya ihikhuuriye, ipahiyeke vamooroni mpaka uvia.”<verse eid="LEV 6:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LEV 7" />
  <para style="s1">Malheheriyo makina o isadaka cho ulhivelhihera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 7:1" />“Alha anottwara alha phi malheheriyo anaacha isadaka yo ulhivelhihera milhatu cho utteka. Yeyo isadaka iyo itakatifu chinene. <verse eid="LEV 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 7:2" />Mwannama o isadaka yo uthamiha utteka noohithiya vakittu vanohithelhiya ashinama o isadaka cho urimeelhipahi aya, ni iphome aya inoohikiya urukureria madhubahu onkhaye. <verse eid="LEV 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 7:3" />Makhura aya onkhaye, anoothamihiya ni upahiya, yaani makhura o mwiilha ni makhura anokhunelha marupo. <verse eid="LEV 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 7:4" />Chiicho athamiheke imphio piilhi ni makhura aya vamoka ni ithayi yoombone ya ahapa. <verse eid="LEV 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 7:5" />Opochera ishaani anoopaha chechiyo chittu chiyo vachulhu madhubahu ukhalha isadaka chinokumihiya wa Apwiiiya Nlhuku wo mooro. Yeyo phi isadaka yo ulhivelhihera milhatu cho utteka. <verse eid="LEV 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 7:6" />Kila nlhopwana munlhokoni mwa achishaana a Naharuni vekha aya phi nothananiya ulhia yeyo isadaka iyo. Phi isadaka itakatifu chinene ni iyo ilhelhiyeke untenjeni, Nihema Nitakatifu.<verse eid="LEV 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 7:7" />“Malheheriyo o isadaka yo ulhivelhihera milhatu cho utteka, ni isadaka yo uthamiha uwonya, mamokaru. Opochera ishaani anopanga ittu yo waathanihiya phi nohalha ukusha inama yo isadaka iyo. <verse eid="LEV 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 7:8" />Opochera ishaani anokumiha isadaka yo upahiya inokumihiya ni ntu riyoothe, akusheke nrapalha no mwannama kumihiye isadaka uyo. <verse eid="LEV 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 7:9" />Isadaka iriyoothe yo choolhia yooshiye viikho ama waapeiya munsufuriyani ama nchikalaangoni inokhalha yawaya opochera ishaani anokumihera ayo. <verse eid="LEV 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 7:10" />Nansho kila isadaka yo choolhia, ihivinre viikho, ikhalhe yo uthakanihiya ni makhura ama yo uhithakanihiya, inookhalha yawaya iyari i Naharuni, ni onkhaye akawelhiyeke rata wo ulhikaana.<verse eid="LEV 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Malheheriyo makina o isadaka cho uwiiha mpuha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 7:11" />“Vano anottwara alha phi malheheriyo anaacha isadaka cho uwiiha mpuha, chinooria awe ntu ukumiha wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 7:12" />Yakhalhaka ntu nookumiha yeyo isadaka iyo unshukuru Nlhuku, paahi, awiiheke isadaka yo mwannama vamoka ni maandazi ahiheliye ihengedure ahikiye makhura o izeituni, ni mikatte cho uvevialha chihikiye makhura ni maandazi o iphepa yo shilhia ithakanihiye ni makhura o izeituni. <verse eid="LEV 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 7:13" />Vamoka ni yeyo isadaka awe yo uwiiha mpuha, yo unshukuru Nlhuku iyo, awiiheke ni maandazi ohelhiya ihengedure. <verse eid="LEV 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 7:14" />Ukhuma wo yayo maandazi o isadaka ayo, akumiheke wa Apwiiya Nlhuku niandazi nimoka ukhuma wo kila isadaka. Yayo maandazi ayo anookhalha awawe opochera ishaani nohika madhubahu iphome yo isadaka cho uwiiha mpuha uyo. <verse eid="LEV 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 7:15" />Inama yo yeyo isadaka yo uwiiha mpuha yo unshukuru Nlhuku iyo ikhuuriyeke nenno nihuku ninokumihiya aya nno, ihihalhihiye ata vakani mpaka wichishu.<verse eid="LEV 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 7:16" />“Nansho yakhalhaka yeyo isadaka yo waathanihiya iyo ishaani wa Nlhuku, ama yo uttuna ntu mwanene, ilhiyeke nenno nihuku ninokumihiya aya nno, ni ikina yahalhaka inowooria ulhiya nihuku no nayelhi. <verse eid="LEV 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 7:17" />Nansho inama iriyoothe yo yeyo isadaka iyo yahalhaka mpaka nihuku no neraru ipahiyeke vamooroni mpaka uvia. <verse eid="LEV 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 7:18" />Yakhalhaka inama iriyoothe yo isadaka yo uwiiha mpuha inookhuuriya nihuku no neraru, yeyo khinorumelhelhiya umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. Mena yeyo isadaka iyo khinopocheriya wo mahalha a ntu kumihilhe uyo. Yeyo inama iyo khinolhoka ni ntu nohalha ukhuura nootwarushiya wo uwonya wawe.<verse eid="LEV 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 7:19" />“Inama iriyoothe inovara ittu yo unyalha umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, ihikhuuriye, ipahiyeke vamooroni. Nansho attu onkhaye arii atakatifu, anowooria ukhuura yeyo inama ikumihiye isadaka yo waathanihiya wa Apwiiya Nlhuku iyo. <verse eid="LEV 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 7:20" />Nansho ntu riyoothe hinorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku, akhuuraka yeyo inama iyo, yoyo akhotiyeke ni attu awe. <verse eid="LEV 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 7:21" />Tho, ntu riyoothe novara ittu iriyoothe inyalhihiye, ama ittu yo unyalha yo mwiiruttuni mwa ntu, ama mwannama o unyalha, ama ittu iriyoothe yo unyalha, akhuuraka inama yo isadaka yo uwiiha mpuha ikumihiye wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, yoyo ntu uyo akhotiyeke ni attu awe.”<verse eid="LEV 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 7:22" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeerelha ashinna Musa tho wiira, <verse eid="LEV 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 7:23" />“Mwaahimerieke attu o Israeli wiira, nhilhie makhura o ing'ope ama o ikhondoro ama o ipuri. <verse eid="LEV 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 7:24" />Makhura o mwannama riyoothe khwilhe mwanene ama o mwannama eeviye ni mwannama o mwiithuphini anowooria weeshiya wo upangelhiya ittu ikina, nansho nhilhie mena. <verse eid="LEV 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 7:25" />Ntu riyoothe alhiaka makhura o mwannama kumihiye wa Apwiiya Nlhuku wo mooro, nookhotiya ni attu awe. <verse eid="LEV 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 7:26" />Tho, nhilhie mena iphome iriyoothe, ikhalhe yo mwaanuni ama yo mwannama vakittu variwoothe vanokhalha inyu. <verse eid="LEV 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 7:27" />Ntu riyoothe alhiaka iphome iriyoothe, nookhotiya ni attu aka.”<verse eid="LEV 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 7:28" />Tho, Apwiiya Nlhuku aheerelha ashinna Musa wiira, <verse eid="LEV 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 7:29" />“Mwaahimerieke attu o Israeli wiira, ntu riyoothe nowiiha isadaka yo uwiiha mpuha, nothananiya wiira awiiheke mpatta wo yeyo isadaka iyo, wooniha wo ikekhiaye wiira isadaka ya Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 7:30" />Aawiihereke wo miono chawe mwanene thoko isadaka yo upahiya wo mooro. Awiiheke makhura o mwannama vamoka ni ikidari inohalha awe upanga ittu yo wooniha wiira nokumiha wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 7:31" />Opochera ishaani apaheke mooro makhura onkhaye vachulhu madhubahu, nansho ikidari iyo inohalha ukhalha i Naharuni ni achishaana aya, opochera ishaani. <verse eid="LEV 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 7:32" />Mweto wo wiimonono wo utulhi wo mwannama o isadaka chinyu cho waathanihiya, mwaavaheke opochera ishaani. <verse eid="LEV 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 7:33" />Yoyo mweto uyo unokhalha wawawe opochera ishaani o iyari i Naharuni novara ntheko wo ukumiha iphome yo isadaka cho uwiiha mpuha ni makhura aya nenno nihuku nno. <verse eid="LEV 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 7:34" />Apwiiya Nlhuku ahaalhehera attu o Israeli wiira yeeshe vathotho ikidari ni mphanja o mwannama o isadaka chaya cho uwiiha mpuha wiira yaavahe opochera ishaani Naharuni ni iyari aya. Ukhalhawaya yeyo yeesheriye yayo opochera ishaani ayo mahuku onkhaye. <verse eid="LEV 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 7:35" />Yoyo phi mpatta weeshiye vathetho wo nlhatu ni Naharuni ni achishaana aya ukhuma isadaka chinaakumihera aya Apwiiya Nlhuku wo mooro, ukhuma nihuku neeshiye aya ukhalha opochera ishaani a Apwiiya Nlhuku.” <verse eid="LEV 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 7:36" />Yoyo phi mpatta wo isadaka waalhehenre aya Apwiiya Nlhuku wa attu o Israeli wiira aavaheke opochera ishaani, ukhalha phi mahalha aya o ntheko waya, nihuku vaahikiye aya makhura. Ni iyo inookhalha phi mahalha aya mahuku onkhaye.<verse eid="LEV 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 7:37" />Paahi yayo phi malheheriyo anaacha isadaka cho upahiya, isadaka yo choolhia, isadaka yo uthamiha uwonya, isadaka cho uthamiha utteka, isadaka cho uttukuriya ni isadaka cho uwiiha mpuha. <verse eid="LEV 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 7:38" />Yayo phi malheheriyo Apwiiya Nlhuku yaavahilhe aya ashinna Musa nihuku naalhehenre aya attu o Israeli umwaakoni Usinai nne, wiira yawiihere isadaka chaya uthakoni Usinai.<verse eid="LEV 7:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LEV 8" />
  <para style="s1">Weesheriya miono Naharuni ni achishaana aya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 29:1-37">Utt 29:1-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 8:1" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeerelha ashinna Musa, <verse eid="LEV 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 8:2" />“Mweehane Naharuni ni achishaana aya akumaane vakhiviru ni nlhako wo Nihema Nitakatifu, nkusheke ikuwo cho teelha, makhura o uhikiya, ing'ope yo isadaka yo uthamiha uwonya, ikhondoro chilhopwana piilhi, ni utingo wo mikatte chihihelhiye ihengedure. <verse eid="LEV 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 8:3" />Yamalhaka, mwaathothokaniheke attu o Israeli onkhaye vakhiviru ni nlhako wo Nihema Nitakatifu.” <verse eid="LEV 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 8:4" />Ashinna Musa nkayaapanga thoko chilheheriye aya ni Apwiiya Nlhuku, nkayathothokaniha nlhoko wonkhaye vakhiviru ni nlhako wo Nihema Nitakatifu.<verse eid="LEV 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 8:5" />Ashinna Musa nkayeerelha nlhoko wonkhaye wiira, “Inottwara ilha phi ittu Apwiiya Nlhuku alhehenre aya wiira ipangiye.” <verse eid="LEV 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 8:6" />Vavawo ashinna Musa nkayaawiiha Naharuni ni achishaana aya nkaarapiha maashi. <verse eid="LEV 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 8:7" />Yamalheke nkayaawariha Naharuni nkogo ni waattuka nchako, nkayaawariha ikanzu, nkayaawariha ni ikuwo yo ukhunelha ikhakacha ni waattuka nshipi uttaviye rata chinene, nnyununi mwaya. <verse eid="LEV 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 8:8" />Yamalheke vavawo, nkayeesha mwanrupa vakhakaachani va Naharuni ni munrupani mmo nkayaahelha, malhuku meelhi o uchuwelhiha mathananelho a Nlhuku aneehaniya Urimu ni Thumimu. <verse eid="LEV 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 8:9" />Nkayaawariha Naharuni mphumburu ni vahoolho wo yoyo mphumburu uyo nkayeesha nipambo no idhahabu, ittaji yo wooniha wiira aheesheriya miono, thoko Apwiiya Nlhuku chaalhehenre aya ashinna Musa.<verse eid="LEV 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 8:10" />Yamalheke tho, ashinna Musa nkayaakusha makhura o izeituni, nkayaahikahika mapuro alhe ni chittu chonkhaye chirii nhina mwaya nkayeeshera miono. <verse eid="LEV 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 8:11" />Nkayaanyunyihera makhura ayo vachulhu madhubahu mikwaha saba, nkayaahika makhura ni ikaruma chaya chonkhaye, inyipo ni ikhalhelho aya, wiira chirumelhelhiye umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 8:12" />Yamalhiheke vavawo ashinna Musa yahaamiinelha Naharuni makhura matakatifu mmuruni ni weeshera miono. <verse eid="LEV 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 8:13" />Baada yo vavawo, ashinna Musa nkayaawiiha achishaana a Naharuni nkayaawariha mikogo ni waattuka nchako nnyununi, ni nkayaawariha ikofiya thoko chilheheriye aya ni Apwiiya Nlhuku.<verse eid="LEV 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 8:14" />Nkayaawiiha n'dume no ing'ope yo isadaka yo uthamiha uwonya, ni ayo Naharuni ni achishaana aya nkayeesha miono chaya vachulhu muru wo yeyo ing'ope iyo. <verse eid="LEV 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 8:15" />Ashinna Musa nkayaahitha ing'ope iyo, nkayaakusha iphome nkayaahika urukureriha madhubahu wo nikokho naya, uttukuria. Yamalheke ahokusha iphome yaahanlhe, nkayaarihelha vathi wuuthi madhubahu yeesheriye aya miono wo nlhatu no isadaka yo waathanihiya. Wo upanga chiicho, ahotakatiha madhubahu ayo. <verse eid="LEV 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 8:16" />Nkayaakusha makhura onkhaye o mmaruponi, ithayi yoombone yo ahapa vamoka ni imphio chonkhaye cho piilhi ni makhura aya ni upaha vachulhu madhubahu. <verse eid="LEV 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 8:17" />Nansho inama yo yeyo ing'ope iyo, nrapalha naya ni mavi aya, ahopaha vamooroni mpaka uvia uchereshere nikambi thoko chilheheriye aya ni Apwiiya Nlhuku.<verse eid="LEV 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 8:18" />Yamalheke, ashinna Musa nkayaawiha ikhondoro ilhopwana yo isadaka yo upahiya. Naharuni ni achishaana aya nkayeesha miono chaya vamuruni wo ikhondoro iyo. <verse eid="LEV 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 8:19" />Nkayaahitha ikhondoro iyo, nkayaahika iphome iyo urukureriha madhubahu onkhaye. <verse eid="LEV 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 8:20" />Nkayaatupulhacha ikhondoro iyo, nkayaakusha nkayaapaha vamoka ni muru aya ni makhura aya. <verse eid="LEV 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 8:21" />Nansho ahinaaya upaha, ashinna Musa ahohapiha marupo ni mieto cho utulhi wo maashi, nkayaapaha chonkhaye vachulhu madhubahu vamoka ni inama ikina cho yeyo ikhondoro iyo ukhalha isadaka yo upahiya thoko chilheheriye aya ni Apwiiya Nlhuku. Yeyo isadaka yo nihiriri noombone inokumihiya wo mooro iyo yahaateelhiha Apwiiya Nlhuku.<verse eid="LEV 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 8:22" />Yamalheke, ashinna Musa ahowiiha ikhondoro ilhopwana ikina, wo nlhatu no weesheriya miono ukhalha opochera ishaani. Naharuni ni achishaana aya nkayeesha miono chaya vamuruni wo yeyo ikhondoro iyo. <verse eid="LEV 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 8:23" />Nkayaahitha, ni ukusha iphome yo yeyo ikhondoro iyo ni waahika Naharuni nnyaru naya no wiimonono, nikhoko nulhupalhe no moono aya wo wiimonono ni nikokho nulhupalhe no mweto aya wo wiimonono. <verse eid="LEV 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 8:24" />Achishaana a Naharuni nkayaawacha, ni ashinna Musa yahaahika iphome inyaru chaya cho wiimonono, makokho aya molhupalhe o miono chaya cho wiimonono ni makokho aya molhupalhe o mieto chaya cho wiimonono. Nkayaamichamicha iphome ikina yaahanlhe iyo mipata chonkhaye cho madhubahuni. <verse eid="LEV 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 8:25" />Yamalheke, ahokusha makhura onkhaye, mwiilha vamoka ni makhura aya, makhura onkhaye anokunelha marupo, ithayi yoombone ya ahapa vamoka ni imphio cho piilhi chonkhaye makhura aya ni mphanja wo mweto wo wiimonono wo utulhi o yeyo ikhondoro ilhopwana iyo. <verse eid="LEV 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 8:26" />Yamalheke, ahokusha utingo wo mikatte weeshiye umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayaakumiha nkatte mmoka uhihelhiye ihengedure, nkatte mmoka urii ni makhura ni nkatte mmoka wo uvevialha, nkayeesha chonkhaye vachulhu mafungu o makhura ni vachulhu mweto ulhe. <verse eid="LEV 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 8:27" />Nkayeesha choolhia chonkhaye chiyo mmathathani mwa Naharuni ni achishaana aya, ni ayo nkayaathesha wooniha wiira ahaakumihera isadaka Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 8:28" />Yamalheke ashinna Musa ahokusha chittu chonkhaye chiyo ukhuma mmathathani mwa yayo manyaattu ayo ni upaha vamooroni vachulhu madhubahu vamoka ni isadaka yo upahiya. Ilha phi yaari isadaka yo weesheriya miono, irii ni nihiriri ninaateelhiha Apwiiya Nlhuku, isadaka inokumihiya wo mooro. <verse eid="LEV 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 8:29" />Tho, ahokusha ikidari ilhe ni utheesha, wooniha phi ittu yo waakumihera Apwiiya Nlhuku isadaka. Yeyo inama yo ikhondoro ilhopwana yo weesheriya miono iyo phi yawaya ashinna Musa thoko chaalheheriye aya ni Apwiiya Nlhuku.<verse eid="LEV 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 8:30" />Yamalheke ashinna Musa nkayaakusha makhura matakatifu ni iphome ukhuma vamadhubahuni, nkayaamichera Naharuni ni achishaana aya chiicho ni ikuwo chaya. Wo chiichammo etu ashinna Musa nkayeeshera miono Naharuni ni achishaana aya vamoka ni ikuwo chaya.<verse eid="LEV 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 8:31" />Ashinna Musa nkayeerelha Naharuni ni achishaana aya, thoko chilheheriye aya na Apwiiya Nlhuku wiira, “Mwaapieke inama iyo vakhiviru ni nlhako wo Nihema Nitakatifu, nkhurelheke vakhiviru ni nlhako vawo vamoka ni nkatte urii nkikapuni mwo isadaka cho uweesheriya miono mmo. Mpangeke thoko chilheheriye aka ni Apwiiya Nlhuku, wiira yeyo isadaka iyo inaalhiyeke ni Naharuni ni achishaana aya. <verse eid="LEV 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 8:32" />Mpaheke vamooroni inama iriyoothe ama nkatte uriyoothe unohalha uhalha uyo. <verse eid="LEV 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 8:33" />Nhikhume vathe, muntenjeni mwo Nihema Nitakatifu wo mahuku saba onkhaye, yaani mpaka ikatema inyu yo weesheriya miono vanohalha aya umalha. <verse eid="LEV 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 8:34" />Apwiiya Nlhuku aholhehera wiira nipangeke thoko chipannge ihu lhelho wiira nuupangelheni ittu yo uhiyereriya uwonya winyu. <verse eid="LEV 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 8:35" />Nkhalheke untenjeni wo Nihema Nitakatifu vakhiviru ni nlhako vawo uthana ni uhiyu mahuku saba, ni upangacha chittu chilhehenre aya Apwiiya Nlhuku. Mwaahipangeke chiicho nnookhwa, chiichammo phi lheheriye aka ni Apwiiya Nlhuku.”<verse eid="LEV 8:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 8:36" />Paahi, Naharuni ni achishaana aya nkayaapangacha chittu chonkhaye Apwiiya Nlhuku chaalhehenre aya ashinna Musa.<verse eid="LEV 8:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LEV 9" />
  <para style="s1">Naharuni ni achishaana aya anookumiha isadaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 9:1" />Nihuku no nane baada yo uvira mahuku saba o weesheriya miono, ashinna Musa yaheehana Naharuni ni achishaana aya vamoka ni ashulhupalhe o attu o Israeli. <verse eid="LEV 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 9:2" />Ashinna Musa nkayeerelha Naharuni, “Munkusheke mwaang'ope nlhopwana wo nlhatu wo isadaka yo uthamiha uwonya ni ikhondoro ilhopwana wo nlhatu wo isadaka yo upahiya, ni ashinama onkhaye ayo ahikhalhe o uremara. Mwamalhihaka mwaakumiheke isadaka umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 9:3" />Yamalhakaru, mwaahimerieke attu o Israeli wiira akusheke ipuri ilhopwana imoka wo nlhatu wo isadaka yo uthamiha uwonya, ni ing'ope imoka ni mwaakhondoro mmoka onkhaye o iyaakha imoka ni ayo ahikhalhe oremara, wo nlhatu wo isadaka yo upahiya vamooroni. <verse eid="LEV 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 9:4" />Tho, nkusheke ing'ope ilhopwana imoka ni ikhondoro ilhopwana imoka wo nlhatu wo isadaka cho uwiiha mpuha, yaakumihere isadaka Apwiiya Nlhuku, vamoka ni isadaka yo choolhia chithakanihiye ni makhura ukhalhawaya lhelho Apwiiya Nlhuku anowaakhumelhelha.”<verse eid="LEV 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 9:5" />Attu o Israeli nkayaawiiha chonkhaye chiyo untenjeni wo Nihema Nitakatifu thoko chaalhehenre aya ashinna Musa. Ni nlhoko wonkhaye nkawarwaa ni weemelha umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 9:6" />Baada yo vavawo, ashinna Musa nkayeera, “Ilha phi ittu Apwiiya nlhuku yaalhehenre aya wiira mpange wiira nthimicho aya woonie uwannyu mwaatti.”<verse eid="LEV 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 9:7" />Ni yamalheke vavawo, ashinna Musa nkayeerelha Naharuni, “Nrwee umadhubahuni, mwaakumihe vavawo isadaka inyu yo uthamiha uwonya ni isadaka inyu yo upahiya, ni yo waathanihiya mwaanene, ni wa attu o Israeli. Mwamalhihaka, nkumiheke vavawo isadaka cha attu ni waapangelha ittu yo waathanihiya thoko chilhehenre aya Apwiiya Nlhuku.”<verse eid="LEV 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 9:8" />Paahi, Naharuni nkayaatameria madhubahu, nkayanhitha mwaang'ope akuminhe aya akhalhe isadaka yo uthamiha uwonya waya anene ilhe. <verse eid="LEV 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 9:9" />Achishaana aya nkayaawiihera iphome, ni ayo nkayaahika nikokho naya mphomeni mmo ni uhikahika urukureriha madhubahu. Iphome yaahanlhe iyo nkayaarihelha wuuthi madhubahu. <verse eid="LEV 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 9:10" />Nansho nkayaapaha makhura ni imphioo ni makhura anokhuneelha ahapa, vachulhu madhubahu thoko Apwiiya Nlhuku chaalhehenre aya ashinna Musa. <verse eid="LEV 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 9:11" />Nansho inama ni nrapalha aapanhe vamooroni uchereshere nikambi.<verse eid="LEV 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 9:12" />Yamalheke, Naharuni nkayaahitha ikhondoro ilhopwana yo isadaka yo upahiya ilhe. Achishaana aya nkayaachinga iphome ni waawiihera, ni ayo nkayaanyunyihera madhubahu mipata chonkhaye. <verse eid="LEV 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 9:13" />Yamalheke, nkayaawiihera isadaka yo upahiya ikipande imoka imoka ni muru, ni ayo nkayaapahera vachulhu madhubahu. <verse eid="LEV 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 9:14" />Nansho ahinaaya upaha, ahohapiha marupo ni mieto, amalhihekeru, ahopaha vamoka ni isadaka yo upahiya ilhe vamadhubahuni.<verse eid="LEV 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 9:15" />Yamalheke, Naharuni nkayaawiiha isadaka yo milhatu cha attu ilhe. Nkayaakusha ipuri yo isadaka yo uthamiha uwonya wa attu, nkayaahitha ni ukumiha isadaka yo uthamiha uwonya, thoko chaapannge aya wo ilhe yo mpacho ilhe. <verse eid="LEV 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 9:16" />Yamalheke ahowiiha isadaka yo upahiya yo mwannama, nkayanhitha ni unkumiha isadaka thoko Apwiiya Nlhuku chaalhehenre aya. <verse eid="LEV 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 9:17" />Yamalheke vavawo, nkayaawiiha isadaka yo choolhia, nkayaachariha ikibaba imoka ni upaha vachulhu madhubahu vamoka ni isadaka yo upahiya yo kila wichishu. <verse eid="LEV 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 9:18" />Ni yamalheke, Naharuni nkayaahitha chiicho ing'ope ilhopwana ni ikhondoro ilhopwana yo isadaka cho uwiiha mpuha wo nlhatu wo attu. Achishaana aya nkayaawiihera iphome nkayaanyunyihera madhubahu onkhaye. <verse eid="LEV 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 9:19" />Makhura o ing'ope ilhopwana iyo ni o ikhondoro ilhopwana, mwiilha wo ikhondoro, makhura anokhunelha marupo, imphio ni ithayi yoombone ya ahapa, <verse eid="LEV 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 9:20" />nkayeesha vachulhu ikidari, nkayaarweha umadhubahuni. Ni Naharuni nkayaapaha makhura ayo vachulhu madhubahu. <verse eid="LEV 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 9:21" />Nansho ikidari chilhe ni mweto wo utulhi wo wiimonono, chechiyo Naharuni ahokusha nkayaapanga phi ittu yo wooniha wiira ihokumihiya wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, thoko chaalheheriye aya ashinna Musa.<verse eid="LEV 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 9:22" />Naharuni amalhihekeru ukumiha isadaka chonkhaye, isadaka cho uthamiha uwonya, isadaka cho upahiya ni isadaka cho uwiiha mpuha, ahaapungelha attu miono, nkayaavaha ibarakha, yamalhiheke ahokhuruwa ukhuma umadhubahuni uwo. <verse eid="LEV 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 9:23" />Yamalhekeru, ashinna Musa ni Naharuni nkayaakelha u Nihema Nitakatifu, yakhumeke nkayaavaha attu ibarakha, ni nthimicho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku nkawoonia wa attu onkhaye. <verse eid="LEV 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 9:24" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayaakurusha mooro nkawaapaha isadaka yo upahiya ni makhura yaari vachulhu madhubahu. Attu onkhaye yoonilhe yoyo mooro uyo yahokhuwelha wo uteelhiya nrima ni wooroma waathimicha Apwiiya Nlhuku.<verse eid="LEV 9:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LEV 10" />
  <para style="s1">Uwonya wa Naadabu ni Naabihu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 10:1" />Ni ayo Naadabu ni Abihu, achishaana a Naharuni, yahokusha kila mmoka inyipo awe yo upahera ubani, nkayaahelha mooro ni ubani, nkayaakumihera Apwiiya Nlhuku mooro uhinorumelhelhiya, wahaalheheriye ni Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 10:2" />Paahi vavawo vavawo, mooro waakhuma wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, wahokhuruwa, nkawaapaha yayo ashimirawo ayo, nkayaakhwacha. <verse eid="LEV 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 10:3" />Paahi vavawo ashinna Musa nkayeerelha Naharuni, “Wo ulha mwaha ulha Apwiiya Nlhuku ahowoonihani maana o alhe malhove yaahimmie aya alhe wiira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LEV 10:3">‘Kinowiichoniha wiira mi ki ntakatifu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LEV 10:3">variyari wo alhe arii vakhiviru ni mi alhe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LEV 10:3">ni attu onkhaye anookithimicha mii!’ ”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="LEV 10:3">Naharuni nkayaamaalha yii.<verse eid="LEV 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 10:4" />Paahi ashinna Musa nkayeehana Namishaeli ni Naelisafani, achishaana a Nauzieli, athumwanaya aakani Naharuni, nkayeerelha awe athamihe mitembo cha achihima aya va Nihema Nitakatifu vawo, arweehe uchereshere nikambi. <verse eid="LEV 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 10:5" />Paahi ahowaacha nkayaakusha mitembo cha achihima aya ni urweeha uchereshere nikambi, uno bado chinari ni ikuwo chaawanre aya, thoko ashinna Musa chaalhehenre aya.<verse eid="LEV 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 10:6" />Yamalheke ashinna Musa nkayeerelha Naharuni ni achishaana aya, Eleazari ni Ithamari wiira, “Nhihiye uvacha ikharari chinyu ni mena nhaahulhache ikuwo chinyu. Mwapangaka chiicho nnookhwa ni wiithapaniha, ni waarusha Apwiiya Nlhuku. Nansho ashilhoko inyu yaani nlhoko wonkhaye wo attu o Israeli, onlheke wo nlhatu no ulha mooro ukurushilhe aya Apwiiya Nlhuku ulha. <verse eid="LEV 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 10:7" />Nhikhume untenjeni, vathe wo Nihema Nitakatifu, mweeraka chiicho nnookhwa, ukhalhawaya inyuva nhohikiya makhura a Apwiiya Nlhuku.” Naharuni ni achishaana aya nkayaapangacha thoko ashinna Musa chaahimmie aya.<verse eid="LEV 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ikano wa attu opochera ishaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 10:8" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeerelha Naharuni wiira, <verse eid="LEV 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 10:9" />“Vanokelha inyu Nihema Nitakatifu, inyuva ni achishaana inyu nhiwurie idivai mena utheka uriyoothe, mweeraka chiicho nnookhwa. Yeyo phi nohalha ukhalha ikano yo mahuku o uhimalha mwi iyari inyu yonkhaye. <verse eid="LEV 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 10:10" />Mmwalhaaniheke chittu chitakatifu ni chittu chihirii chitakatifu, chittu chinorumelhelhiya, ni chittu chihinorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 10:11" />Mweettuchiheke attu o Israeli malheheriyo onkhaye aavahilhe aka ashinna Musa wiira ohimerieni.”<verse eid="LEV 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 10:12" />Ashinna Musa nkayeerelha Naharuni ni achishaana aya yaahanlhe, Eleazari ni Ithamari wiira, “Nkushacheke iphepa ihanlhe ukhuma isadaka inokumiheriya Apwiiya Nlhuku wo mooro ilhe, nkoorosheke nkatte wo uhihelhiya ihengedure, nlhelhieke vamadhubahuni vawo, ukhalhawaya phiri itakatifu chinene. <verse eid="LEV 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 10:13" />Nlhieke vakittu varii vatakatifu ukhalhawaya yeyo phi mpatta inyu ni iyari inyu, ukhuma isadaka chinokumiheriya aya Apwiiya Nlhuku wo mooro. Ukhalhawaya phi chiichammo chilheeheriye aka. <verse eid="LEV 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 10:14" />Nansho inyuva ni achishaana inyu nkhuureke ikidari ni mphanja chinotheeshiya wooniha wiira chihokumihiya isadaka wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. Nkhuurelheke vakittu varumelhelhiye umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, inyuva ni achishaana inyu ashilhopwana ni ashithiyana. Nhovahiya chechiyo ukhalha mpatta inyu ni wo iyari inyu, chinokhuma isadaka cho uwiiha mpuha cha attu o Israeli. <verse eid="LEV 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 10:15" />Mweto wo utulhi ni ikidari chikumihiye isadaka yo utheeshiya inokumihiya wa Apwiiya Nlhuku chiyo, awiiheke vamoka ni isadaka cho makhura a ashinama chinokumihiya wo mooro wiira chiteeshiye wooniha wiira chinokumihiya wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. Chechiyo chinookhalha chawinyu vamoka ni achishaana inyu, mahuku onkhaye thoko Apwiiya Nlhuku chikilhehenre aya.”<verse eid="LEV 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 10:16" />Paahi, ashinna Musa nkayaakoherera rata mwaha unaacha ipuri imoka ikumihiye isadaka yo uthamiha uwonya, paahi nkayoona wiira ihopahiya. Paahi nkayaarushiya ni waathunalhelha chinene Naeleazari ni Naithamari, achishaana a Naharuni ahanlhe. Nkayaakoha, <verse eid="LEV 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 10:17" />“Nlhatu waani wo ukhuurelha isadaka vakittu vahinorumelhelhiya ni Apwiiya Nlhuku? Yeyo isadaka itakatifu chinene, Apwiiya Nlhuku oovahilheni yeyo wiira ithamihe milhatu cho uwonya cha attu ni waathanihiya ni Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 10:18" />Tho, ukhalhawaya iphome aya kiwiihiye u Nihema Nitakatifu, wo ikekhiaye mwaathananiye wiira nlhelhieke muntenjeni u Nihema Nitakatifu thoko chaalhehenre aka.”<verse eid="LEV 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 10:19" />Naharuni nkayeerelha ashinna Musa, “Mwooneke, achishaana aka ahokumiha isadaka chaya cho uthamiha uwonya ni cho upahiya umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, nansho inakhalhaka chiicho mwaha thoko ulha uhokipatta mii! Chani, Apwiiya Nlhuku aanokirumelhelha yakaari kaholhia isadaka yo uthamiha uwonya ilhe lhelho nna va?” <verse eid="LEV 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 10:20" />Ashinna Musa yeeweke yayo malhove ayo, ahorumelhelha.<verse eid="LEV 10:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LEV 11" />
  <para style="s1">Ashinama anolhoka ukhuuriya ni ashinama ahinolhoka ukhuuriya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 14:3-21">Itor 14:3-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 11:1" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeerelha ashinna Musa ni Naharuni wiira, <verse eid="LEV 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 11:2" />“Mwaahimerieke attu o Israeli wiira, mwaakhureke ashinama onkhaye o velhaponi, <verse eid="LEV 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 11:3" />ni munlhokoni mwa ashinama onkhaye o velhaponi ayo, nhovahiya ashinama o inyaa cho uparuwa mipata miilhi, ni ashinama anochukhulha wiira mwaakhuure.<verse eid="LEV 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 11:4" />“Inakhalhaka chiicho, nhinkhuure mwannama riyoothe nochukhulha nansho inyaa chawe khachiparuwilhe mipata miilhi, ama homiania inyaa chawe nansho khanochukhulha. Nhikhuure ingamiya ukhalhawaya inoochukhulha nansho inyaa chaya khachiparuwilhe mipata miilhi, uwannyu yeyo mwooneke ukhalha mwannama hivahiye inyu wiira munkhuure. <verse eid="LEV 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 11:5" />Nhinkhuure nnyapa, ukhalhawaya noochukhulha nansho inyaa chawe khachiparuwilhe, yoyo khanorumelhelhiya umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 11:6" />Nhinkhuure hukulha, yoyo noochukhulha nansho kharina inyaa cho uparuwa, yoyo khanorumelhelhiya umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 11:7" />Mena nhikhuure ikulhuwe, inakhalhaka ihanaa inyaa chihoparuwa nansho khinochukhulha, yeyo khinorumelhelhiya umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 11:8" />Ukhalhawaya yayo ashinama ayo khanorumelhelhiya umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, nhikhuure inama aya mena ni wala nhivare mitembo chaya.<verse eid="LEV 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 11:9" />“Ihopa chiriyoothe cho ubaharini ama cho umwoolhokoni chirii ni mapezi ni makakahapa, chechiyo nkhuureke. <verse eid="LEV 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 11:10" />Nansho ittu iriyoothe inokhalha ubaharini ama umwoolhokoni, ihirii ni mapezi ni makakahapa, yaani chuupiye chonkhaye chinolhokelha mmaashini ni chuupiye chikina chonkhaye chinokhalha mmaashini chechiyo nsheru uwannyu, khachinorumelhelhiya umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 11:11" />Chechiyo cho wuupiya chiyo nsheru uwannyu, khachinorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku. Nhilhie inama aya, mena nhivare mitembo chaya mahuku onkhaye o uhimalha, chechiyo nsheru uwannyu mwaatti. <verse eid="LEV 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 11:12" />Yowuupiya iriyoothe inokhalha mmaashini ihirii ni mapezi ni makakahapa khinorumelhelhiya umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku.<verse eid="LEV 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 11:13" />“Tho, alha ashinuni onkhaye alha nsheru uwannyu, nhaakhuure, khanorumelhelhiya umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, iwuku, ampicha, ikipungu, <verse eid="LEV 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 11:14" />irumaachi ni makosho onkhaye o inaka, <verse eid="LEV 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 11:15" />makosho onkhaye a anakhuku, <verse eid="LEV 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 11:16" />imbuni, waanda, matipitipi, ashaaka, <verse eid="LEV 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 11:17" />achichi, minandi, achichi olhupalhe, <verse eid="LEV 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 11:18" />anthiki, miolholho, itumbusi, <verse eid="LEV 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 11:19" />ikorongo, ikoikoi, ahudihudi ni anlhema.<verse eid="LEV 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 11:20" />“Nhaakhuure ashimweettu onkhaye anovava, aneeta mieto micheshe, yayo nsheru uwannyu, khanorumelhelhiya umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 11:21" />Nansho ashimweettu akina ari ni mapupha, aneeta uno athupathuphaka vathi wo mieto micheshe, yayo mwaakhureke. <verse eid="LEV 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 11:22" />Munlhokoni mwo yayo ahaawo, kila nikosho no anashombe, makosho a achepuche, makosho o matetenka, ni kila nikosho no ichorope. <verse eid="LEV 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 11:23" />Nansho ashimweettu akina onkhaye o mapupha, anothupha ni o mieto micheshe yayo nsheru uwannyu, khanorumelhelhiya umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku.<verse eid="LEV 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 11:24" />“Ntu riyoothe nohalha uvara mitembo cha alha ashinama alha, khanorumelhelhiya umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. Ni ntu riyoothe nohalha uvara chechiyo mitembo chiyo, haavare attu akina mpaka uchechilho. <verse eid="LEV 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 11:25" />Ntu riyoothe nokusha mpatta wo mitembo cho yayo ashimweettu ayo, yoyo khanorumelhelhiya umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku mpaka uchechilho ni ikuwo chawe chipuputtiyeke. <verse eid="LEV 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 11:26" />Ntu riyoothe ammaraka mwannama rii ni mieto chiparuwilhe nansho khanochukhulha, yoyo khanorumelhelhiya umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku mpaka uchechilho. Ni ntu riyoothe akushaka mitembo chaya, apuputteke ikuwo chawe, ni uyo khanorumelhelhiya mpaka uchechilho. <verse eid="LEV 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 11:27" />Ashinama onkhaye aneeta ni inyaa chaya inakhalhaka ahanaa mieto micheshe, yayo nsheru uwannyu, khanorumelhelhiya umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. Ntu riyoothe nohalha uvara ntembo wo mwannama thoko yoyo khanorumelhelhiya umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. Ni uyo apuputteke ikuwo chawe ni ukhalha chiicho mpaka uchechilho. <verse eid="LEV 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 11:28" />Ntu riyoothe nohalha ukusha mitembo chaya khanorumelhelhiya umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. Ni uyo apuputteke ikuwo chawe, yayo nsheru uwannyu, ukhalhawaya khanorumelhelhiya umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku.<verse eid="LEV 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 11:29" />“Tho, nhaakhuure alha ashinama alha, ukhalhawaya khanorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku, Anahuwo, makhulhe, kila nikosho no anaakoko olhupalhe, <verse eid="LEV 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 11:30" />ing'oto chulhupalhe, anaakoko ashikani, achikhuvi ni mariiya. <verse eid="LEV 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 11:31" />Yayo onkhaye ayo nsheru uwannyu, khanorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku. Ni ntu riyoothe nohalha uvara mitembo chaya khanorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku, mpaka uchechilho. <verse eid="LEV 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 11:32" />Yakhalhaka ntembo wo chechiyo cho wuupiya chiyo unowulhuwelha ittu iriyoothe ikhalhe ittu yo mwiri ama ikuwo ama yo nrapalha ama yo niguniya ama ittu iriyoothe inotumika wo nlhatu uriyoothe, yeyo ittu iyo khinorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku mpaka uchechilho. Yathananiyaka wo ntheko uriyoothe tho, ihapihiyeke ni maashi. <verse eid="LEV 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 11:33" />Yakhalhaka ntembo aya uhowulhuwelha ittu yuupiye wo ulhoko, paahi, iriyoothe irii nhina yeyo ittu iyo khinorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku, ni yeyo ittu yo ulhoko iyo ipweshiyeke. <verse eid="LEV 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 11:34" />Yakhalhaka maashi ama yo uwuriya iriyoothe irii nhina yeyo ittu iyo yamorelhaka yolhia iriyoothe, khinorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku. Ni inyu nhilhie wala nhiwurie chechiyo ukhalhawaya ihokelha nsheru. <verse eid="LEV 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 11:35" />Kila ittu iwulhuwelhiye ni yoyo ntembo uyo khinorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku. Yakhalhaka ntanuru ama niikho, chikwanyulhiyeke. Khachinorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku, ni uwannyu mwaatti chiicho. <verse eid="LEV 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 11:36" />Ata inakhalhaka chiicho, ilhushi ama nrapo no maashi nitumbuchenre mwannama uyo, chinoorumelhelhiya umihoolho wa Nlhuku. Nansho ntu riyoothe novara ntembo uyo khanorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 11:37" />Yakhalhaka ntembo unoowulhuwelha imbeyu cho waalha, chechiyo imbeyu chiyo chinoorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 11:38" />Nansho yakhalhaka imbeyu chihoruweiya mmaashini wiira chimelhe ni induri iriyoothe yo ntembo nkayaawulhuwelha mwommo, paahi chechiyo imbeyu chiyo chihokelha nsheru, khachinorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku.<verse eid="LEV 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 11:39" />“Yakhalhaka mwannama riyoothe vahiye inyu wiira munkhuure, nowiikhwelha mwanene, ntu riyoothe nohalha uvara ntembo awe, hokelha nsheru mpaka uchechilho, khanorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 11:40" />Ntu riyoothe akhuuraka inama yo yoyo ntembo uyo ama akushaka, apuputteke ikuwo chawe ni uyo khanorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku mpaka uchechilho.<verse eid="LEV 11:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 11:41" />“Yowuupiya iriyoothe ineepurulha velhaponi va, khinorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku uwannyu, nhikhuure mena. <verse eid="LEV 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 11:42" />Ittu iriyoothe ineepurulha, ama ineeta wo mieto chonkhaye micheshe ama mieto chinchi, eiyo iriyoothe ineepurulha, nhikhuure mena, ukhalhawaya yeyo khinorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 11:43" />Paahi etu, nhiwe mwaakhalha ntu hinorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku, wo nlhatu no ukhuura chuupiye chineepurulha. <verse eid="LEV 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 11:44" />Ukhalhawaya mii Apwiiya Nlhuku phi Nlhuku inyu, mwiichesheke ni wiilhokiha wo iphiro chinorumelhelha aka, ukhalhawaya mii ki ntakatifu. <verse eid="LEV 11:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 11:45" />Ukhalhawaya mii Apwiiya Nlhuku phi mii kuuthaminheni ilhapo yo Umisri wiira kikhalhe Nlhuku inyu, paahi etu nkhalheke iphiro chinorumelhelha aka, ukhalhawaya mii ki ntakatifu.<verse eid="LEV 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 11:46" />“Yayo etu, phi malheheriyo anaacha mwaha wo ashinama, ashinuni ni cho wuupiya chonkhaye chirii chikumi chinokhalha mmaashini ni velhaponi, <verse eid="LEV 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 11:47" />wiira nchuwelhe umwalhaaniha iriyari, cho wuupiya chinorumelhelha aka ni chihinorumelhelha aka, chineera aka wiira chikhuuriye ama chihikhuuriye.”<verse eid="LEV 11:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LEV 12" />
  <para style="s1">Waattukuria manyaathiyana baada yo wiithaphulha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 12:1" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeerelha tho ashinna Musa wiira, <verse eid="LEV 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 12:2" />“Mwaahimerieke attu o Uisraeli wiira, nthiyana arupalhaka irukulhu, nkeethapulha mwaana mwanlhopwana, khanorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku, wo mahuku saba, wo ulhikaana ni mahuku anoona awe mweeri. <verse eid="LEV 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 12:3" />Nihuku no nane, yoyo mwaana uyo eenelhiyeke unyawo. <verse eid="LEV 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 12:4" />Yamalhakaru, anumwanawe athepeke ukhalha chiichammo wo mahuku makhumi mararu ni mararu. Yeyo ikatema iyo, ahivare mena ittu itakatifu mena ukelha vakittu vatakatifu mpaka vanohalha aya uttukuriya.<verse eid="LEV 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 12:5" />“Nansho yakhalhaka eethaphunlhe mwaana mwanthiyana, paahi, anookhalha chiicho wo majuma meelhi thoko chirii aya vanoona aya mweeri. Athepeke ukhalha mahuku makhumi sita ni sita, amalhihaka, vavawo phi nohalha aya uttukuriya wo nlhatu no iphome aya.<verse eid="LEV 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 12:6" />“Mahuku o uttukuriya wawe vanohalha aya utimira, ikhalhe nnyanre mwaana mwanlhopwana ama mwanthiyana, awiiheke wa opochera ishaani untenjeni u Nihema Nitakatifu, mwaakhondoro o iyaakha imoka wo nlhatu no isadaka yo upahiya ni nikhandi no ikhunda ama nchiya, wo nlhatu no isadaka yo uthamiha uwonya. <verse eid="LEV 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 12:7" />Opochera ishaani akumiheke wa Apwiiya Nlhuku ni waapangelha yayo anaamwaana ayo ittu yo waathanihiya umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. Wo chiichammo etu, yayo athiyana ayo anoottukuriya wo nlhatu no iphome aya. Yayo phi malheheriyo o uttwara anomwaacha nthiyana riyoothe neethaphulha mwaana mwanlhopwana ama mwanthiyana.<verse eid="LEV 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 12:8" />“Yakhalhaka kharina mwaakhondoro o unkumiha isadaka, paahi, awiiheke machiya meelhi ama makhandi meelhi o ikhunda, nimoka wo nlhatu no isadaka yo upahiya mpaka uvia, ni nikina wo nlhatu wo isadaka yo uthamiha uwonya. Opochera ishaani aapangelheke yayo anaamwaana ayo ittu yo waathanihiya, ni ayo anoottukuriya.”<verse eid="LEV 12:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LEV 13" />
  <para style="s1">Malheheriyo anaacha mareta o makutulha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 13:1" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeerelha ashinna Musa ni Naharuni alha malheheriyo alha wiira, <verse eid="LEV 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 13:2" />“Yakhalhaka ntu riyoothe noowiipiya ittu mwiiruttuni ama uvelhe ama nivaathelha mwiiruttuni mwawe, ireta thoko makutulha, paahi, awiihiyeke wa opochera ishaani Naharuni ama mmoka a achishaana aya rii opochera ishaani. <verse eid="LEV 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 13:3" />Opochera ishaani anoowehaweha vakittu varii ni ureta vawo, ni yakhalhaka ikharari cho vavawo vakittu vawo chihorukunuwa ukhalha chooteelha ni ureta ene wooniaka wiira nrapalha nihokelhiya ureta uri nhina, paahi yayo phi makutulha. Opochera ishaani amalhihaka ummwehaweha, paahi etu ahimiacheke wiira yoyo ntu uyo khanorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 13:4" />Nansho yakhalhaka nenno nivaathelha nno, nihoteelha, khanipothwenlhe, ni mena ikharari cho vavawo vakittu vawo khachinarukunuwa ukhalha chooteelha, paahi opochera ishaani amweesheke uchereshere yoyo ntu uyo wo mahuku saba. <verse eid="LEV 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 13:5" />Nihuku no saba, opochera ishaani ammweheke tho yoyo ntu uyo, oonaka wiira ureta uyo khunawanelha munrapalhani mwawe, paahi opochera ishaani amweesheke uchereshere yoyo ntu uyo wo mahuku makina saba. <verse eid="LEV 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 13:6" />Opochera ishaani ammwehaweheke tho yoyo ntu uyo nihuku no saba. Yakhalhaka vakittu vo ureta valhe vahowalhawalha ni ureta khunawanelha, paahi, opochera ishaani anhimiacheke yoyo ntu uyo wiira hooniye wiira khanorumelhelhiya, waari uvelhe tu. Ni yoyo ntu uyo etu, apuputteke ikuwo chawe ni uyo noorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 13:7" />Nansho yakhalhaka yayo mavaathelha ayo anoowanelha munrapalhani mwawe baada yo wiichooniha wa opochera ishaani wo nlhatu no uhimiachiya wiira horumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku, arweeke tho wa opochera ishaani. <verse eid="LEV 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 13:8" />Opochera ishaani ammwehaweheke tho, ni yakhalhaka mavaathelha alhe ahowanelha munrapalhani, paahi, opochera ishaani anhimiacheke yoyo ntu uyo wiira khanorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku, ukhalhawaya yayo makutulha.<verse eid="LEV 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 13:9" />“Yakhalhaka ntu hokelhiya makutulha, awiihiyeke wa opochera ishaani, <verse eid="LEV 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 13:10" />anohalha ummwehaweha. Ni yakhalhaka ihaawo yo wiipa yo teelha irukunushilhe ikharari chawe ukhalha chooteelha ni yeyo yo wiipa iyo ihophulhia ni ukhalha nikhwata nikithi, <verse eid="LEV 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 13:11" />yayo phi makutulha o mahuku menchi ni opochera ishaani anhimiacheke yoyo ntu uyo wiira khanorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku. Khuuwo nlhatu wo umweesha tho yoyo ntu uyo uchereshere ukhalhawaya hoonia makutulha.<verse eid="LEV 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 13:12" />“Ni yakhalhaka ureta uhommara ni ummwanelha iruttu yonkhaye, ukhuma vattomelhani mpaka unyaani thoko chinohalha aya woona opochera ishaani, <verse eid="LEV 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 13:13" />ni urukunusha nrapalha nawe ukhalha nooteelha, inowooniha wiira ureta uholhama. Paahi, opochera ishaani anhimiacheke yoyo ntu uyo wiira kharina ureta uyo, apocheriyeke munlhokoni mwa attu awe. <verse eid="LEV 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 13:14" />Nansho nooniaka nikhwata nikithi variwoothe mwiiruttuni mwo yoyo ntu uyo, ahimiachiyeke wiira khanorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 13:15" />Opochera ishaani ammwehaweheke nikhwata nno. Nooniaka nikhwata nikithi anhimiacheke wiira khanorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku, ukhalhawaya yayo makutulha. <verse eid="LEV 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 13:16" />Nansho nenno nikhwata nno nalhamaka ni ukhalha nooteelha, yoyo ntu uyo ahokolhieke tho wa opochera ishaani. <verse eid="LEV 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 13:17" />Opochera ishaani ammwehaweheke, ni yoonaka wiira nihorukunuwa ukhalha nooteelha, paahi, anhimiacheke yoyo ntu uyo wiira hokhalha oombone wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku.<verse eid="LEV 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 13:18" />“Yakhalhaka ntu riyoothe aheepiya nipotte ni nno niholhama, <verse eid="LEV 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 13:19" />nansho vakittu vaari aya nipotte vahorukunuwa ukhalha yo wiipa yoteelha ama ukhalha yo khwiilha nansho vooteelha vakani, ooniheke opochera ishaani. <verse eid="LEV 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 13:20" />Opochera ishaani ammweheke yoyo ntu uyo. Yoonaka wiira ureta uhokelha nhina, ni ikharari cho vavawo vakittu vawo chihorukunuwa ukhalha cho teelha, paahi opochera ishaani anhimiacheke yoyo ntu uyo wiira khanorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku, yoyo phi ureta wo makutulha ukhumelhenlhe wo nlhatu no nipotte. <verse eid="LEV 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 13:21" />Nansho yakhalhaka opochera ishaani ahommwehaweha yoyo ntu uyo ni woona wiira ikharari cho vavawo vakittu vawo kachihiwe chooteelha ni mena khavapothwenlhe, nansho vahowiira uwalhawalha, paahi amweesheke uchereshere yoyo ntu uyo wo mahuku saba. <verse eid="LEV 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 13:22" />Yakhalhaka baada yo yayo mahuku ayo ureta uyo unoowanelha munrapalhani, opochera ishaani anhimiacheke yoyo ntu uyo wiira ooniyeke honanara, vavawo vakittu vawo vahokelhiya ureta. <verse eid="LEV 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 13:23" />Nansho yakhalhaka ureta khunawanelha, paahi nenno nrottelha no nipotte. Opochera ishaani anhimiacheke yoyo ntu uyo wiira horumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku.<verse eid="LEV 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 13:24" />“Ama yakhalhaka vahawo vakittu vaviilhee ni inama aya ihorukunuwa ukhalha yokhwiilha ni yoteelha, ama yooteelha, <verse eid="LEV 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 13:25" />opochera ishaani awehaweheke. Yakhalhaka anowoona wiira ikharari chihorukunuwa ukhalha chooteelha ni ureta uhokelha nhina, paahi yayo makutulha. Yayo makutulha ayo akhumelhenlhe wo nlhatu no vakittu vaviilhe. Opochera ishaani anhimiacheke yoyo ntu uyo wiira khanorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku, ukhalhawaya haanaa ureta wo makutulha. <verse eid="LEV 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 13:26" />Nansho yakhalhaka opochera ishaani anowoona wiira ikharari cho vavawo vakittu vawo kachihiwe chooteelha ni ureta khunakelha nhina, nansho vahowalhawalha, paahi, opochera ishaani amweesheke yoyo ntu uyo uchereshere wo mahuku saba. <verse eid="LEV 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 13:27" />Nihuku no saba opochera ishaani ammweheke, yakhalhaka ureta uhowanelha tho munrapalhani, paahi, anhimiacheke yoyo ntu uyo wiira khanorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku, ukhalhawaya hokelhiya ni ureta wo makutulha. <verse eid="LEV 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 13:28" />Nansho, yakhalhaka nivaathelha nne khaniwanenlhe, nansho nihowalhawalha, vahowiiraka wiipa ukhumelhenlhe wo nlhatu no uvia, paahi, opochera ishaani anhimiacheke yoyo ntu uyo wiira noorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku, ukhalhawaya nenno nrottelha nno no uvia.<verse eid="LEV 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 13:29" />“Yakhalhaka ntu riyoothe nlhopwana ama nthiyana haanaa nikhwata mmuruni ama vairorini, <verse eid="LEV 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 13:30" />opochera ishaani awehaweheke yoyo ureta uyo. Yakhalhaka opochera ishaani anowoona wiira ureta uhokelha nhina ni ikharari cho manjano ni cho uyevayeva, paahi anhimiacheke yoyo ntu uyo wiira khanorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku, ukhalhawaya yoyo uvelhe ni ayo makutulha o mmuruni ama o vairorini. <verse eid="LEV 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 13:31" />Nansho yakhalhaka opochera ishaani anowoona wiira ureta khunakelha nhina, ni ikharari khachiriipilhe, paahi opochera ishaani amweesheke yoyo ntu uyo uchereshere mahuku saba. <verse eid="LEV 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 13:32" />Nihuku no saba opochera ishaani aweheke nikhwata nne. Yakhalhaka nikhwata nno khaninawanelha ni khachiwo ikharari chirii cho manjano mena khuuwo uvelhe uriyoothe vavawo vakittu vawo, <verse eid="LEV 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 13:33" />paahi yoyo ntu uyo owulheke ikharari ama irori chawe. Nansho huuwulhe vakittu varii ni uvelhe vawo. Yamalhaka opochera ishaani amweesheke yoyo ntu uyo uchereshere mahuku saba makina. <verse eid="LEV 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 13:34" />Nihuku no saba opochera ishaani aweheke tho uvelhe uyo. Yoonaka wiira uvelhe uyo khuwanenlhe munrapalhani ni wala khukenlhe nhina nrapalha, paahi anhimiacheke yoyo ntu uyo wiira hokhalha oombone. Yoyo ntu uyo apuputteke ikuwo chawe, ni uyo norumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 13:35" />Nansho yakhalhaka uvelhe uyo uhowanelha baada yo uhimiachiya, <verse eid="LEV 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 13:36" />opochera ishaani ammweheke yoyo ntu uyo, ni yakhalhaka uvelhe uhowanelha munrapalhani, opochera ishaani khanothananiya waavia ikharari cho irangi yo manjano, yoyo ntu uyo khanorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 13:37" />Nansho yakhalhaka opochera ishaani anowoona wiira uvelhe ulhe uholhama ni ikharari cho uriipa chihomelha vavawo vakittu vawo, paahi yoyo ntu uyo holhama. Ni opochera ishaani anhimiacheke yoyo ntu uyo wiira noorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku.<verse eid="LEV 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 13:38" />“Ntu riyoothe, akhalhe nlhopwana ama nthiyana, akhalhaka ni nivaathelha nooteelha mwiiruttuni mwawe, <verse eid="LEV 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 13:39" />opochera ishaani ammweheke yoyo ntu uyo. Yakhalhaka anowoona wiira yayo mavaathelha aya ooteelha vakani, yoyo phi uvelhe wo kawaida, yoyo ntu noorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku.<verse eid="LEV 13:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 13:40" />“Yakhalhaka nlhopwana haatuwa nthari, yoyo hooniye wiira honanara ukhalhawaya rina nthariru. <verse eid="LEV 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 13:41" />Yakhalhaka nenno nthari nno naatuwilhe ukhuma wiikohi mpaka uyuuchi, yoyo ntu uyo rina nthariru, noorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 13:42" />Nansho yakhalhaka ahokhuma makhwata ooteelha ni okhwiilha vantharini vawo, ama vayuuchi, ama ahaawo mavaathelha ooteelha ni okhwiilha vakani, yayo phi makutulha anokhumelhelha mmuruni vantharini vawe ama vayuuchi vawe. <verse eid="LEV 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 13:43" />Opochera ishaani ammwehaweheke yoyo ntu uyo, ni yakhalhaka anowoona wiira wowo wiipa wo vamuruni uwo ama vayuchi uwo, urii wooteelha ni wokhwiilha khwilha, <verse eid="LEV 13:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 13:44" />paahi, opochera ishaani anhimiacheke yoyo ntu uyo wiira rina makutulha khanorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku. Ukhalhawaya ureta awe urii mmuruni mwawe.<verse eid="LEV 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 13:45" />“Ntu ri ni ureta wo makutulha awareke ikuwo cho waahuwa, hivache ikharari chawe, eekhunelheke malhaku awe, akhuwelheke eeraka, ‘Nhikaatamerie mii, nkooneke mii wiira o unyalha! Mii akinorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku!’ <verse eid="LEV 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 13:46" />Akhalheke chiicho wo uhirumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku, wo mahuku onkhaye arina awe yoyo ureta uyo. Yoyo khanorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku, ni uyo akhalheke yekha awe uchereshere iwani.”<verse eid="LEV 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Malheheriyo anaacha ikutihi cho nkuwoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 13:47" />“Yakhalhaka ihaawo iriyoothe irawulhihiye makutulha, ikhalhe yo isufu, ama ikuwo yorera yoteelha, <verse eid="LEV 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LEV 13:48" />ama ikuwo iriyoothe ittaviye ama irithiye wo ikuwo yorera yoteelha ama wo isufu ama ikuwo yo nrapalha nirinoothe nne, <verse eid="LEV 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LEV 13:49" />ama ikutihi iyo yakhalhaka yo ikijani ama yo khwiilha nkuwoni mmo, paahi yeyo ikuwo iyo yoonihiyeke wa opochera ishaani. <verse eid="LEV 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LEV 13:50" />Opochera ishaani anooweha yeyo ikutihi iyo ni uhiya yeyo ikuwo iyo uchereshere iwani wo mahuku saba. <verse eid="LEV 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LEV 13:51" />Nihuku no saba anooweha yeyo ikutihi iyo tho. Yakhalhaka yeyo ikutihi iyo ihowanelha nkuwoni mmo, ikhalhe ikuwo yo uttaviya ama yo urithiya ama yo nrapalha nirinoothe, yo ntheko uriwoothe, paahi yeyo ikuwo iyo khinorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LEV 13:52" />Opochera ishaani apaheke vamooroni yeyo ikuwo iyo ukhalhawaya ihokelhiya ikutihi inothaalhiha ikuwo.<verse eid="LEV 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LEV 13:53" />“Nansho yakhalhaka opochera ishaani anowoona wiira ikutihi khiwanenlhe nkuwoni mmo, <verse eid="LEV 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LEV 13:54" />paahi anlhehereke mwanene ikuwo iyo wiira apuputteke ni uhiya uchereshere iwani wo mahuku saba makina. <verse eid="LEV 13:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LEV 13:55" />Yamalhaka, awehaweheke yeyo ikuwo iyo baada yo upuputtiya. Yakhalhaka irangi yo ikutihi ilhe khinarukunuwa, ata inakhalhaka ikutihi iyo khiwanenlhe, yeyo ikuwo iyo khinorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku. Paahi yeyo ikuwo iyo ipahiyeke vamooroni, ikhalhe ikutihi iyo irii utulhi ama uhoolho wo ikuwo iyo. <verse eid="LEV 13:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LEV 13:56" />Nansho yakhalhaka opochera ishaani anowoona wiira ikutihi ilhe ihowalhawalha baada yo upuputtiya, paahi, aahulheke athamiheke vakittu varii ikutihi vawo. <verse eid="LEV 13:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LEV 13:57" />Yamalhaka, yakhalhaka ikutihi iyo inowoonia tho kaanyuma nkuwoni, ikuwo ittaviye ama irithiye, ama yo nrapalha, paahi ikutihi ihowanelha. Vavawo yeyo ikuwo iyo ipahiyeke vamooroni. <verse eid="LEV 13:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LEV 13:58" />Nansho yakhalhaka ikuwo iyo ikelhiye ikutihi ikhumelhenlhe kaanyuma baada yo upuputtiya, paahi ipuputtiyeke nkwaha wo nayeelhi wiira irumelhelhiye wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku.<verse eid="LEV 13:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LEV 13:59" />“Yayo etu phi malheheriyo anaacha ikutihi yo nkuwoni muriwoothe, ikhalhe ikuwo yo isufu ama yorera yoteelha, ama yo nrapalha. Wo yeyo iphiro iyo nnowooria waandhandhulha variyari yo ikuwo chinorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku, ama ikuwo chihinorumelhelhiya.”<verse eid="LEV 13:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LEV 14" />
  <para style="s1">Uttukuriya baada yo uwereiya makutulha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 14:1" />Yamalheke, Apwiiya Nlhuku yaheerelha ashinna Musa wiira, <verse eid="LEV 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 14:2" />“Anottwara alha phi malheheriyo anomwaacha ntu o makutulha, nihuku no uttukuriya wawe. Alhamakaru, eehaniyeke opochera ishaani, <verse eid="LEV 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 14:3" />ni ayo arweeke ammweheke yoyo ntu uyo uchereshere nikambi uwo. Yakhalhaka makutulha ayo aholhama, <verse eid="LEV 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 14:4" />paahi, opochera ishaani alhehereke wiira attu aawiihe ashinuni elhi akumi anorumelhelhiya umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, ikipande yo mwiri wo mwerezi, nttoche no irangi yo khwiilha, ni nritta wo mwiri wo ihisopo, wo nlhatu no yoyo ntu nothanana uttukuriya uyo. <verse eid="LEV 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 14:5" />Yamalhakaru, opochera ishaani alhehereke wiira mwaanuni mmoka ahithiyeke nnyoopweni nrii ni maashi oombone o umaraponi. <verse eid="LEV 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 14:6" />Yamalhaka vavawo, opochera ishaani ankusheke mwaanuni nkina ri nkumi ulhe, ikipande yo mwiri wo mwerezi, nttoche no irangi yo khwiilha ilhe ni nritta no mwiri wo ihisopo, ni uruwiaa chonkhaye mphomeni mwo mwaanuni hithiye ulhe. <verse eid="LEV 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 14:7" />Yathamaka vavawo, ammichamichereke iphome iyo mikwaha saba ntu nottukuriya uyo. Amalhihaka, anhimiacheke yoyo ntu uyo wiira vano noorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku. Yamalhaka vavawo, anhiyerereke mwaanuni nkumi ulhe avaveke arweeke wiithuphini.<verse eid="LEV 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 14:8" />“Ni ntu ttukuriye uyo apuputteke ikuwo chawe, owulheke ikharari chawe ni urapa. Amalhihakaru, ahokolhieke vawani, nansho akhalheke vathe wo nihema nawe wo mahuku saba. <verse eid="LEV 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 14:9" />Nihuku no saba owulheke tho ikharari chawe chonkhaye, irori, makhwikwi ni ikharari chikina chonkhaye. Yamalhaka apuputteke ikuwo chawe ni urapa, ni uyo noopocheriya ni attu awe.<verse eid="LEV 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 14:10" />“Nihuku no nane awiiheke ikhondoro chilhopwana piilhi cho uhiremara, ikhondoro ithiyana yo iyaakha imoka yo uhiremara, ikilo ttaaru cho iphepa yo ushilhia ithakanihiye ni makhura wo nlhatu no ukumiha isadaka yo choolhia vamoka ni makhura ikikombe imoka ikani. <verse eid="LEV 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 14:11" />Opochera ishaani anohalha unttukuria yoyo ntu uyo ammwiiheke umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku vanaatameria nlhako wo Nihema Nitakatifu, vamoka ni chittu chiwiihilhe awe. <verse eid="LEV 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 14:12" />Opochera ishaani akusheke ikhondoro ilhopwana imoka ni ukumiha isadaka yo uthamiha uwonya vamoka ni makhura ikikombe imoka ikani. Atheesheke ni wooniha wiira hokumiha isadaka umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 14:13" />Yamalhakaru, ahitheke ikhondoro iyo vakittu vatakatifu, vanohithelhiya ashinama o isadaka yo uthamiha uwonya ni isadaka yo waathanihiya. Thoko chiri aya isadaka yo uthamiha uwonya, ni ikina ilha phi yawaya opochera ishaani, phi isadaka itakatifu chinene. <verse eid="LEV 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 14:14" />Opochera ishaani akusheke iphome vakani yo isadaka yo uthamiha uwonya iyo ni unhika ntu nottukuriya uyo indewe yo nnyaru nawe no wiimonono ni nikokho nuulhupalhe no moono awe wo wiimonono ni nikokho nuulhupalhe no mweto awe wo wiimonono. <verse eid="LEV 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 14:15" />Yamalhaka, opochera ishaani akusheke makhura vakani o ikikombe imoka yo makhura alhe, ni uhelha nthatha naya no wiimushi. <verse eid="LEV 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 14:16" />Ahikeke yayo makhura ayo nikokho naya no wiimonono, ni unnyunyihera ntu nottukuriya uyo mikwaha saba nari umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 14:17" />Akusheke makhura anohalha munthathani ayo, ni unhika yoyo ntu nottukuriya uyo indewe yo nnyaru nawe no wiimonono ni nikokho nawe nuulhupalhe no moono wo wiimonono ni nikokho nuulhupalhe no mweto awe wo wiimonono, vavalhe vakittu vanhikhilhe aya iphome yo isadaka yo uthamiha uwonya valhe. <verse eid="LEV 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 14:18" />Akusheke makhura ahanlhe alhe ni unhika yoyo ntu uyo mmuruni. Wo yeyo iphiro iyo, opochera ishaani anompangelha aya ittu yo waathanihiya umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku.<verse eid="LEV 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 14:19" />“Yamalhakaru, opochera ishaani akumiheke isadaka yo uthamiha uwonya ni umpangelha yoyo ntu nottukuriya uyo ittu yo waathanihiya wiira arumelhelhiye ni Apwiiya Nlhuku. Amalhihaka chiicho, ahitheke ikhondoro yo isadaka yo upahiya iyo, <verse eid="LEV 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 14:20" />ni ukumiha isadaka yo upahiya vamooroni ni isadaka yo iphepa vachulhu madhubahu. Paahi etu, opochera ishaani anompangelha yoyo ntu uyo ittu yo waathanihiya, ni uyo noottukuriya ni urumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku.<verse eid="LEV 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 14:21" />“Nansho yakhalhaka yoyo ntu uyo mmashikini, khanooria ukumiha chechiyo chittu chiyo, paahi amwiiheke mwaakhondoro mmoka nlhopwana, ukhalha ittu yo ulhivelhelhiha isadaka yo uthamiha utteka. Awiiheke chiicho ikilo imoka yo iphepa yo shilhia ithakanihiye ni makhura wo nlhatu no isadaka yo choolhia ni makhura o izeituni ikikombe imoka ikani. <verse eid="LEV 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 14:22" />Tho, awiiheke machiya meelhi ama makhandi meelhi o ikhunda thoko chinooria awe. Mmoka akhalheke o nlhatu no isadaka yo uthamiha uwonya ni nkina wo nlhatu no isadaka yo upahiya.<verse eid="LEV 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 14:23" />“Nihuku no nane, aawiihereke opochera ishaani chechiyo chittu chiyo uhoolho wo nlhako wo Nihema Nitakatifu wo nlhatu wo uttukuriya waya umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 14:24" />Opochera ishaani ankusheke yoyo mwaakhondoro nlhopwana o isadaka yo uthamiha uwonya uyo vamoka ni makhura ikikombe imoka ikani alhe ni utheesha wooniha wiira chihokhalha isadaka umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 14:25" />Anhitheke mwaakhondoro nlhopwana o isadaka yo uthamiha utteka uyo, ni ukusha iphome ikina ni unhika yoyo ntu nottukuriya uyo indewe yo nnyaru nawe no wiimonono, nikhoko nuulhupalhe no moono awe wo wiimonono ni nikokho nawe nuulhupalhe no mweto awe wo wiimonono. <verse eid="LEV 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 14:26" />Amalhihaka, amiineke makhura makina vanthathani waya wo wiimushi, <verse eid="LEV 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 14:27" />ni unnyunyihera yoyo ntu uyo wo nikokho naya no wiimonono makhura vakani arii nthatha naya no wiimushi mikwaha saba umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 14:28" />Opochera ishaani anhikeke yoyo ntu nottukuriya uyo, makhura nnyaru nawe no wiimonono, nikokho nawe nuulhupalhe no moono awe wo wiimonono, ni nikokho nawe nuulhupalhe no mweto awe wo wiimonono. Anhikeke vakittu vanhinke aya iphome yo isadaka yo uthamiha utteka valhe. <verse eid="LEV 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 14:29" />Makhura anohalha munthathani mwawe ayo anhikeke yoyo ntu uyo mmuruni wiira ampangelhe ittu yo waathaanihiya wawe umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 14:30" />Opochera ishaani amalhihaka vavawo, akusheke nchiya nimoka no machiya meelhi alhe ama makhandi o ikhunda thoko yoyo ntu uyo chinooria awe uwiiha. <verse eid="LEV 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 14:31" />Nchiya nimoka nikhalheke wo nlhatu no isadaka yo uthamiha uwonya ni nikina wo nlhatu no isadaka yo upahiya. Vamoka ni yayo, akumiheke isadaka yo choolhia, ni ayo opochera ishaani ampangelheke yoyo ntu uyo ittu yo waathanihiya umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 14:32" />Yayo phi malheheriyo nohalha awe upanga ntu rii ni makutulha hinooria ukumiha isadaka chinothananiya wiira attukuriye.”<verse eid="LEV 14:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Malheheriyo anaacha ikutihi inohalha ukelha mmanupani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 14:33" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeerelha ashinna Musa ni Naharuni, <verse eid="LEV 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 14:34" />“Alha phi malheheriyo vanohalha inyu ukelha ilhapo yo Ukanaani, ilhapo kinoovahaakani ukhalha yawinyu. Vanohalha inyu ukhalha vawo, ni mii nkakaawiiha ikutihi inohalha ukelha imoka yo manupa inyu, <verse eid="LEV 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 14:35" />paahi mwanene yeyo inupa iyo oonakaru, anhimerieke opochera ishaani wiira ittu thoko ikutihi ihoonia unupani wawe. <verse eid="LEV 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 14:36" />Paahi opochera ishaani alhehereke wiira chittu chonkhaye chithamihiyeke nnupani mmo ahinaaya urwaa ni uwehaweha, chihiwe chonkhaye chaahimiya wiira chihonanara. <verse eid="LEV 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 14:37" />Yamalhaka opochera ishaani akelheke ni uwehaweha yeyo inupa iyo. Yakhalhaka ikutihi iyo yoonelhe ushirini ni weesha manepanepa o irangi yo kijani ikithi ama yokhwiilha ni woniaa wiira ahoneelha nshirini, <verse eid="LEV 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 14:38" />paahi opochera ishaani akhumeke vathe vanlhakoni ni uttia yeyo inupa iyo wo mahuku saba. <verse eid="LEV 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 14:39" />Nihuku no saba opochera ishaani ahokolhieke ni uwehaweha tho inupa iyo. Yakhalhaka ikutihi ihowanelha ishiri cho yeyo inupa iyo, <verse eid="LEV 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 14:40" />opochera ishaani alhehereke wiira mattupi akelhiye ikutihi ayo aphomolhiye ni urihelhiya vakittu vanorihelhiya chittu cho uhilhoka uchereshere iwani. <verse eid="LEV 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 14:41" />Ittaya ishiringiye yeyo inupa iyo, ni iyo iphomolhiyeke ni urihelhiya vakittu vanorihelhiya chittu cho uhilhoka uchereshere iwani. <verse eid="LEV 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 14:42" />Yamalhaka akusheke mattupi makina ni utheka vakittu vaphomolhiye vawo, ni ushiringa ittaya ikina yeyo inupa iyo tho.<verse eid="LEV 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 14:43" />“Yakhalhaka ikutihi iyo inookhumelhelha tho kaanyuma baada yo uphomolhiya mattupi ni ukwangiya ishiri iyo ni ushiringiya tho, <verse eid="LEV 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 14:44" />opochera ishaani aweeke ni uwehaweha tho inupa iyo. Yakhalhaka ikutihi ihowanelha yeyo inupa iyo, paahi yeyo ikutihi yo wiiva, yeyo inupa iyo ihonanara, khinolhoka wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 14:45" />Iphomolhiyeke, mattupi, miri chaathekelhiye ni ittaya yaashiringelhiye chirweehiyeke vakittu vanorihelhiya chittu cho uhilhoka uchereshere iwani. <verse eid="LEV 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 14:46" />Ni vavawo, ntu riyoothe nohalha ukelha nhina yeyo inupa iyo ikatema vanohalha aya utteiya vawo, honanara, khanorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku mpaka uchechilho. <verse eid="LEV 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 14:47" />Ntu riyoothe norupa yeyo inupa iyo ama ulhelhia yolhia nhina mwaya, apuputteke ikuwo chawe.<verse eid="LEV 14:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LEV 14:48" />“Nansho yakhalhaka baada yo uwehaweha yeyo inupa iyo, opochera ishaani oonaka wiira ikutihi khinawanelha baada yo ushiringiya, paahi ahimiacheke wiira yeyo inupa iyo ihokhalha yoombone ukhalhawaya ikutihi khinoonia tho. <verse eid="LEV 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LEV 14:49" />Wo uthanana uttukuria yeyo inupa iyo, mwanene inupa uyo aawiiheke ashinuni eelhi vamoka ni ikipande yo mwiri wo mwerezi, nttoche no khwiilha, ni nritta no mwiri wo ihisopo. <verse eid="LEV 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LEV 14:50" />Opochera ishaani anhithelheke mwaanuni mmoka nnyoopweni nrii maashi oombone o unraponi. <verse eid="LEV 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LEV 14:51" />Amalhihaka, akusheke ikipande yo mwiri wo mwerezi, yo mwiri wo ihisopo ni nttoche no khwiilha no mapururu o ikhondoro ilhe vamoka ni mwaanuni nkina rii nkumi ulhe ni uruwiaa chonkhaye mphomeni mwo mwaanuni hithiye ulhe. Yamalhaka amichereke iphome yeyo inupa iyo mikwaha saba. <verse eid="LEV 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LEV 14:52" />Wo yeyo iphiro iyo, phi nohalha aya uttukuria yeyo inupa iyo wo iphome yo mwaanuni, maashi oombone o unraponi, mwaanuni nkumi, ikipande yo mwiri wo mwerezi, yo mwiri wo ihisopo ni nttoche no khwiilha nne. <verse eid="LEV 14:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LEV 14:53" />Amalhihaka, anhiyerereke mwaanuni nkumi ulhe arweeke uchereshere iwani. Wo chiichammo etu, phi nohalha aya uttukuria yeyo inupa iyo, ni iyo inookhalha yoombone wiira attu akhalhe mwommo.<verse eid="LEV 14:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LEV 14:54" />“Alha etu phi malheheriyo anaacha ikutihi iriyoothe inowiiha ureta wo makutulha, <verse eid="LEV 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LEV 14:55" />ikutihi yo nkuwoni ama mmanupani, <verse eid="LEV 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LEV 14:56" />cho wiipelha, mapotte ama mavaathelha, <verse eid="LEV 14:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LEV 14:57" />wooniha wiira phi ittu yaani inorumelhelhiya ama ihinorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho unlhapelha Nlhuku. Yayo phi malheheriyo anaacha ureta wo makutulha ni ikutihi.”<verse eid="LEV 14:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LEV 15" />
  <para style="s1">Malheheriyo anaacha chittu cho unanara chinonkhuma ntu mwiiruttuni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 15:1" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeerelha ashinna Musa ni Naharuni tho wiira, <verse eid="LEV 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 15:2" />“Mwaahimerie attu o Israeli, wiira nlhopwana riyoothe akhumaka uwooru, uwooru uyo uhonnanariha, khanorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 15:3" />Wakhumaka ama wakhalhaka nhina, baado khanorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku. Unyalha uwo unohalha umpanga ntu wiira, <verse eid="LEV 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 15:4" />ikori iriyoothe inohalha awe urupelha ama ukhalhelha, khinorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho unlhapelha Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 15:5" />Ntu riyoothe nohalha uvara ikori awe yoyo ntu uyo, apuputteke ikuwo chawe ni urapa, ni uyo khanorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku mpaka uchechilho. <verse eid="LEV 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 15:6" />Ntu riyoothe nohalha ukhalhelha ittu iriyoothe ikhalhenlhe awe yoyo ntu nokhumiya uwooru uyo, apuputteke ikuwo ni urapa ni uyo noonyalha, khanorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku mpaka uchechilho. <verse eid="LEV 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 15:7" />Ntu riyoothe nohalha ummara ntu nokhumiya uwooru, apuputteke ikuwo chawe ni urapa, ni uyo khanorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku mpaka uchechilho. <verse eid="LEV 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 15:8" />Ntu riyoothe ashuwelhiyaka ishenye ni ntu nokhumiya uwooru, yoyo ntu shuwelhiye ishenye uyo apuputteke ikuwo chawe, ni urapa ni uyo khanorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku mpaka uchechilho. <verse eid="LEV 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 15:9" />Chittu chiriyoothe cho ukhalhelha chinaathalhiya vachulhu mwannama, chikhalhelhiye ni ntu nokhumiya uwooru khachinorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku mpaka uchechilho. <verse eid="LEV 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 15:10" />Ntu riyoothe nohalha uvara ittu iriyoothe ikhalhenlhe awe ntu uyo, noonyalha, khanorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku mpaka uchechilho. Ni ntu riyoothe akushaka chechiyo chittu chikhalhelhiye chiyo, yoyo ntu uyo noonyalha, apuputteke ikuwo chawe ni urapa, ni uyo khanorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku mpaka uchechilho. <verse eid="LEV 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 15:11" />Yakhalhaka ntu riyoothe nokhumiya uwooru nommara ntu wo uhinyawa thoko miono chawe ama urapa, variye uyo noonyalha, khanorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku mpaka uchechilho. <verse eid="LEV 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 15:12" />Ittu iriyoothe yuupiye ni ulhoko yavariyaka ni ntu nokhumiya uwooru ipweshiyeke. Nansho ittu iriyoothe ikooroshiye wo imbau ihapihiyeke ni maashi.<verse eid="LEV 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 15:13" />“Nlhopwana riyoothe nokhumiya uwooru alhamaka ureta awe, yoyo ntu uyo akhalheke mahuku saba hinaya uttukuriya. Apuputteke ikuwo chawe ni urapa maashi o umwolhokoni, ni uyo noorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 15:14" />Nihuku no nane awiiheke machiya meelhi ama ikhunda piilhi umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku untenjeni u Nihema Nitakatifu ni waavaha opochera ishaani. <verse eid="LEV 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 15:15" />Opochera ishaani anowaakumiha yayo, mmoka wo nlhatu no isadaka yo uthamiha uwonya ni nkina wo nlhatu no isadaka yo upahiya vamooroni, ni ayo opochera ishaani anompangelha yoyo ntu uyo ittu yo waathanihiya umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku ni unttukuria wiira arumelhelhiye wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku, wo nlhatu wo ukhuma wawe uwooru.<verse eid="LEV 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 15:16" />“Yakhalhaka nlhopwana hokhumiya ikhanja chawe, arapeke maashi iruttu yonkhaye, ni uyo khanorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku mpaka uchechilho. <verse eid="LEV 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 15:17" />Ikuwo iriyoothe ama ikuwo ikooroshiye wo nrapalha inomorelhiya ikhanja inoonyalha, ipuputtiyeke, ni iyo khinorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku mpaka uchechilho. <verse eid="LEV 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 15:18" />Yakhalhaka nlhopwana noorupa ni nthiyana, nkaakhumiya ikhanja, paahi onkhaye oyeelhi arapeke maashi, ni ayo khanorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku mpaka uchechilho.<verse eid="LEV 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 15:19" />“Nthiyana riyoothe vanoona awe mahuku awe noonyalha, khanorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku mahuku saba. Ni ntu riyoothe nohalha ummara yoyo nthiyana uyo noonyalha, khanorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku mpaka uchechilho. <verse eid="LEV 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 15:20" />Ittu riyoothe inorupelha awe ama ukhalhelha vari awe ni yayo mahuku ayo, khinorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku mpaka uchechilho. <verse eid="LEV 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 15:21" />Ntu riyoothe nohalha uvara ikori awe yoyo nthiyana uyo noonyalha, apuputteke ikuwo chawe ni urapa maashi, ni uyo khanorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku mpaka uchechilho. <verse eid="LEV 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 15:22" />Ntu riyoothe nohalha uvara ittu iriyoothe inokhalhelha awe yoyo nthiyana uyo apuputteke ikuwo chawe ni urapa maashi, ni uyo khanorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku mpaka uchechilho. <verse eid="LEV 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 15:23" />Nlhopwana riyoothe nohalha uvara ittu iriyoothe irupenlhe awe ama ikhalhenlhe awe yoyo nthiyana uyo noonyalha, khanorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku mpaka uchechilho. <verse eid="LEV 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 15:24" />Yakhalhaka nlhopwana noorupa ni yoyo nthiyana uyo ni iphome ya nthiyana uyo yammorelhaka nlhopwana uyo, paahi, nlhopwana uyo noonyalha, khanorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku wo mahuku saba ni ikori inorupelha awe yo inoonyalha.<verse eid="LEV 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 15:25" />“Yakhalhaka nthiyana nookhumiya iphome wo mahuku menchi upwaha chiri aya malhemalhelho, ama nookhumiya iphome ihinaaya ikatema awe yo ukhuma iphome, paahi noonyalha. Ikatema yonkhaye inokhuma awe iphome khanorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku, thoko chinokhalha aya mahuku awe o malhemalhelho. <verse eid="LEV 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 15:26" />Ikori iriyoothe inorupelha awe ama ihiche inokhalhelha awe yeyo ikatema iyo inoonyalha, khinorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku thoko chinokhalha aya mahuku awe o malhemalhelho. <verse eid="LEV 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 15:27" />Ntu riyoothe nohalha uvara chechiyo chittu chiyo, noonyalha ni apuputteke ikuwo chawe ni urapa maashi, ni uyo nookhalha chiicho mpaka uchechilho.<verse eid="LEV 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 15:28" />“Baada yo utondova ukhuma iphome, aweherereke thoko mahuku saba wiira akhalhe rata. <verse eid="LEV 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 15:29" />Nihuku no nane akusheke machiya meelhi ama makhandi meelhi o ikhunda ni waawiihera opochera ishaani vanlhakoni vo Nihema Nitakatifu. <verse eid="LEV 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 15:30" />Opochera ishaani anonkumiha mmoka wo nlhatu no isadaka yo uthamiha uwonya ni nkina wo nlhatu no isadaka yo upahiya. Wo yeyo iphiro iyo etu opochera ishaani anompangelha yoyo nthiyana uyo ittu yo waathanihiya umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku ni unttukuria unanara wawe wo ukhumiya iphome.”<verse eid="LEV 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 15:31" />“Phi chiichammo chinohalha inyu waamuka attu o Israeli mwaha wo unanara, ahiwe yaananariha nipuro naka nitakatifu nirii munlhokoni mwaya. Ukhalhaka wiira, akelhakha mwommo anananre anowiiviya.<verse eid="LEV 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 15:32" />“Yayo phi malheheriyo wa nlhopwana nokhumiya uwooru ni nokhumiya ikhanja ni uhirumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku, <verse eid="LEV 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 15:33" />ni yayo malheheriyo ayo anokhalha chiicho wa nthiyana nokhuma iphome ni unanara. Tho anomwaacha nlhopwana ama nthiyana riyoothe nokhumiya ni ittu iriyoothe ni chiicho inomwaacha nlhopwana norupa ni nthiyana noona mahuku awe.”<verse eid="LEV 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LEV 16" />
  <para style="s1">Nihuku no ulhevelhelhiya nlhatu wo uwonya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 16:1" />Apwiiya Nlhuku yahoolhumana ashinna Musa, baada yo urimeelha achishaana eelhi a Naharuni ikatema vaatamenrie aya Apwiiya Nlhuku, ni ututumiha ubani wahaathananiya. <verse eid="LEV 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 16:2" />Yeerenlhe wiira, “Mwaahimerie onninyu Naharuni wiira ahikelhe Vakittu Vatakatifu Chinene utulhi wo nipaziya ikatema ihinothananiya. Ahikelhe vavawo vakittu vawo ukhalhawaya phi vakittu vanokhumelhelha aka nnihuteni, vachulhu ikifuniko yo Nisanduku no Malhehano, vaneehaniya nipuro no uhiyerera milhatu. Yaahirumelhelheke, anookhwa. <verse eid="LEV 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 16:3" />Naharuni ahinaya ukelha Vakittu Vatakatifu Chinene awiiheke n'dume nikani no ing'ope no isadaka yo uthamiha uwonya ni ikhondoro ilhopwana yo isadaka yo upahiya.<verse eid="LEV 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 16:4" />“Amalhihaka, arapeke maashi iruttu yonkhaye. Baada yo vavawo, awareke ikuwo chinowariya ni opochera ishaani, yaani ikuwo choteelha cho nhina, nkogo woteelha, anattukilhe nshipi woteelha nnyununi ni mphumburu mmuruni.<verse eid="LEV 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 16:5" />“Aakusheke mabeberu eelhi o ipuri ukhuma wa attu o Israeli o nlhatu wo isadaka yo uthamiha uwonya ni ikhondoro ilhopwana imoka wo nlhatu no isadaka yo upahiya. <verse eid="LEV 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 16:6" />Naharuni akumiheke n'dume no ing'ope no isadaka yo uthamiha uwonya waya anene, ni nlhatu wo waathanihiya wo nlhatu waya anene ni inupa aya. <verse eid="LEV 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 16:7" />Yamalhaka akusheke mabeberu meelhi o ipuri alhe ni weesha vakhiviru ni nlhako wo Nihema Nitakatifu. <verse eid="LEV 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 16:8" />Vavawo akusheke malhuku meelhi, oopelheke ikhura mabeberu ayo. Ikhura imoka wo nlhatu no isadaka wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, ni ikhura ikina wo nlhatu no nibeberu ninoomolhiya vanikambini nineehaniya Azazeli. <verse eid="LEV 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 16:9" />Awiiheke nibeberu noopelhiye ikhura wo nlhatu no Apwiiya Nlhuku ni ukumiha isadaka yo uthamiha uwonya. <verse eid="LEV 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 16:10" />Nansho nibeberu noopelhiye ikhura wo nlhatu no isadaka yo uhiyereriya uwonya nne, nikumihiyeke umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku ninari nikumi wiira nipangelhiye ittu yo waathanihiya. Yamalhaka, Naharuni ahiyeke nibeberu nikina nineehaniya Azazeli nno, noomolhelhiye uthakoni, ninakushilhe uwonya wa attu.<verse eid="LEV 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 16:11" />“Yamalhaka vavawo, Naharuni akumiheke isadaka yo n'dume no ing'ope yo uthamiha uwonya waya anene, ni upanga ittu yo waathanihiya wo nlhatu waya anene ni wo nlhatu wa manyaalhoko aya. Ahitheke n'dume no ing'ope no isadaka yo uthamiha uwonya nno ni uchinga iphome nnyiponi. <verse eid="LEV 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 16:12" />Akusheke inyipo yo upahera ubani, makhalha o mooro anokhuma vamadhubahuni umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, ni mathatha meelhi o ubani ushilhiye rata chinene. <verse eid="LEV 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 16:13" />Awiiheke yoyo ubani uyo umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku ni uhelha vamooroni wiira mwiishi watutumaka ukhuneelhe ikifuniko yo Nisanduku no Malhehano nirii phi nipuro no uhiyereriya milhatu cho uwonya wiira ahikhwe. <verse eid="LEV 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 16:14" />Akusheke iphome vakani yo n'dume no ing'ope nno ni unyunyihera wo nikokho naya mpata unosha nchuwa vachulhu ikifuniko yo Nisanduku no Malhehano, mikwaha saba. Yamalhaka, anyunyihereke wo nikokho naya, uhoolho wo Nisanduku nno mikhwaha saba.<verse eid="LEV 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 16:15" />“Yamalhaka, ahitheke nibeberu no isadaka yo uthamiha uwonya nne wo nlhatu no attu onkhaye. Awiiheke iphome aya iyo Vakittu Vatakatifu Chinene ni upanga thoko chipannge aya wo iphome yo ing'ope ilhe, wo unyunyihera ikifuniko yo Nisanduku no Malhehano mikwaha saba, ni mpata wo uhoolho wo Nisanduku nno mikwaha saba chiicho. <verse eid="LEV 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 16:16" />Wo yeyo iphiro iyo anoottukuria Vakittu Vatakatifu Chinene, wo nlhatu no unanara, utteka, ni uwonya wonkhaye wa attu o Israeli. Apangeke chiicho wo Nihema Nitakatifu, ukhalhawaya nirii variyari mwa yayo attu arii o nanara wo iphiro chihinorumelhelhiya wo waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku ayo. <verse eid="LEV 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 16:17" />Toka ikatema Naharuni vanokelha aya Vakittu Vatakatifu Chinene upangani ittu yo wiittukuria wo nlhatu naya anene, ashilhoko aya ni attu onkhaye attu o Israeli, hikhalhe mena ntu riyoothe nhina Nihema Nitakatifu, mpaka vanohalha aya umalhiha ni ukhuma vathe. <verse eid="LEV 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 16:18" />Yamalhihaka akhumeke ni urwaa varii madhubahu arii umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku ni upanga ittu yo wiittukuria. Akusheke iphome ikina yo n'dume no ing'ope ni yo ipuri ilhe ni uhikahika inyaka urukureria madhubahu onkhaye. <verse eid="LEV 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 16:19" />Anyunyihereke madhubahu ayo iphome wo nikokho naya mikwaha saba wo uttukuria ni weesha umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, athamihe unanara wonkhaye wa attu o Israeli wiira arumelhelhiye wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku.<verse eid="LEV 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ipuri inoomolhelhiya uthakoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 16:20" />“Naharuni amalhihaka uttukuria Vakittu Vatakatifu Chinene, Nihema Nitakatifu ni madhubahu, awiiheke nibeberu nne ninari nikumi umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, wo nlhatu no woomolhiya nirwee uthakoni. <verse eid="LEV 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 16:21" />Yamalhaka, Naharuni eesheke miono chaya vamuruni vo nenno nibeberu nikumi nno ni uhimiacha vachulhu waya itiyamaru yonkhaye ya attu o Israeli, utteka waya ni uwonya waya wonkhaye ni uhiya vamuruni wa ipuri iyo. Amalhihaka, athaphulheke ahiyeke nittawelhe uthakoni, noomolhiyaka ni ntu riyoothe neekumiha wo uttuna wawe. <verse eid="LEV 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 16:22" />Aphiyaka wowo, ntu uyo ahokolhieke, ahiyeke nibeberu nno nirweeke uthakoni uhirii attu, uno ninakunshe uwonya wa attu wonkhaye.<verse eid="LEV 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 16:23" />“Yamalhakaru, Naharuni ahokolhieke nhina Nihema Nitakatifu, arulheke ikuwo chaawanre aya vaakelha aya Vakittu Vatakatifu Chinene chilhe ni uhiya mwommo. <verse eid="LEV 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 16:24" />Arapeke mwommo mpani mmo vakittu vatakatifu ni uwara ikuwo chaya. Amalhihaka, akhumeke vathe ukumiha isadaka aya yo upahiya, ni isadaka yo upahiya ya attu o Israeli, wiira apange ittu yo waathanihiya wo nlhatu waya anene ni wo nlhatu wo attu onkhaye. <verse eid="LEV 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 16:25" />Apaheke vamooroni makhura a ashinama o isadaka yo uthamiha uwonya vachulhu madhubahu.<verse eid="LEV 16:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 16:26" />“Ntu aarweehilhe nibeberu no ipuri nikushilhe uwonya wa attu wiithuphini nne, apuputteke ikuwo chawe ni urapa maashi hinaaya uhokolhia unikambini. <verse eid="LEV 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 16:27" />Marapalha, inama ni mavi o n'dume no ing'ope ni ipuri chikumihiye isadaka yo uthamihiya uwonya ni iphome aya nkayaarweehiya Vakittu Vatakatifu Chinene wiira yapangelhiye ittu yo waathanihiya chilhe, chikushiyeke chonkhaye chirweehiyeke uchereshere nikambi chapahiyeke mooro. <verse eid="LEV 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 16:28" />Ntu nohalha upaha chechiyo chittu chiyo, amalhihaka, apuputteke ikuwo chawe ni urapa maashi, hinaaya uhokolhia unikambini.”<verse eid="LEV 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nihuku no uhiyereriya milhatu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 16:29" />“Alha phi malheheriyo nnothananiya inyu uttwara wo uhihiya mahuku onkhaye wiira, nihuku no khumi no mweeri wo saba, mwaattiva mwaashinene ni ata alheto anokhalha munlhokoni mwinyu, nttukeke nenno nihuku nno ni uhiya uvara mitheko. <verse eid="LEV 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 16:30" />Mpangeke chiicho ukhalhawaya nenno nihuku nno waathanihiya unoopangiya wo nlhatu winyu, ni uttukuriya uwonya winyu, wiira nrumelhelhiye umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 16:31" />Nenno nihuku nno phi nihuku no wiittuwa unene, nttukeke. Ni yayo phi malheheriyo anothananiya inyu uttwara wo mahuku onkhaye. <verse eid="LEV 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 16:32" />Opochera ishaani ahikiye makhura ni weesheriya miono wiira avarelhe vanipuroni va athumwane, phi nohalha upanga ittu yo waathanihiya nawanre ikuwo chitakatifu chorera choteelha. <verse eid="LEV 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 16:33" />Yayo anoopanga ittu yo waathanihiya wo nlhatu no Vakittu Vatakatifu Chinene, wo nlhatu no Nihema Nitakatifu, madhubahu, opochera ishaani ni wo nlhatu no attu onkhaye o Israeli. <verse eid="LEV 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 16:34" />Alha etu phi malheheriyo o mahuku onkhaye, nnoothananiya wiira attware wiira apange ittu yo waathanihiya wo nlhatu no attu o Israeli nkwaha mmoka kila iyaakha ahiyereriye uwonya waya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 16:34">Paahi ashinna Musa nkayaapanga chiicho thoko chaalheheriye aya ni Apwiiya Nlhuku.<verse eid="LEV 16:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LEV 17" />
  <para style="s1">Malheheriyo anaacha iphome</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 17:1" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeerelha ashinna Musa wiira, <verse eid="LEV 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 17:2" />“Mwaahimerie Naharuni, achishaana aya ni attu onkhaye o Israeli alha malheheriyo alha. <verse eid="LEV 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 17:3" />Ntu riyothe munlhokoni mwa attu o Israeli ahithaka ing'ope ama ikhondoro ama ipuri yo isadaka wa Apwiiya Nlhuku nhina ama uchereshere nikambi, <verse eid="LEV 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 17:4" />oochelhaka ummwiiha yoyo mwannama uyo, vanlhakoni vo Nihema Nitakatifu wiira ankumihe isadaka wa Apwiiya Nlhuku umihoolho wo nipuro naya nitakatifu, yoyo ntu uyo nookhalha ni milhatu cho urihakacha iphome, yoyo akhotiyeke ni attu awe. <verse eid="LEV 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 17:5" />Nlhatu wo alha malheheriyo alha phi waachiichiha attu o Israeli wiira ahaahithe ashinama anaakumiha aya isadaka chaya umawani. Anothananiya wiira yaawiiheke wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, yaani wa opochera ishaani vanlhakoni vo Nihema Nitakatifu, yaahitheke wowo ni waakumihera Apwiiya Nlhuku isadaka cho uwiiha mpuha. <verse eid="LEV 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 17:6" />Paahi opochera ishaani anoonyunyihera iphome madhubahu a Apwiiya Nlhuku arii vakhiviru nlhako wo Nihema Nitakatifu ni upaha makhura a ashinama alha anukhelhe nihiriri noombone ninaachivelha Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 17:7" />Wo chiichammo etu attu o Israeli anoohiya ulhapelha milhuku cho woothachiya chinolhikaana ni ipuri chinottwarattwara aya, ittu inaapanga wiira kihaakhulhuvelhe. Alha malheheriyo alha phi olhokelha mahuku onkhaye mwi iyari chaya chonkhaye.<verse eid="LEV 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 17:8" />“Ntu riyoothe munlhokoni mwa attu o Israeli ama nlheto nokhalha munlhokoni mwaya, akumiheke isadaka yo upahiya yo mwannama ama isadaka ikina iriyoothe, <verse eid="LEV 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 17:9" />nansho khanowiiha umihoolho yo nlhako wo Nihema Nitakatifu wiira akumihe wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, yoyo ntu uyo akhotiyeke ni attu awe.<verse eid="LEV 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 17:10" />“Yakhalhaka ntu riyoothe munlhokoni mwa attu o Israeli ama nlheto nokhalha munlhokoni mwinyu, noolhia iphome iriyoothe, mii akinomwaathanana yoyo ntu uyo, kinoomweesha utayi wiira akhotiye ni attu awe. <verse eid="LEV 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 17:11" />Inaakhalheke chiicho ukhalhawaya ukumi wo ittu yuupiye uri mphomeni. Kihalhehera wiira, akikumihere iphome umadhubahuni apange ittu yo waathanihiya wo nlhatu wo minepa chinyu, ukhalhawaya iphome inowaathaniha ukumi wa ntu. <verse eid="LEV 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 17:12" />Phi nlhatu ninaalhehera aka wiira, ntu riyoothe munlhokoni mwinyu wala nlheto nokhalha munlhokoni mwinyu hilhie iphome mena.<verse eid="LEV 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 17:13" />“Ntu riyoothe munlhokoni mwa attu o Israeli ama nlheto nokhalha munlhokoni mwaya arwaaka ulhupattani mwannama ama mwaanuni, nothananiya wiira ariheke iphome vathi ni uwuhelha ittaya. <verse eid="LEV 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 17:14" />Ukhalhawaya ukumi wo kila ittu yuupiye uri mphomeni. Phi nlhatu kinaalhehera aka attu o Israeli wiira, ahilhie iphome yo ittu iriyoothe yuupiye mena, kwaani ukumi wo ittu yuupiye iriyoothe phi iphome aya. Ntu riyoothe nohalha ulhia iphome noohaulhiya munlhokoni mwa attu awe.<verse eid="LEV 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 17:15" />“Ntu riyoothe, nnenchi ama nlheto, nolhia iriyoothe ikhwilhe kibudu ama yiiviye ni mwannama o mwiithuphini, nolheheriya wiira apuputteke ikuwo chawe ni urapa, ni uyo noonyalha khanorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku mpaka uchechilho. Baada yo vavawo nookhalha oombone, noorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 17:16" />Nansho aahipuputteke ikuwo chawe ni urapa, inohalha umphwanya iyo, yawawe.”<verse eid="LEV 17:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LEV 18" />
  <para style="s1">Malheheriyo o mwaha uchiichihiye wo munthelhini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 18:1" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeerelha ashinna Musa wiira, <verse eid="LEV 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 18:2" />“Mwaahimerie attu o Israeli cho: Mii phi Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu. <verse eid="LEV 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 18:3" />Nhipange mena thoko chinopanga aya attu o ilhapo yo Umisri waakhalha inyu. Mena nhipange thoko chinopanga aya attu o ilhapo yo Ukanaani unorwehaakani. Nhittwarihe mena meetelho aya. <verse eid="LEV 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 18:4" />Nttwareke malheheriyo aka ni uvarechesha meettuchiho aka. Mii phi Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu. <verse eid="LEV 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 18:5" />Paahi etu wo wiira ntu oopolhe ukumi awe, mwiiwelhelheke ni uvarechesha malheheriyo aka ni meettuchiho aka. Mii phi Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu.<verse eid="LEV 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 18:6" />“Ntu riyoothe o Israeli hintongose mmuchi awe wiira anrupane. Mii phi Apwiiya Nlhuku.<verse eid="LEV 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 18:7" />“Nhaawonye athumwaninyu wo waarupana anumwaninyu oyanreni. Nhoolhihache muru yayo phi anumwaninyu.<verse eid="LEV 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 18:8" />“Nhaawonye athumwaninyu wo urupa ni mmoka o mavasha aya. Yayo manyaanumwaninyu chiicho.<verse eid="LEV 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 18:9" />“Nhaarupane arokorinyu, akhalhe arokorinyu o irukulhu imoka ama arokorinyu ayariye ni anumwaninyu akina.<verse eid="LEV 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 18:10" />“Mena nhinrupane mwanchulhu inyu, mwaana a mwaamwaninyu mwanlhopwana ama mwanthiyana, ukhalhawaya nnowiichoolhiha muru mwaanene.<verse eid="LEV 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 18:11" />“Chiicho, nhinrupane mena mwalhi yariye ni nivasha nikina na athumwaninyu, yoyo mwanrokorinyu.<verse eid="LEV 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 18:12" />“Nhaarupane amaati inyu, ukhalhawaya yayo arokoraya athumwaninyu.<verse eid="LEV 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 18:13" />“Nhaarupane anumwaninyu olhupalhe ama aakani, ukhalhawaya yayo amuchi a anumwaninyu.<verse eid="LEV 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 18:14" />“Nhaarupane mahano aya athumwaninyu olhupalhe ama aakani, yayo anumwaninyu chiicho.<verse eid="LEV 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 18:15" />“Nhaarupane mahano o mwaamwaninyu, yayo ahokohi inyu, mahano a mwaamwaninyu. Nhaarupane mena.<verse eid="LEV 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 18:16" />“Nhaarupane mahano a nhimainyu ama onninyu, vavawo nnowoolhiha muru ahima inyu ama onninyu.<verse eid="LEV 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 18:17" />“Mwarupaka ni nthiyana paahi, mena nhinrupane mwamwanawe ama ashichulhu awe, yayo alhoko amoka. Mwaathakanihaka, nnoowonya.<verse eid="LEV 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 18:18" />“Nhaathelhe mavasha mahano inyu ni onnaya ama ahima aya, mena waarupana, mahano inyu anari akumi.<verse eid="LEV 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 18:19" />“Nhinrupane mena nthiyana vanoona awe mahuku awe o mweeri.<verse eid="LEV 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 18:20" />“Nhaarupane mena mahano a amwaatamana inyu, mwapangaka chiicho, nnowiinanariha mwaanene. Khannorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku.<verse eid="LEV 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 18:21" />“Nhinkumihe mwaamwaninyu riyoothe ukhalha isadaka wa nlhuku Moleki ukhalhawaya upanga chiicho nnooruwaniha nchina naka mii Nlhuku inyu. Mii phi Apwiiya Nlhuku.<verse eid="LEV 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 18:22" />“Nhiruparupane mena nlhopwana nkhunaninyu thoko wiira nthiyana. Wowo phi uwonya chinene.<verse eid="LEV 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 18:23" />“Mena nhinrupane mwannama nkamweenanariha, nlhopwana ama nthiyana riyoothe mena hipange chiicho, upanga chiicho phi uttteka.<verse eid="LEV 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 18:24" />“Nhiinanarihe wo upanga ittu iriyoothe munlhokoni mwo yayo, ukhalhawaya attu anopanga chechiyo anowiinanariha ni mii kinowoomolha attu o makosho thoko yayo athame umihoolho waka. <verse eid="LEV 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 18:25" />Ata ilhapo aya yahonanarihiya, ni mii nkakaatwarusha wo uwonya waya, ni ilhapo iyo nkayaaraphia attu aya. <verse eid="LEV 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 18:26" />Nansho mwaattiva ni alheto anokhalha munlhokoni mwinyu nnothananiya nvarecheshe malheheriyo ni malhehano aka ni mena nhipange chihinottuna awe Nlhuku chiyo. <verse eid="LEV 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 18:27" />Chechiyo chittu chinokirusha chiyo chaapangiye ni attu yaakhalha ilhapo yo Ukanaani nhinaaya mwaattiva, ni ilhapo iyo nkayaananara. <verse eid="LEV 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 18:28" />Paahi mwaattiva nhipange yoyo mwaha uyo, mweeraka chiicho ilhapo iyo inouraphiani, thoko chaarapheiye aya attu yaariwo nhinaya mwaattiva.<verse eid="LEV 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 18:29" />“Attu onkhaye anohalha upanga yoyo mwaha uhinottuna aya Apwiiya Nlhuku uyo, anothananiya wiira ahilhohiye ahiiyeke utayi, oomolhiyeke munlhokoni mwa attu o Israeli.<verse eid="LEV 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 18:30" />“Paahi etu nvarechesheke rata malhove onkhaye anolheheraakani, nhittwarihe malhemalhelho ariyoothe orushiha yaapangiye ni alhe yaakhalha mwiilhaponi mmo nhinaya mwaatti, nhiwe mweenanariha wo upanga yayo. Mii phi Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu.”<verse eid="LEV 18:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LEV 19" />
  <para style="s1">Malheheriyo makina o upanga chittu cho rera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 19:1" />Apwiiya Nlhuku yaheerelha ashinna Musa, <verse eid="LEV 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 19:2" />“Mwaahimerie nlhoko wonkhaye wa attu o Israeli cho, anothananiya wiira, nkhalhe atakatifu ukhalhawaya mii Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, ki ntakatifu.<verse eid="LEV 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 19:3" />“Kila mmoka inyu nothananiya wiira aathimiche anumwanawe ni athumwanawe, ni uvara Nihuku no Wiittuwa, mii phi Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu.<verse eid="LEV 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 19:4" />“Nhikihiye mii nkamwaarukunuwelha isinyago cho milhuku, mena nhihane isinyago cho milhuku. Mii phi Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu.<verse eid="LEV 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 19:5" />“Vanokikumihera inyu isadaka mii Apwiiya Nlhuku cho ukhalha wo mpuha ni Apwiiya Nlhuku, nkikumihereke thoko chinothananiya aya wiira irumelhelhiye wo nlhatu winyu. <verse eid="LEV 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 19:6" />Inama cho isadaka iyo chikhuuriyeke nenno nihuku nikumihiye aya nno ama waashelhe waya. Iriyoothe inohalha mpaka nihuku no neraru ipahiyeke mooro. <verse eid="LEV 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 19:7" />Yakhalhaka inama ihanlhe inookhuuriya nihuku no neraru, yeyo ittu iyo phi yo urushiha, ni yeyo isadaka iyo khinorumelhelhiya. <verse eid="LEV 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 19:8" />Ni ntu nohalha ukhuura yeyo inama iyo nothananiya wiira atwarushiye utteka wawe, ukhalhawaya honanariha ittu itakatifu ya Apwiiya Nlhuku. Yoyo ntu uyo hilhohiye ni attu awe.<verse eid="LEV 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 19:9" />“Vanohalha inyu ukhungura choolhia cho mmatani mwinyu, nhikungure chonkhaye mpaka mmwiinanoni imata inyu, mena nhihokolhie utulhi urokottaniha chihanlhe. <verse eid="LEV 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 19:10" />Nhihokolhelhe urokottaniha izabibu chihalhehanlhe ama urokotta chaamonre, mwaahiyereke amashikini ni alheto. Mii phi Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu.<verse eid="LEV 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 19:11" />“Nhiiye, nhithepiache mena uhimiacha cho woothachiya. <verse eid="LEV 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 19:12" />Nhilhupelhe nchina naka wo woothacha, mweeraka chiicho nnoonanariha nchina na Nlhuku inyu. Mii phi Apwiiya Nlhuku.<verse eid="LEV 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 19:13" />“Nhimwaakhe namwaatamana inyu wala umwiiyera. Malhivo a attu anovara ntheko inyu ahikhalhe uwannyu ashelhelhihaka mpaka wichishu. <verse eid="LEV 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 19:14" />Nhinruwane ntu ohiiwa wala nhitiyelhelhe uhoolho ntu ohoona, nansho munthimicheke Nlhuku. Mii phi Apwiiya Nlhuku.<verse eid="LEV 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 19:15" />“Vanohukumulha inyu mwaanyulheke wo ikekhiaye. Nhimmwehe ntu wiitho wala umwoova, akhalhe mmashikini ama ntu rii ni ikuru. Nansho nnothananiya wiira mwaanyulheke milhatu cho amwaatamana inyu wo ikekhiaye. <verse eid="LEV 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 19:16" />Nhivirevire mwootheriaka manyaalhoko inyu. Nhinhelhe namwaatamana inyu ntatakoni, nkeeviya wo nlhatu no malhove inyu. Mii phi Apwiiya Nlhuku.<verse eid="LEV 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 19:17" />“Nhinvenge nlhoko inyu, nansho mwaathaneke ikatema chonkhaye ni amwaatamana inyu wiira nhiwe mwaawonya. <verse eid="LEV 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 19:18" />Nhiilhivelhelhihe ama nhaathunalhelhe attu o iyari inyu, nansho munttuneke namwaatamana inyu thoko chineettuna inyu mwanene. Mii phi Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu.<verse eid="LEV 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 19:19" />“Nvarechesheke malheheriyo aka.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 19:19">“Nhihiye mihuwo chinyu chiwelhiye ni ashinama o nikosho nikina.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 19:19">“Nhaalhe imbeyu cho makosho meelhi mmamatani mwinyu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 19:19">“Ni mena nhiware ikuwo chittaviye wo makosho meelhi o ikuwo.<verse eid="LEV 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 19:20" />“Nlhopwana arupaka ni nthiyana ipotta thelhiye ni nlhopwana nkina, nansho khanaaya woopolhiya wala uvahiya uneethi, nthiyana ni nlhopwana nrupanne uyo oyeelhi atwarushiyeke, nansho ahiiviye ukhalhawaya yoyo nthiyana uyo aari hinaaya uvahiya uneethi. <verse eid="LEV 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 19:21" />Yoyo nlhopwana uyo awiiheke uhoolho wo Nihema Nitakatifu isadaka awe yo ikhondoro ilhopwana yo uthamiha uwonya ni ukikumihera Mii Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 19:22" />Opochera ishaani anompangelha ittu yo waathanihiya wa Apwiiya Nlhuku wo yeyo ikhondoro iyo, uwonya upangilhe awe. Ni uyo noohiyereriya uwonya upangilhe awe uwo.<verse eid="LEV 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 19:23" />“Vanohalha inyu uphiya ilhapo yo Ukanaani ni waalha makosho onkhaye o miiri cho maphepu, nhilhie yayo maphepu ayo iyaakha ttaaru. <verse eid="LEV 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 19:24" />Iyaakha yo neecheshe maphepu aya onkhaye anookhalha matakatifu, akumihiyeke isadaka yo waatotopelha Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 19:25" />Nansho mmweeke mwaalhia maphepu iyaakha yo nethanu, ni choolhia chinyu chinowunchereria. Mii phi Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu.<verse eid="LEV 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 19:26" />“Nhikhuure inama iriyoothe irii ni iphome.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 19:26">“Nhimoope nttiti, mena nhilhwee.<verse eid="LEV 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 19:27" />“Nhuuwulhe ikharari chinyu cho nthotho mmuruni mwinyu mena nhuuwulhe irori chinyu cho nthotho vairorini winyu.<verse eid="LEV 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 19:28" />“Nhiittume inepo iriyoothe mwiiruttuni mwinyu wo nlhatu no ukhwelhiya ama wiikhapakacha mwiiruttuni mwinyu. Mii phi Apwiiya Nlhuku.<verse eid="LEV 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 19:29" />“Nhinnanarihe mwalhi inyu wo umpanga o ulhuva, ilhapo yonkhaye ihiwe imorelhaka muulhuvani, nkayaachara cho uhilhoka.<verse eid="LEV 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 19:30" />“Nvarechesheke Nihuku no Wiittuwa naka ni uthimicha Nihema Nitakatifu naka. Mii phi Apwiiya Nlhuku.<verse eid="LEV 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 19:31" />“Nhirwee wa attu omoopa nttiti, o mashoka mena attu o miruchi wiira mwaalhepelhe owoopelheni nttiti, nkamweenanariha. Mii phi Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu.<verse eid="LEV 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 19:32" />“Mwakhalhaka uhoolho wa ashulhupalhe mweemelheke, ni waavaha nthimicho aya, ni inyu munthimicheke Nlhuku inyu. Mii phi Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu.<verse eid="LEV 19:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 19:33" />“Yakhalhaka haawo nlheto munlhokoni mwinyu nhimpangelhe chittu cho uhilhoka. <verse eid="LEV 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 19:34" />Yoyo nlheto nokhalha ni inyuva uyo nookhalha uwannyu thoko nnenchi, ni inyuva munttuneke thoko chineettuna inyu mwanene, ukhalhawaya ni inyu mwaari alheto ilhapo yo Umisri. Mii phi Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu.<verse eid="LEV 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 19:35" />“Nhihiye mena waamulha wo ikekhiaye inaacha maphimelhiyo o urekama, o ulhemelha ni o machariho. <verse eid="LEV 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 19:36" />Nnothananiya wiira ntumiyeke ikapani yo ikekhiaye, ni cho uphimelha cho ikekhiaye. Mii phi Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku inyu, kuuthaminheni ilhapo yo Umisri.<verse eid="LEV 19:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 19:37" />“Nnothananiya wiira nvareke ni upangacha malheheriyo aka ni malheheriyo aka onkhaye. Mii phi Apwiiya Nlhuku.”<verse eid="LEV 19:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LEV 20" />
  <para style="s1">Ntwarusho wo nlhatu no uwonya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 20:1" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeerelha ashinna Musa wiira, <verse eid="LEV 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 20:2" />“Mwaahimerie attu o Israeli wiira: Ntu riyoothe munlhokoni mwa attu o Israeli ama nlheto nokhalha munlhokoni mwinyu, ankumihaka isadaka mwaamwanawe riyoothe wa nlhuku Moleki yoyo ntu uyo eeviyeke. Attu o nlhoko wawe amwiiveke wo umwaata malhuku. <verse eid="LEV 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 20:3" />Mii kimwanene kinonthunalhelha yoyo ntu uyo ni umwoomolha wa attu awe ukhalhawaya honkumiha mwaamwanawe mmoka isadaka wa nlhuku Moleki, paahi honanariha Vakittu Vatakatifu vaka ni nchina naka nitakatifu. <verse eid="LEV 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 20:4" />Yakhalhaka attu o vavawo vakittu vawo khanontwarusha yoyo ntu uyo wo umwiiva, <verse eid="LEV 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 20:5" />mii kimwanene kinontwarusha yoyo ntu uyo ni manyaalhoko awe. Kinowaahukumulha wiira eeviye, yoyo mwanene uyo vamoka ni attu onkhaye ahiilhe ukikhulhuvelha mii ni unkhulhuvelha nlhuku Moleki.<verse eid="LEV 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 20:6" />“Yakhalhaka ntu riyoothe noorwaa wa attu o umoopa nttiti, wa attu o mashoka ni wa attu o miruchi, ni uhiya ukikhulhuvelha Mii, kinontwarusha yoyo ntu uyo ni unhukumulha wiira eeviye.<verse eid="LEV 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 20:7" />“Paahi etu, mwiikumiheke ukhalha atakatifu, ukhalhawaya mii phi Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu. <verse eid="LEV 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 20:8" />Nvarechesheke malheheriyo aka ni upanga. Mii phi Apwiiya Nlhuku kinoopangani ukhalha atakatifu.<verse eid="LEV 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 20:9" />“Ntu riyoothe naaruwana athumwanawe ama anumwanawe, yoyo noothananiya wiira eeviye. Ukhalhawaya iphome awe inookhalha vachulhu vawe mwanene.<verse eid="LEV 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 20:10" />“Yakhalhaka nlhopwana noolhuva ni mahanu a amwaatamana awe, onkhaye oyeelhi eeviyeke.<verse eid="LEV 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 20:11" />“Nlhopwana arupaka ni mmoka a manyaahanu a athumwanawe, nowoolhihacha muru athumwanawe, onkhaye oyeelhi eeviye. Yoyo nlhopwana uyo ni yoyo nthiyana uyo, iphome chaya chinookhalha vachulhu waya ashinene.<verse eid="LEV 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 20:12" />“Nlhopwana riyoothe arupaka ni mahanu a mwaamwanawe, onkhaye oyeelhi anowiiviya. Ahopanga ulhuva wo uhilhoka chinene, ahorihakacha iphome chaya ashinene.<verse eid="LEV 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 20:13" />“Yakhalhaka nlhopwana riyoothe noorupa ni nlhopwana nkhunanawe thoko wiira nthiyana, paahi onkhaye oyeelhi anowiiviya, ukhalhawaya ahopanga ittu yo urushiha chinene, iphome chaya chinookhalha vachulhu waya ashinene.<verse eid="LEV 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 20:14" />“Yakhalhaka nlhopwana nonthelha nthiyana ni anumwanawe, wowo uwonya, onkhaye oraaru apahiyeke mooro, eeviye, ukhalhawaya ahowonya. Mpangeke chiicho wo nlhatu no uhiiha uwonya munlhokoni mwinyu.<verse eid="LEV 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 20:15" />“Yakhalhaka nlhopwana riyoothe noorupa ni mwannama, yoyo eeviyeke, ni mwannama uyo chiicho eeviyeke.<verse eid="LEV 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 20:16" />“Yakhalhaka nthiyana noomwaatameria mwannama ni unrupana, yoyo nthiyana uyo eeviye ni mwannama uyo chiicho, iphome chaya chiri vachulhu waya ashinene.<verse eid="LEV 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 20:17" />“Yakhalhaka nlhopwana riyoothe nonthelha mwanrokorawe, yariye ni athumwanawe ama anumwanawe, nkanrupana, yeyo ittu yo urushiha. Oomolhiyeke munlhokoni mwa attu aka, ukhalhawaya nlhopwana uyo hopanga ittu yo wuulhihacha muru. Yoyo nlhopwana uyo eeviyeke.<verse eid="LEV 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 20:18" />“Yakhalhaka nlhopwana noorupa ni nthiyana rii ni mahuku awe, onkhaye oyeelhi oomolhiye munlhokoni mwa attu aya, ukhalhawaya ahopaphulha nrapo no iphome no nthiyana uyo. Khanorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku.<verse eid="LEV 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 20:19" />“Nhirupe ni onnaya anumwaninyu mena ni amaati inyu, ukhalhawaya yayo amuchi inyu. Mwaatti oyeelhi nnootwarushiya.<verse eid="LEV 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 20:20" />“Ntu aarupanaka mahanu a athumwanawe, olhupalhe ama aakani, noowoolhiha muru athumwanawe olhupalhe ama aakaani ayo. Oyeelhi anoohukumulhiya wo uwonya waya, ni onkhaye oyeelhi anookhwa wo uhikhalha ni ashaana.<verse eid="LEV 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 20:21" />“Yakhalhaka nlhopwana nowaathelha mahanu a nhima awe ama a munnawe, wowo unyalha. Khanorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku. Paahi onkhaye oyeelhi anookhwa wo uhikhalha ni ashaana.<verse eid="LEV 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 20:22" />“Nvarechesheke ni upangacha malheheriyo ni malheheriyo aka onkhaye, yahikhalheke chiicho ilhapo yo Ukanaani inoorweehaakani iyo inouraphiani. <verse eid="LEV 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 20:23" />Nhittwarihe malhemalhelho a attu o ilhapo inoomolhaka uhoolho winyu, ukhalhawaya yahopangacha yayo yonkhaye ayo, ni mii kahaavenganana chinene. <verse eid="LEV 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 20:24" />Nansho kihomalha uhimeriani wiira, nokookhalha yeyo ilhapo iyo. Kinouvahani yeyo ukhalha yawinyu, ilhapo inolhoka ulhima ni uhuwa mihuwo. Mii phi Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu kuumwalhaninheni ni attu o ilhapo chikina.<verse eid="LEV 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 20:25" />“Wo chiichammo etu, mmwalhaaniheke iriyari yo mwannama ama mwaanuni norumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku ni hinorumelhelhiya. Mwannama, mwaanuni ama iriyoothe ineepurulha velhaponi va yeeshilhe aka uchereshere wiira inounanarihani, ukhalhawaya khinorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 20:26" />Ukhalhawaya mii Apwiiya Nlhuku ki ntakatifu, ni mii kihoomwalhanihani mwaattiva ni attu o ilhapo chikina wiira nkalhe attu aka, nkhalhe atakatifu.<verse eid="LEV 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 20:27" />“Nlhopwana ama nthiyana riyoothe o mashoka o nanara ama nkhwiri, hothananiya wiira eeviye wo waatiya malhuku. Iphome chaya onkhaye ayo chinookhalha vachulhu waya ashinene.”<verse eid="LEV 20:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LEV 21" />
  <para style="s1">Malheheriyo wa attu opochera ishaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 21:1" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeerelha ashinna Musa wiira, “Mwaahimerie opochera ishaani, achishaana a Naharuni wiira hikhalhe ntu munlhokoni mwaya nohalha wiinanariha wo iphiro chihinorumelhelhiya wo waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku, wo uvara ntembo wa nlhoko awe, <verse eid="LEV 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 21:2" />yaahikhalheke ntembo wa nlhoko awe oyaraana, wa anumwanawe ama wa athumwanawe, ama wa mwaamwanawe mwanlhopwana ama mwanthiyana. Wo nhima awe, <verse eid="LEV 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 21:3" />ama wa mwanrokorawe o irukulhu imoka, ni uyo khanathelhiya. <verse eid="LEV 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 21:4" />Yoyo akhalhaka ntu o ipilhi wa manyaalhoko awe, paahi etu hiinanarihe wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku.<verse eid="LEV 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 21:5" />“Opochera ishaani mena ahuuwulhe mputhu vanokhwelhiya aya, ni mena ahuuwulhe irori chaya wala ahiittume inepo mwiiruttuni. <verse eid="LEV 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 21:6" />Akhalheke atakatifu wa Nlhuku aya, ni mena ahiruwanihe nchina naka. Ukhalhawaya yayo phi novara ntheko wo ukumihera isadaka chinokumihiya wa Apwiiya Nlhuku wo mooro, ikhalhaka thoko yolhia ya Nlhuku. Paahi etu anothananiya wiira akhalheke atakatifu.<verse eid="LEV 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 21:7" />“Ukhalhawaya opochera ishaani ahokhalha atakatifu wa Nlhuku aya, paahi etu ahinthelhe nthiyana o ulhavalhava, wala nthiyana o uhithupha mooro, wala nthiyana vahiye italaka. <verse eid="LEV 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 21:8" />Mwaachuwelheke attu opochera ishaani wiira atakatifu, ukhalhawaya yayo phi nokumiha isadaka yo nkatte wa Nlhuku inyu, mwaathimicheke wiira atakatifu, ukhalhawaya mii Apwiiya Nlhuku kinoweeshani inyuva ki ntakatifu.<verse eid="LEV 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 21:9" />“Yakhalhaka mwaamwana nthiyana a opochera ishaani riyoothe alhavalhavaka ni wiinanariha wo iphiro chihinorumelhelhiya wo waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku, apahiyeke mooro ukhalhawaya nowoolhiha muru athumwanawe.<verse eid="LEV 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 21:10" />“Opochera ishaani Olhupalhe ariyoothe, ukhalhawaya yayo phi olhupalhe munlhokoni mwa ashilhoko aya, amiinelhiye makhura mmuruni mwaya ni weesheriya miono wiira aware ikuwo chitakatifu, paahi ahihiye etu ikharari chaya wo uhivacha wala ahaahulhache ikuwo chaya vaneechunlhelha aya. <verse eid="LEV 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 21:11" />Ahaatamerie ntembo mena, wala wiinanariha wo iphiro chihinorumelhelhiya wo waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku, wo uvara ntembo ata inakhalhaka wa athumwanaya ama wa anumwanaya. <verse eid="LEV 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 21:12" />Ukhalhawaya aheesheriya miono wo uhikiya makhura a Nlhuku aya mmuruni, paahi ahithame Vakittu Vatakatifu wiira alhutaane ni attu anonlha, mena ahiinanarihe wo iphiro chihinorumelhelhiya wo waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku. Mii phi Apwiiya Nlhuku.<verse eid="LEV 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 21:13" />“Opochera ishaani olhupalhe anowooria unthelha mwalhi hinathupha mooro. <verse eid="LEV 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 21:14" />Ahinthelhe nthiyana khwelhiye ni owannyawe, mena nthiyana vahiye italaka, mena nthiyana o ulhavalhava. Nansho anothananiya wiira anthelheke mwalhi o uhithupha mooro ukhuma munlhokoni mwa attu o nihimo naya anene, <verse eid="LEV 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 21:15" />ahiwe yaananariha achishaana aya anene, wo iphiro chihinorumelhelhiya wo waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku. Mii phi Apwiiya Nlhuku keeshenre miono.”<verse eid="LEV 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 21:16" />Yamalheke Apwiiya Nlhuku yaheerelha tho ashinna Musa wiira, <verse eid="LEV 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 21:17" />“Mwaahimerie Naharuni wiira, khaawo ntu inyu riyoothe o iyari chonkhaye chinowa, remanre iruttu, nohalha ukaatameria ni ukikumihera isadaka yo nkatte mii Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 21:18" />Ntu riyoothe remanre, hinoona, remanre, rii ni ikhove ikhapachiye, rii ni induri yo urekama wo upwahaniha, <verse eid="LEV 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 21:19" />ntu rii ni mweto ama moono uremanre, <verse eid="LEV 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 21:20" />ntu okhuruthuwa nthana, ama ntu okhuviaa chinene, ntu hinoona rata, ntu ri ni yo wiipelha, rii ni uvelhe ama ntu o uhuniya, haatamerie unkumihera Nlhuku nkatte awe. <verse eid="LEV 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 21:21" />Riyoothe ri mwaamwanaya opochera ishaani Naharuni remanre, hikaatamerie ukikumihera isadaka cho upahiya vamooroni, ukhalhawaya horemara, paahi haatamerie ukikumihera mii Nlhuku nkatte aka. <verse eid="LEV 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 21:22" />Yoyo ntu uyo nowooria ulhia nkatte wa Nlhuku awe, chittu chitakatifu ni chitakatifu chinene chilhe. <verse eid="LEV 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 21:23" />Nansho yakhalhaka horemara, paahi etu haatamerie nipaziya nne wala madhubahu alhe, hiwe aananariha Nihema Nitakatifu naka, wo iphiro chihinorumelhelhiya wo waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku, ukhalhawaya mii Apwiiya Nlhuku phi noupangani ukhalha atakatifu.”<verse eid="LEV 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 21:24" />Paahi alha phi malhove aahimianche aya ashinna Musa wa Naharuni ni achishaana aya ni wa attu o Israeli onkhaye.<verse eid="LEV 21:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LEV 22" />
  <para style="s1">Utakatifu wo isadaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 22:1" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayaalhehera ashinna Musa wiira, <verse eid="LEV 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 22:2" />“Mwaahimerie Naharuni ni achishaana aya eenanelheke rata chittu chitakatifu chinokumiha aya attu o Israeli uwannyaka mii, ahiwe yaaruwaniha nchina naka nitakatifu. Mii phi Apwiiya Nlhuku.<verse eid="LEV 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 22:3" />“Mwaahimerieke wiira, yakhalhaka mmoka a achishaana inyu mu iyari inyu nowaatameria chittu chitakatifu chikumihilhe aya attu o Israeli uwannyaka mii Apwiiya Nlhuku, nanananre vahinooria awe ukilhapelha wo iphiro chihinorumelhelhiya wo waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku, yoyo ntu uyo athamihiyeke umihoolho waka. Mii phi Apwiiya Nlhuku.<verse eid="LEV 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 22:4" />“Tho, yakhalhaka ntu riyoothe o iyari i Naharuni hokelhiya ni ureta wo makutulha ama nookhumiya uwooru, hilhie chittu chitakatifu mpaka vanohalha awe uttukuriya. Ni ntu riyoothe ammaraka ntu nanarihiye wo iphiro chihinorumelhelhiya wo waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku noonyalha, wo uvara ntembo ama ummara ntu khumiye ni ikhanja, <verse eid="LEV 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 22:5" />ama avaraka yo wuupiya iriyoothe ineepurulha inonnanariha ntu wo iphiro chiriyoothe chihinorumelhelhiya wo waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku, ama ntu nooria unnanariha wo iphiro chiriyoothe chihinorumelhelhiya wo waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 22:6" />Opochera ishaani ariyoothe, eenanarihaka, khanorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho unlhapelha Nlhuku mpaka uchechilho, ni ayo khanohiyereriya ulhia choolhia chitakatifu mpaka vanohalha aya urapa. <verse eid="LEV 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 22:7" />Nchuwa vanohalha aya wiilha, phi nohalha aya ukhalha oombone. Baada yo vavawo nowooria ulhia choolhia chitakatifu ukhalhawaya yeyo phi yoolhia aya. <verse eid="LEV 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 22:8" />Opochera ishaani ahikhuure inama iriyoothe yo mwannama ekwenlhe mwanene, ama wiiviya ni mwannama o mwiithuphini, ahiwe yeenanariha ni wooniya wiira khanolhoka wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku. Mii phi Apwiiya Nlhuku.<verse eid="LEV 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 22:9" />“Paahi etu opochera ishaani avarechesheke malheheriyo aka alha, ahiwe aawonya ni ukhwa. Mii phi Apwiiya Nlhuku kinaapanga ukhalha atakatifu.<verse eid="LEV 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 22:10" />“Ntu hirii o inupa ya opochera ishaani, ata nlheto aya ama ntu novara ntheko uwannyaya khanohiyereriya ulhia yolhia itakatifu. <verse eid="LEV 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 22:11" />Nansho yakhalhaka opochera ishaani ahonthuma ipotta wo nchurukhu aya anene, ama ipotta yareelhe unupani waya, yoyo nowooria ulhia yeyo yolhia yo isadaka itakatifu iyo. <verse eid="LEV 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 22:12" />Mwaana mwanthiyana a opochera ishaani thelhiye ni ntu hirii opochera ishaani, yoyo mwaamwana mwanthiyana uyo khanothananiya ulhia isadaka yo chittu chitakatifu. <verse eid="LEV 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 22:13" />Nansho yakhalhaka mwaamwana mwanthiyana uyo a opochera ishaani uyo hokhwelhiya ni owannyawe ayo, ama hovahiya italaka ni uyo kharina mwaana, ni uyo hohokolhiya uwannyawe wa athumwanawe nkaakhalha thoko vaari awe mwalhi, paahi nowooria ulhia yolhia ya athumwanawe. Ata inakhalha chiicho, nlheto khanohiyereriya ulhia chechiyo choolhia chitakatifu chiyo.<verse eid="LEV 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 22:14" />“Yakhalhaka ntu nkina hirii o nihimo na opochera ishaani noolhia choolhia chitakatifu chiyo wo uhichuwelha, paahi alhiveke yolhia iyo ni wuncherera nifungu nimoka no mafungu nthanu, ni waahokolhoshera opochera ishaani. <verse eid="LEV 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 22:15" />Opochera ishaani ahinanarihe wo iphiro chihihinorumelhelhiya wo waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku, chittu chitakatifu attu o Israeli chaakumihenre Apwiiya Nlhuku, <verse eid="LEV 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 22:16" />wo waahiyerera attu ulhia chittu chitakatifu chiyo, ni waavaha attu ayo milhatu cho waakhulha uwonya ni utteka waya wo ulhia chittu chitakatifu. Mii Apwiiya Nlhuku phi kinopanga chechiyo chittu chiyo ukhalha chitakatifu.”<verse eid="LEV 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isadaka chihinorumelhelhiya ni Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 22:17" />Yamalheke, Apwiiya Nlhuku yahaalhehera tho ashinna Musa wiira, <verse eid="LEV 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 22:18" />“Ntu riyoothe nokhalha Uisraeli ama nlheto riyoothe nnonkhalhana inyu, akumihaka isadaka awe yo upahiya, ikhalhe yo uthaphulha ishaani ama isadaka yo uttuna wawe yo waakumihera Apwiiya Nlhuku, <verse eid="LEV 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 22:19" />wiira arumelhelhiye umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, akumiheke etu ing'ope ilhopwana ama ikhondoro ilhopwana ama ipuri ihiremanre. <verse eid="LEV 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 22:20" />Nhinkumihe isadaka mwannama riyoothe o remara, isadaka iyo khinorumelhelhiya wo yoyo nlhatu uyo. <verse eid="LEV 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 22:21" />Ntu riyoothe vanaakumihera awe Apwiiya Nlhuku isadaka yo ukhalha wo mpuha wiira athaphulhe ishaani, ama isadaka yo uttuna wawe, ukhuma mumphingoni mwo wo mihuwo chawe, athananaka wiira arumelhelhiye noothananiya wiira ankumiheke mwannama timinre. <verse eid="LEV 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 22:22" />Nhinkumihe wa Apwiiya Nlhuku mwannama riyoothe ohoona, oremara, ontheelhe vakittu, nokhumiya ni uwooru, rii ni uvelhe ama ichikurukuute, wala nhaakumihe ukhalha isadaka yo upahiya vamooroni vachulhu madhubahu a Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 22:23" />Paahi, yakhalhaka, nnokumiha isadaka yo n'dume no ing'ope ama mwaakhondoro rii ni induri imoka yoorekama ama yookhuvia chinene, nkumiheke ukhalha isadaka yo uttuna winyu, nansho nhinkumihe ukhalha isadaka yo uthapulha ishaani. <verse eid="LEV 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 22:24" />Mwannama rakanlhe induri awe yo ulhopwana, ama inyakathiye, ama yuntheelhe, ama itupulhiye, mena nhaakumihere Apwiiya Nlhuku isadaka, nhiire chiicho velhaponi winyu.<verse eid="LEV 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 22:25" />“Nhaapochere mena ashinama thoko yayo athumiheriye inyu ama uvahiya ni alheto, ni ukikumihera mii ukhalha yoolhia aka. Khanorumelhelhiya wo mahalha inyu ukhalhawaya ahoremara.”<verse eid="LEV 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 22:26" />Yamalheke vavawo, Apwiiya Nlhuku yaheerelha ashinna Musa wiira, <verse eid="LEV 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 22:27" />“Mwaang'ope nlhopwana ama mwaakhondoro nlhopwana ama mwaapuri nlhopwana ayariaka akhalheke ni anumwanawe wo mahuku saba. Nansho ukhuma nihuku no nane inowooria ukumihiya wa Apwiiya Nlhuku ukhalha isadaka yo upahiya vamooroni. <verse eid="LEV 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 22:28" />Nansho yakhalhaka nnokumiha isadaka yo mwaang'ope ama mwaakhondoro, nhaahithe nihuku nimoka vamoka ni manyanaangoro aya.<verse eid="LEV 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 22:29" />“Vanohalha inyu ukikumihera isadaka yo ukishukuru mii Apwiiya Nlhuku, nkumiheke wo iphiro inohalha inyu urumelhelhiya. <verse eid="LEV 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 22:30" />Inama yo yoyo mwannama uyo ikhuuriyeke nenno nihuku, nhihalhihe inama mpaka waashelhe waya. Mii phi Apwiiya Nlhuku.<verse eid="LEV 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 22:31" />“Nvarechesheke ni upanga thoko chinolhehera aka, Mii phi Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 22:32" />Ni mena nhiruwanihe nchina naka nitakatifu, ukhalhawaya ihothananiya mii kithimichiye munlhokoni mwa attu o Israeli. Mii phi Apwiiya Nlhuku, kinouvahani utakatifu. <verse eid="LEV 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 22:33" />Phi mii kuuthaminheni ilhapo yo Umisri wiira kikhalhe Nlhuku inyu. Mii phi Apwiiya Nlhuku.”<verse eid="LEV 22:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LEV 23" />
  <para style="s1">Isikukuu chilheheriye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 23:1" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeerelha ashinna Musa wiira, <verse eid="LEV 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 23:2" />“Mwaahimerie attu o Israeli wiira, mahuku o isikukuu chithanlhilhe aka, phi mahuku o ukhalha vamoka ni ukithimicha mii.<verse eid="LEV 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 23:3" />“Mahuku o uvara ntheko arii sita, nansho nihuku no saba phi no wiittuwa, nhivare ntheko uriyoothe. Nenno phi nihuku nitakatifu, Nihuku no Wiittuwa wa Apwiiya Nlhuku mmapuroni mwinyu mwonkhaye. <verse eid="LEV 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 23:4" />Isikukuu chaka chikina mii Apwiiya Nlhuku chinohalha inyu ukhalha ni nkutano ntakatifu wo ukithimicha chipangiyeke ikatema chinttwara chipangiye.<verse eid="LEV 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isikukuu yo Pasaka ni mikatte cho uhihelhiya ihengedure</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 28:16-25">Waal 28:16-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 23:5" />“Uchechilho wo nihuku no khumi ni ncheshe no mweeri wo upacha mpangeke Isikukuu yo Pasaka wo ukithimicha mii Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 23:6" />Nihuku ninottwara yaani no khumi ni nthanu, Isikukuu yo Mikatte Cho Uhihelhiya Ihengedure ichokholheke. Wo mahuku saba, nlhieke mikatte cho uhihelhiya ihengedure. <verse eid="LEV 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 23:7" />Nihuku no upacha munlhokoni mwo mahuku saba ayo, mpangeke nkutano ntakatifu. Nenno nihuku nno nhivare ntheko. <verse eid="LEV 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 23:8" />Wo yoyo mahuku saba onkhaye ayo nkikumihereke isadaka cho upahiya vamooroni mii Apwiiya Nlhuku. Nihuku no saba mpangeke nkutano ntakatifu. Ni mena nhipange ntheko uriyoothe.”<verse eid="LEV 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isikukuu yo ulhipulhiya choolhia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 23:9" />Tho Apwiiya Nlhuku yaheerelha ashinna Musa, <verse eid="LEV 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 23:10" />“Mwaahimerieke attu o Israeli wiira, vanohalha aya ukhalha ilhapo inaavaha aka, nkayaaruweria choolhia chaya, yaawiihereke opochera ishaani ihiru yo milhipu cho choolhia chiyo. <verse eid="LEV 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 23:11" />Opochera ishaani atheesheke uchulhu ihiru wooniha wiira anaakumihera Apwiiya Nlhuku, nihuku ninottwara Nihuku no Wiittuwa, wiira nrumelhelhiye. <verse eid="LEV 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 23:12" />Nenno nihuku nno vanooniha aya yeyo ihiru ikumihiye iyo umihoolho waka, nnothananiya wiira mwaakumihereke Apwiiya Nlhuku isadaka yo upahiya yo mwaakhondoro nlhopwana o iyaakha imoka hiremanre. <verse eid="LEV 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 23:13" />Vamoka ni yeyo isadaka iyo, akumiheke isadaka yo choolhia ikilo piilhi cho iphepa yo shilhia ithakanihiye ni makhura o izeituni, inokumihiya wa Apwiiya Nlhuku wo mooro, nihiriri naya nno ninookichivelha. Isadaka aya yo uwuriya ikhalheke idivai ilita imoka. <verse eid="LEV 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 23:14" />Nihinaaya nenno nihuku no waawiihera Apwiiya Nlhuku isadaka iyo, nhilhie milhipu cho choolhia chinyu, chikithi, cho waarikiya ama chooshiye ukhalha mikatte. Alha phi malheheriyo aya o uttwara mahuku onkhaye wo iyari chaya chonkhaye vakittu variwoothe vanohalha aya ukhalha.<verse eid="LEV 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isikukuu yo ukhunguriya choolhia</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 28:26-31">Waal 28:26-31</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:9-12">Itor 16:9-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 23:15" />“Mwaalhakelheke ijuma saba ukhuma nne nihuku ninottwara Nihuku no Wiittuwa nne vaatheshilhe inyu ihiru yo isadaka wooniha wiira nnokikumihera mii Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 23:16" />Mwaalhakelheke mpaka nihuku no makhumi nthanu, yaani nihuku no nayeelhi, baada yo Nihuku no Wiittuwa no saba, nkikumihereke mii Apwiiya Nlhuku isadaka yo choolhia cho naanano. <verse eid="LEV 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 23:17" />Kila inupa, attu awiiheke mikatte miilhi cho isadaka yo utheeshiya wooniha wiira inokumihiya umihoolho waka mii Apwiiya Nlhuku. Kila nkatte unothananiya wiira ukooroshiye wo ikilo piilhi cho iphepa yo shilhia ihelhiye ihengedure ukikumihera mii Apwiiya Nlhuku isadaka yo milhipu chinyu. <verse eid="LEV 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 23:18" />Vamoka ni yayo, mwaakumiheke ashikhondoro saba o iyaakha imoka ahiremanre, n'dume no ing'ope nimoka ni ikhondoro chilhopwana piilhi. Yayo ashinama ayo anookhalha isadaka yo upahiya vamooroni vamoka ni isadaka yo choolhia ni isadaka yo uwuriya. Nihiriri no chechiyo isadaka chiyo ninookichivelha mii Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 23:19" />Nkumiheke ipuri ilhopwana imoka yo isadaka yo uthamiha uwonya ni ikhondoro piilhi chilhopwana cho iyaakha imoka wo nlhatu no isadaka cho uwiiha mpuha. <verse eid="LEV 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 23:20" />Opochera ishaani atheesheke uchulhu umihoolho waka, ukikumihera mii Apwiiya Nlhuku, vamoka ni nkatte wo milhipu cho choolhia ni ikhondoro piilhi chilhe. Chechiyo chinohalha ulhiya ni opochera ishaani. <verse eid="LEV 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 23:21" />Nenno nihuku nno mwiihaniheke nkutano ntakatifu, nhivare ntheko. Alha phi malheheriyo inyu o uttwara mahuku onkhaye ni iyari chinyu chonkhaye, mmapuroni winyu.<verse eid="LEV 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 23:22" />“Vanokhungura inyu choolhia chinyu mmatani, mena nhikungure chonkhaye mpaka mmwiinanoni mwo imata inyu wala nhihokolhie utulhi urokottacha chihanlhe. Mwaahiyereke amashikini ni alheto. Mii phi Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu.”<verse eid="LEV 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isikukuu yo wuupuwelhiya woopiya wo mapalhapata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 29:1-6">Waal 29:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 23:23" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeerelha ashinna Musa wiira, <verse eid="LEV 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 23:24" />“Mwaahimerieke attu o Israeli wiira, nihuku no upacha no mweeri wo saba nikhalheke nihuku no wiittuwa, nihuku ninohalha uhimiachiya wo woopiya nipalhapata ni upangiya nkutano ntakatifu. <verse eid="LEV 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 23:25" />Nhivare ntheko nenno nihuku nno, nansho nnothananiya wiira nkikumihereke isadaka yo upahiya vamooroni mii Apwiiya Nlhuku.”<verse eid="LEV 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nihuku no waathanihaniya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 29:7-11">Waal 29:7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 23:26" />Apwiiya Nlhuku yaheerelha ashinna Musa, <verse eid="LEV 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 23:27" />“Nihuku no khumi no mweeri ulha wo saba ulha phi nihuku no waathanihaniya. Nenno nihuku nno phi nihuku no ukhalha ni nkutano ntakatifu. Nttukeke, ni ukumiha isadaka chinokumiheriya Apwiiya Nlhuku wo mooro. <verse eid="LEV 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 23:28" />Nhivare mitheko chinyu chiriyoothe nenno nihuku nno. Ukhalhawaya nenno phi nihuku no waathanihaniya, nihuku no uwaathanihani umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu. <verse eid="LEV 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 23:29" />Ntu riyoothe hinohalha uttuka nenno nihuku nno, eeviyeke ni manyaalhoko awe. <verse eid="LEV 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 23:30" />Ntu riyoothe nohalha uvara ntheko uriyoothe nenno nihuku nno kinonrimeelhiha ukhuma wa attu awe. <verse eid="LEV 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 23:31" />Nhivare ntheko mena! Alha phi malheheriyo o uttwara mahuku onkhaye, iyari chinyu chonkhaye, ni mmapuroni mwinyu mwonkhaye. <verse eid="LEV 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 23:32" />Nenno nihuku nno, ninaakhalheke uwannyu phi nihuku no wiittuwa ni uttuka. Nihuku no Wiittuwa phi nihuku no khumi no ulha mweeri ulha, ukhuma uchechilho mpaka uchechilho wo nihuku ninottwara.”<verse eid="LEV 23:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isikukuu yo marapatta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 29:12-39">Waal 29:12-39</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:13-17">Itor 16:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 23:33" />Apwiiya Nlhuku aheerelha ashinna Musa tho wiira, <verse eid="LEV 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 23:34" />“Mwaahimerie attu o Israeli, Ukhuma nihuku no khumi ni nthanu no ulha mweeri wo saba ulha mwaapangelheke Apwiiya Nlhuku isikukuu yo marapatta wo mahuku saba. Yeyo phi isikukuu ya Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 23:35" />Nihuku no upacha no yayo mahuku saba ayo, nkhalheke nkutano ntakatifu ni vavawo mena nhivare ntheko uriyoothe. <verse eid="LEV 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 23:36" />Wo mahuku saba nkumiheke isadaka chinovahiya aya Apwiiya Nlhuku. Baada yo mahuku saba, nihuku ninottwara yaani nihuku no nane, nkhalheke nkutano ntakatifu ni waakumihera Apwiiya Nlhuku isadaka yo upahiya vamooroni. Yoyo nkutano uyo phi ntakatifu. Ni nenno nihuku nno nhivare ntheko uriyoothe.<verse eid="LEV 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 23:37" />“Chilha phi isikukuu cha Apwiiya Nlhuku cheeshiye chinohalha inyu uhimiacha wiira nkhalhe nkutano ntakatifu wo waakumihera Apwiiya Nlhuku isadaka chinokumihiya wo mooro. Yaani isadaka cho urimeelhihiya, ni cho choolhia, idhabihu ni isadaka cho uwuriya, kila isadaka imoka wo nihuku no vekha aya. <verse eid="LEV 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 23:38" />Chechiyo isadaka chiyo phi vamoka ni chilhe chinokikumihera inyu mii Apwiiya Nlhuku nihuku no Wiittuwa ukhalha thoko isadaka cho mahuku ene chiyo, isadaka cho uthapulha ishaani chinyu, ni isadaka chaya cho uttuna winyu chinaakumihera inyu Apwiiya Nlhuku.<verse eid="LEV 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 23:39" />“Mwamalhihaka ukhungura mmamatani mwinyu mpangeke isikukuu wo mahuku saba ukhuma nihuku no khumi ni nthanu no mweeri wo saba, nihuku no upacha nikhalheke no wiittuwa ni chiicho nihuku no nane. <verse eid="LEV 23:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 23:40" />Nihuku no upacha nkusheke maphepu o miri chinyu chorera ni maritta o mittende, ni maritta arii ni mathaakhuru menchi ni maritta o miri chinomelha nchereshere mwoolhoko, ni uttapelhelha isikukuu umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, Nlhuku inyu wo mahuku saba. <verse eid="LEV 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 23:41" />Kila iyaakha nnothananiya nttapelhelheke ilha isikukuu ilha wo mahuku saba wo waathimicha Apwiiya Nlhuku. Alha phi malheheriyo o uttwara mahuku onkhaye wo iyari inyu. Mpangeke mweeri wo saba. <verse eid="LEV 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 23:42" />Wo ikatema yo mahuku saba nkhalheke mmarapattani. Anenchi onkhaye o Israeli akhalheke mmarapattani yayo mahuku ayo. <verse eid="LEV 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 23:43" />Yeyo ittu iyo inowoopusha iyari chinyu wiira vaathaminhe aka manyapwiiya inyu ilhapo yo Umisri, kahaakhalhiha mmarapatani. Mii phi Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu.”<verse eid="LEV 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 23:44" />Paahi ashinna Musa yahaahimiachera attu o Israeli malheheriyo o isikukuu cho waathimicha Apwiiya Nlhuku.<verse eid="LEV 23:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LEV 24" />
  <para style="s1">Ikhandiri cho Vakittu Vatakatifu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 27:20-21">Utt 27:20-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 24:1" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeerelha ashinna Musa wiira, <verse eid="LEV 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 24:2" />“Mwaalhehere attu o Israeli awiihe makhura o izeituni oombone chinene, wo nlhatu no ikhandiri cho Nihema Nitakatifu, wiira ikhandiri chiyo chithepeke upharelha ikatema yoothe. <verse eid="LEV 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 24:3" />Ni Naharuni eesheke chechiyo ikhandiri chiyo nhina Nihema Nitakatifu, vathe wo nipaziya no Nisanduku no Malhehano wiira chipharelhe umihoolho waka uchokholhelha uhiyu mpaka wichishu. Alha phi malheheriyo anohalha inyu uttwara mahuku onkhaye munlhokoni mwinyu. <verse eid="LEV 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 24:4" />Athomieke ikhandiri chiyo vachulhu iphata yo idhahabu yoombone, wiira chipharelhe umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku mahuku onkhaye.<verse eid="LEV 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mikatte chinokumihiya wa Apwiiya Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 24:5" />“Akusheke iphepa yo shilhia kilo khumi ni piilhi, akoorosheke mikatte khumi ni miilhi. <verse eid="LEV 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 24:6" />Amalhihaka, eesheke isaafu piilhi yo chechiyo mikatte chiyo vachulhu imeza yo idhahabu yoombone, yaani kila isafu mikatte sita, eesheke umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 24:7" />Athathaaniheke ikikombe cho idhahabu chihelhiye ubani woombone kila isafu yo mikatte chiyo, wiira ubani uyo upahiyeke badala yo mikatte chiyo, ni ukhalha isadaka yo nuupusho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 24:8" />Ni kila Nihuku no Wiittuwa, Naharuni athatheke rata isafu yo mikatte cho naanano chiyo umihoolho wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, wo nlhatu no attu o Israeli ukhalha malhehano o mahuku o uhimalha. <verse eid="LEV 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 24:9" />Naharuni ni iyari aya vekha aya phi vahiye ulhia chechiyo mikatte chiyo. Alhelhieke vakittu vatakatifu, ukhalhawaya phi mpatta ntakatifu chinene unokumiheriya aka mii Apwiiya Nlhuku wo mooro. Chechiyo chawaya mahuku onkhaye.”<verse eid="LEV 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Utwarushiya we ikekhiaye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 24:10" />Nihuku nimoka wahokhalha waakhulhaniya unikambini uwo, mmirawo mmoka yariye ni nthiyana Mwisraeli nansho athumwanawe Mmisri, waakhulhana ni Mwisraeli mmoka. <verse eid="LEV 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 24:11" />Yoyo mmirawo uyo aayariye ni nthiyana eehaniya Shelmothi, biti Dibri o nihimo ni Nadani, aholhava ni uruwana nchina na Nlhuku. Paahi attu ahonrweha wa ashinna Musa, <verse eid="LEV 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 24:12" />nkayantteelha mpaani mpaka Apwiiya Nlhuku vanohalha aya waapatakulhelha attu nlhove no umpangelha yoyo mmirawo uyo.<verse eid="LEV 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 24:13" />Paahi Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeerelha ashinna Musa, <verse eid="LEV 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 24:14" />“Munkusheke mmirawo lhanve uyo munrweheke uchereshere nikambi. Ni attu onkhaye yamwiiwilhe vaaruwana awe, yeesheke miono chaya vamuruni wawe ni nlhoko wonkhaye umwaateke malhuku ni umwiiva. <verse eid="LEV 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 24:15" />Ni inyu mwaahimerieke attu o Israeli wiira ntu riyoothe nohalha unruwana Nlhuku awe, nootwarushiya wo uwonya wawe. <verse eid="LEV 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 24:16" />Ntu riyoothe akhalhe nnenchi ama nlheto naaruwana Apwiiya Nlhuku, nlhoko wonkhaye umwaateke malhuku ni umwiiva.<verse eid="LEV 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 24:17" />“Ntu riyoothe nomwiiva ntu nkina, ni uyo eeviyeke. <verse eid="LEV 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 24:18" />Ntu riyoothe nomwiiva mwannama a nkhunanawe, anlhiveke nkhunanawe mwannama nkumi.<verse eid="LEV 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 24:19" />“Ntu riyoothe nohalha unrakalhiha owaatamana awe, ni uyo arakalhihiyeke wo ulhikaana chinrakalhinhe awe owaatamana awe. <verse eid="LEV 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 24:20" />Yakhalhaka homuntha nikhuva ni uyo onthiyeke nikhuva, niitho wo niitho, ni niino wo niino. Kila ntu nrakalhinhe nkhunanawe ni uyo arakalhihiyeke wo ulhikaana ni ittu impannge awe nkhunanawe. <verse eid="LEV 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 24:21" />Nomwiiva mwannama a nkhunanawe anlhiveke mwannama nkina, nansho ntu riyoothe amwiivaka ntu nkina ni uyo eeviyeke. <verse eid="LEV 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 24:22" />Alha malheheriyo alha anaacha attu onkhaye alheto ni anenchi. Mii phi Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu.”<verse eid="LEV 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 24:23" />Paahi ashinna Musa nkayaahimeria attu o Israeli yayo malheheriyo onkhaye ayo. Nkayanrweha ntu aaruwanne Apwiiya Nlhuku ulhe uchereshere nikambi nkaatiya malhuku, nkeeviya. attu o Israeli nkayaapanga thoko Apwiiya Nlhuku chaalhehenre aya ashinna Musa.<verse eid="LEV 24:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="LEV 25" />
  <para style="s1">Iyaakha yo saba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 15:1-11">Itor 15:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 25:1" />Tho, Apwiiya Nlhuku yahoolhumana ashinna Musa umwaakoni Usinai ni weerelha, yeerelhe attu o Israeli wiira, <verse eid="LEV 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 25:2" />“Vanohalha aya uphiya ilhapo kinaavaha aka mii Apwiiya Nlhuku, kila iyakha yo saba eettuwiheke ilhapo, ahilhime wo waathimicha Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 25:3" />Iyaakha sita alhimeke ni waalha, alhimelheke izabibu chaya akhwachereke ni ukhungura. <verse eid="LEV 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 25:4" />Nansho iyaakha yo saba ikhalheke phi iyaakha yo wiittuwiha ilhapo wo nlhatu wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. Ahaalhe ittu iriyoothe wala ukhwachera mizabibu chaya. <verse eid="LEV 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 25:5" />Ahikungure wala urukulha ittu iriyoothe inomelha ineeneru, ama izabibu cho miri chinyu chihikhwacheriye. Yeyo ikhalheke iyaakha yo wiittuwiha ilhapo. <verse eid="LEV 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 25:6" />Inakhalhaka chiicho etu, ilha iyaakha yo wiittuwihiya ilhapo ilha, ilhapo inouvahani choolhia, mwaattiva mwaashinene, ipotta chinyu, anamitheko inyu vamoka ni alheto anokhalha mmawannyu. <verse eid="LEV 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 25:7" />Tho, mihuwo chinyu ni ashinama o mwiithuphini anokhalha munlhokoni mwinyu, anoopatta choolhia. Ittu iriyoothe inohalha uyara velhaponi, ilhiyeke.<verse eid="LEV 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isikukuu yo iyaakha yo makhumi nthanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 25:8" />“Aalhakelheke iyaakha saba mikwaha saba ni iyo inaakhalheke iyaakha makhumi ncheshe ni tisa. <verse eid="LEV 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 25:9" />Yamalhakaru, nihuku no khumi no mweeri wo saba, niri phi nihuku no waathanihiya, munrumeke ntu oopeke nipalhapata ilhapo yonkhaye. <verse eid="LEV 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 25:10" />Nthimicheke iyaakha yo makhumi nthanu, wo waavaha uneethi ipotta chonkhaye velhaponi. Phi isikukuu yo wuupusheriya iyaakha yo makhumi nthanu. Kila mmoka aya ahokolhelheke nhakhu awe, ahokolhieke wa ashilhoko awe. <verse eid="LEV 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 25:11" />Ukhalhawaya ilha iyaakha ilha phi yo isikukuu yo wuupuwelhiya iyaakha makhumi nthanu, paahi etu nhaalhe imbeyu ama ukhungura iriyoothe inomelha ineneru wala urukulha izabibu cho miri chihikhwacheriye. <verse eid="LEV 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 25:12" />Ni ukhalhawaya ilha iyaakha ilha phi yo isikukuu uwannyu, ikhalheke iyaakha itakatifu. Paahi etu nlhieke chittu chinomelha chineneru mmatani mwinyu.<verse eid="LEV 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 25:13" />“Ilha iyaakha yo isikukuu ilha, kila mmoka inyu aholhosheke imata iriyoothe yaathumilhe awe wa mwanene. <verse eid="LEV 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 25:14" />Paahi nhaanyenge owaatamana inyu, vanothuma inyu ama vanaathumihera inyu imata. <verse eid="LEV 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 25:15" />Ibei yo imata iyo iromolhiyeke wo uwehiya iyaakha chihanlhe ihinaya uphiya iyaakha yo isikukuu yo makhumi nthanu yo uhokolhoshiya wa mwanene. <verse eid="LEV 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 25:16" />Yakhalhaka iyaakha chihanlhe phi chinchi muncherereke ibei. Ni yakhalhaka iyaakha chihanlhe chiyo chiri vakani mmukulheke ibei iyo, ukhalhawaya ibei aya inohalha uphimiya wo ulhikaana ni choolhia chinohalha ukhunguriya. <verse eid="LEV 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 25:17" />Nhinyengane nansho mmwoveke Nlhuku inyu. Mii phi Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu.<verse eid="LEV 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 25:18" />“Paahi etu nvarechesheke malheheriyo aka onkhaye ni upanga, wiira nthepeke ukhalha rata velhaponi. <verse eid="LEV 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 25:19" />Ilhapo inooyara choolhia chinchi chinene, ni inyu nnoopatta choolhia nkamwaawona, ni ukhalha rata.<verse eid="LEV 25:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 25:20" />“Nansho paanepa nnowuupuwelha wiira, ‘Ninaalhiekeni iyaakha yo saba yakhalhaka ninoochichihiya waalha wala ukhungura choolhia chihu?’ <verse eid="LEV 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 25:21" />Eiyo! Mii kinoovahera ibarakha ilhapo iyaakha yo sita, ni iyo inouvahani choolhia cho uthosha wo iyaakha ttaaru. <verse eid="LEV 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 25:22" />Vanohalha inyu waalha iyaakha yo nane vanoweherera inyu ukhungura, nnaalhieke choolhia cho iyaakha chivinre chiyo, mpaka iyaakha yo tisa, vanohalha inyu uchokholha ukhungura tho.<verse eid="LEV 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ntheko wo woopolhiya imata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 25:23" />“Ilhapo ihithumihiye mena mena, ukhalhawaya yeyo yawaka, ni mwaattiva alheto ni inyu attu o uvira velhaponi waka va. <verse eid="LEV 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 25:24" />Phi nlhatu etu ilhapo inyu yonkhaye nnookhalhana iphiro cho woopolha imata.<verse eid="LEV 25:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 25:25" />“Yakhalhaka Muisraeli naninyu nookhalha mmashikini, nkaathumiha imata awe, paahi mmuchi awe oopolheke. <verse eid="LEV 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 25:26" />Yakhalhaka yoyo ntu uyo kharina mmuchi nohalha wooria woopolha, nansho kaanyuma aya nowa ukhalha ntu o nhakhu, ni wooria woopolha ilhapo awe, <verse eid="LEV 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 25:27" />paahi aalhakelheke iyaakha chonkhaye ukhuma vaathumihilhe awe, alhiveke, ni ntu thumme noothananiya wiira anhokolhoshereke mwanene. <verse eid="LEV 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 25:28" />Nansho yakhalhaka khanooria woopolha, paahi, inoohalha mmathathani mwa ntu thumilhe ulhe mpaka iyaakha yo isikukuu yo wuupusheriya iyaakha makhumi nthanu. Yeyo iyaakha iyo, yoyo nhakhu uyo uhiyereriye ni uhokolhosheriya ntu thumihilhe ulhe.<verse eid="LEV 25:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 25:29" />“Ntu athumihaka inupa inokhalha awe, irii nhina iwani ithekelhiye ukucho, nowooria woopolha wo ikatema yo iyaakha imoka ukhuma vaathumihilhe awe. Wo yeyo iyaakha yonkhaye iyo nookhalha ni ikekhia yo woopolha. <verse eid="LEV 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 25:30" />Nansho inupa irii iwani ithekelhiye ukucho wo ishiri yaahopolhiyeke wo ikatema yo iyaakha imoka, paahi inookhalha yawawe thumilhe ulhe iyaakha chonkhaye iyari chaya chonkhaye. Wala khinohokolhoshiya iyaakha yo isikukuu yo wuupusheriya iyaakha makhumi nthanu. <verse eid="LEV 25:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 25:31" />Nansho inupa chiri iwani chihirukurerihiye ukucho chinowaalhakelhiya thoko imata. Chinowooria woopolhiya wo iyaakha imoka, nansho chiyo chinothananiya wiira chihokolhoshiyeke iyaakha yo wuupusheriya iyaakha makhumi nthanu. <verse eid="LEV 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 25:32" />Ata inakhalhaka chiicho etu, inupa chiri iwani cha Alawi, chinowooria woopolhiya ikatema iriyoothe. <verse eid="LEV 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 25:33" />Paahi etu yakhalhaka inupa ya Nlawi inoothumihiya ni uhihokolhoshiya, iweeke etu yaahokolhoshiya iyaakha yo makhumi nthanu, ukhalhawaya phi chiyo chivahiye aya ukhalha chawaya munlhokoni mwa attu o Israeli ikatema yonkhaye. <verse eid="LEV 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 25:34" />Nansho ilhapo chinohuwelha aya Alawi mihuwo vamoka, chihithumihiye, ukhalhawaya chechiyo phi ilhapo chihiyeriye aya ikatema yonkhaye.<verse eid="LEV 25:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Waakopiha attu amashikini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 25:35" />“Yakhalhaka Muisraeli nkhunaninyu hokhalha mmashikini ama hiinooria wiipattelha mwanene uno akhalhaka vamoka ni inyuva, nnothananiya wiira, munshungeke athepe ukhalha ni inyuva, thoko chinopanga inyu wa nlheto ama ntu ovira rii munlhokoni mwinyu. <verse eid="LEV 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 25:36" />Mwankopihaka nhithanane ulhiviya ifaida yo iphiro iriyoothe. Nansho mmwooveke Nlhuku, ni inyu nthepeke unkhalhana munlhokoni mwinyu. <verse eid="LEV 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 25:37" />Nhinkopihe nchurukhu wiira mpatte ifaida ama unvaha yoolhia wiira olhiveni. <verse eid="LEV 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 25:38" />Muupuwelheke wiira, Mii phi Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu, kuuthaminheni ilhapo yo Umisri wiira kuuvaheni ilhapo yo Ukanaani wiira ni mii kikhalhe Nlhuku inyu.<verse eid="LEV 25:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Waahiyerera ipotta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 25:39" />“Yakhalhaka Muisraeli nkhunaninyu nokhalha munlhokoni mwinyu hokhalha mmashikini, ethumihaka uwannyu, nhimpange thoko ipotta. <verse eid="LEV 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 25:40" />Mumpangelheke uwannyu thoko namitheko ama thoko ntu o uvira. Munvariheke ntheko mpaka iyaakha yo isikukuu yo iyaakha makhumi nthanu. <verse eid="LEV 25:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 25:41" />Yeyo iyaakha iyo mummaheke uneethi, munhiyerereke vamoka ni achishaana awe, ahokolhie wa manyaalhoko awe, urii nhakhu awe wo uhiyeriya ni manyaathumwanawe. <verse eid="LEV 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 25:42" />Ukhalhawaya attu o Israeli phi anamitheko aka kaathaminhe aka ilhapo yo Umisri, paahi etu ahithumihiye thoko ipotta. <verse eid="LEV 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 25:43" />Nhaataware attu o Israeli wo ushilhilhi, nansho mmwooveke Nlhuku inyu. <verse eid="LEV 25:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 25:44" />Mwaathananaka ipotta, mwaathumeke attu o ilhapo chikina cho waatamana. <verse eid="LEV 25:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 25:45" />Tho, mwaathumeke ipotta ukhuma wa alheto anokhalha munlhokoni mwinyu ni ashilhoko aya ayareelhe mwiilhaponi winyu ni ayo anookhalha awinyu. <verse eid="LEV 25:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 25:46" />Yayo mwakhwaaka, nnowooria waahiyera achishaana inyu, akhalhe ipotta chaya mahuku onkhaye. Yayo aapangeke ipotta chaya, nansho nhaataware ashilhoko inyu attu o Israeli wo ushilhilhi.<verse eid="LEV 25:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 25:47" />“Yakhalhaka nlheto ama ntu ovira nokhalha munlhokoni winyu hokhalha ntu o nhakhu, ni nlhoko inyu hokhalha mmashikini nkeethumiha wa yoyo nlheto ama ntu o uvira uyo ama wa nlhoko awe, <verse eid="LEV 25:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LEV 25:48" />nowooria woopolhiya baada yo wowo wiithumiha uwo, nlhoko awe mmoka nowooria umwoopolha. <verse eid="LEV 25:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LEV 25:49" />Athatha awe chiicho anowooria umwoopolha, ama nshivani awe, ama nlhoko awe o nihimo nawe, ama nowooria wiichoopolha mwanene akhalhaka ni nhakhu. <verse eid="LEV 25:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LEV 25:50" />Yoyo avaraanaka ni ntu nthumme uyo, aalhakelhelhiyeke toka veethuminhe awe mpaka iyaakha yo upangiya isikukuu yo wuupusheriya iyaakha makhumi nthanu. Malhivo o uhiyereriya wawe alhikaaneke ni iyaakha chivanre awe ntheko. Mahuku nokhalha awe ipotta ya ntu iphimiyeke thoko a ntu rii munthekoni. <verse eid="LEV 25:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LEV 25:51" />Yakhalhaka iyaakha mpaka iyaakha yo wuupusheriya iyaakha yo makhumi nthanu chinookhalha chinchi chinene, paahi ahokolhosheke nifungu nuulhupalhe chinene no ibei ilhivelhiye awe. <verse eid="LEV 25:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LEV 25:52" />Ni vavawo yakhalhaka iyaakha chihanlhe vakani ihinaya uphiyelha isikukuu yo wuupusheriya iyaakha yo makhumi nthanu, aalhakelhelhiyeke nifungu nihanlhe ninolhikaana ni iyaakha chiyo, ni unlhiva ifidiya. <verse eid="LEV 25:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LEV 25:53" />Ikatema yonkhaye vanokhalha awe wa ntu, akhalhaniyeke etu thoko namitheko o ulhiviya kila iyaakha. Ni ntu nthumilhe uyo hinkhalhane wo ushilhilhi. <verse eid="LEV 25:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LEV 25:54" />Nansho yakhalhaka yoyo ntu uyo ni alhoko awe khoopolhiye wo chechiyo iphiro chiyo, paahi etu avahiyeke uneethi iyaakha yo wuupusheriya iyaakha yo makhumi nthanu. <verse eid="LEV 25:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LEV 25:55" />attu o Israeli phi anamitheko aka, ukhalhawaya kaathamihilhe ilhapo yo Umisri. Mii phi Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu.”<verse eid="LEV 25:55" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="LEV 26" />
  <para style="s1">Ibarakha cho waathimicha Apwiiya Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 7:12-24">Itor 7:12-24</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 28:1-14">28:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 26:1" />“Nhikooroshe isinyago cho milhuku cho woothachiya, nhivare isinyago chaya cho uhemiya wala mikurio wala isinyago cho malhuku ahemiye velhaponi winyu ni wooromelha. Mii phi Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu. <verse eid="LEV 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 26:2" />Nvarechesheke Nihuku no Wiittuwa naka ni uthimicha Nihema Nitakatifu naka, vanokilhapelha inyu. Mii phi Apwiiya Nlhuku inyu.<verse eid="LEV 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 26:3" />“Mwattwaraka malhehero aka ni urumelhelha malheheriyo aka, <verse eid="LEV 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 26:4" />kinoorupiha ipulha iyiitha, wiira ilhapo iruwerie choolhia chinchi, ni miri cho mmamatani chinooyara maphepu aya. <verse eid="LEV 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 26:5" />Nnoothepa ukhungura choolhia mpaka nlhalha wo urukulha izabibu, ni nlhalha wo izabibu unoothepa mpaka ikatema yo waalha imbeyu. Ni inyu nnolhia yolhia inothanana inyu ni ukhalha wo mpuha velhaponi.<verse eid="LEV 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 26:6" />“Nnookhalha wo mpuha velhaponi winyu, ni inyu nnoorupa wo uhikhalha ntu riyoothe o uwoopopihani. Kinoothamiha mashene velhaponi, ni ilhapo inyu khinaatakana ikhoto. <verse eid="LEV 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 26:7" />Nnowoomolha amalhaponi inyu ni weeva wo uphanga. <verse eid="LEV 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 26:8" />Attu athanu munlhokoni mwinyu anowoomolha amalhaponi imia imoka, ni attu imia imoka munlhokoni mwinyu anowoomolha amalhaponi maelufu khumi. Amalhaponi inyu anoowulhuwa umihoolho winyu wo uphanga. <verse eid="LEV 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 26:9" />Kinouvahani ibarakha wiira mwaapatte achishaana enchi ni wunchereria, ni mii kinoolhipiha malhehano kilhenhe aka uwannyu mwaatti. <verse eid="LEV 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 26:10" />Nnooruweria choolhia chinchi, ni nlhalha wo ukhungura bado nnoothepa ulhia choolhia chishunnge inyu mmakhupini. Tho, nnookukhulhulha choolhia chihanlhe mmakhupini, wiira mpatte nipesha no uhelha choolhia cho naanano. <verse eid="LEV 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 26:11" />Kinookhalha munlhokoni mwinyu mu Nihema Nitakatifu naka, akinoohiyani mena. <verse eid="LEV 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 26:12" />Kinoweeta iriyari inyu, kinookhalha Nlhuku inyu ni mwaattiva nnookhalha attu aka. <verse eid="LEV 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 26:13" />Mii phi Apwiiya Nlhuku, kuuthaminheni ilhapo yo Umisri wiira nhikhalhe ipotta cho Umisri. Mii kihouthaphulhani nikongwa noutwarushani, ni uweetihani wo wookwaa.”<verse eid="LEV 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Utwarushiya wo nlhatu no itiyamaru</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 28:15-68">Itor 28:15-68</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 26:14" />Apwiiya Nlhuku nkayeera tho, “Nansho mwaahikiwelhelheke wala uttwara malheheriyo onkhaye alha, <verse eid="LEV 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 26:15" />ni mwaakhotaka malhehero aka ni uhiya wiinanelha malheheriyo onkhaye ni wuntha malhehano aka, <verse eid="LEV 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 26:16" />paahi mii kinowaatani. Kinouwiiherani mariro molhupalhe wo ghafula ni inyu nnowoova, mareta molhupalhe ni ikwerere chihineewa nrete, chinohalha uttukani miitho nhoone ni uwootihani. Nnowaalha imbeyu chinyu nansho khannopatta ittu ukhalhawaya amalhaponi inyu phi nohalha ulhia. <verse eid="LEV 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 26:17" />Mii kinoorukunuwa ni uhiyani ni inyu nnowaatiya ni amalhaponi inyu, nnootawariya ni attu anoovengani alhe. Nnowoopopihiya ni uttawa, hikhalhaka ntu riyoothe nootoporani.<verse eid="LEV 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 26:18" />“Ni yakhalhaka bado khannokiiwelhelha ata baada yo wowo utwarushiya uwo, paahi kinoothepiha chinene ntwarusho ninyu mikwaha saba, wo nlhatu no uwonya winyu. <verse eid="LEV 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 26:19" />Kinoopwesha itiyamaru inyu, ni irimu yo uchulhu winyu iyo inoolhipa thoko iyuuma. Ipulha khinowa yaarupa, ni ilhapo inookhalha yo ulhipa thoko ishaaba. <verse eid="LEV 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 26:20" />Nnoopanga chittu wo machiri inyu wo uhipatta ittu ukhalhawaya imata chinyu khachinowa chemma choolhia ni ilhapo khinoyara maphepu.<verse eid="LEV 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 26:21" />“Mwathepaka ukivaanyiha ni ukhota ukiiwelhelha, kinoothepiha utwarushiya winyu mikwaha saba, wo ulhikaana ni winchiva wo uwonya winyu. <verse eid="LEV 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 26:22" />Kinowawiiha mashene munlhokoni mwinyu anohalha waakhuura achishaana inyu, ni wiivakacha mihuwo chinyu, ni uwukulhani mpaka mitalha chinyu khachinowa choonia attu, ni ukhalha thoko uthako.<verse eid="LEV 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 26:23" />“Yakhalhaka ata baada yo wowo utwarushiya uwo khannokihokolhelha mii, nansho nthepaka ukivaanyiha, <verse eid="LEV 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 26:24" />paahi ni mii kinoovengana ni inyu, ni utwarushani chinene mikwaha saba wo nlhatu no uwonya winyu. <verse eid="LEV 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 26:25" />Kinouwiiherani ikhoto inohalha ulhivelhelhiha mwaha wo malhehano ahiilhe inyu uttwara. Mwattawelhaka mmawani mwinyu, kinouwiiherani mareta ahineewa nrete, ni inyu nnoovarakachiya ni amalhaponi inyu. <verse eid="LEV 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 26:26" />Kinoowukulha yoolhia inyu, mpaka manyaathiyana khumi anowa uterekha niikho nimoka tu woosha mikatte chonkhaye ni ukawelhani vakani vakani. Ni ata mwalhiaka, khannowona.<verse eid="LEV 26:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 26:27" />“Ni yakhalhaka baada yo yayo onkhaye ayo khannokiiwelhelha nkamwaathepa ukiivanyiha, <verse eid="LEV 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 26:28" />paahi ni mii kinouvingani inyu wo urushiya chinene, ni utwarushani chinene mii kimwanene mikwaha saba wo nlhatu no uwonya winyu. <verse eid="LEV 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 26:29" />Ithalha inowa uthepa chinene, ni inyu nnoowa mwaakhura achishaana inyu ashilhopwana ni ashithiyana. <verse eid="LEV 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 26:30" />Kinootanganyacha mapuro inyu o ulhapelhelha umiakoni, kinoophomolha madhubahu inyu o ututumihera ubani ni urihelha mitembo chinyu vachulhu isinyago cho milhuku chinyu. Ni mii kinouvengani chinene. <verse eid="LEV 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 26:31" />Kinorimeelhiha iwani chinyu, kinorimeelhiha vakittu vatakatifu vanolhapelha inyu, vakhalhe mathalha, ni mahiriri inyu o nukhelha o isadaka chinyu khanorumelhelhiya mena. <verse eid="LEV 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 26:32" />Kinoopaha mooro ilhapo inyu wiira ata amalhaponi anohalha uthamelha mwommo ayo anooshanga. <verse eid="LEV 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 26:33" />Kinowiiha ikhoto mwiilhaponi winyu ni umwarushachani mwaattiva wa attu o ilhapo chikina, ni waalhehera amalhaponi inyu owoomolhachekeni wo uphanga. Ilhapo inyu inookelhiya nipoohu ni iwani chinyu chinookhalha mathalha.<verse eid="LEV 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 26:34" />“Mwaattiva vanohalha inyu ukhalha mmathathani mwa amalhaponi inyu, vavawo ilhapo phi nohalha aya uchivelhiya nihuku no wiittuwa waya ikatema vanohalha aya ukelhiya nipoohu. Ilhapo inowiittuwa ni uchivelhiya nihuku naya no wiittuwa. <verse eid="LEV 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 26:35" />Ikatema yonkhaye vanohalha aya ukelhiya nipoohu, inowiittuwa, wiittuwa uhinapacha ukhalha vaari inyu nkhalhaka mwommo.<verse eid="LEV 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 26:36" />“Ni akina inyu anowa uhalha ayo, kinowaapanga akhalhe owoova munrimani mwaya, mwiilhaponi mwa aya amalhaponi aya, ata nthaakhuru namoraka ninowaattawiha. Anoottawa thoko ntu nottawa ikhoto, ni uwulhuwa inakhalhaka khaawo ntu naatoporaniha. <verse eid="LEV 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 26:37" />Anoowulhuwelhana pufia thoko ntu nottawa ikhoto inakhalhaka khaawo ntu naatoporaniha. Paahi khannowa mwaakhalha ni machiri ariyoothe o weemelha umihoolho wa amalhaponi inyu. <verse eid="LEV 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 26:38" />Nnookhwelha mwiilhaponi mwa amalhaponi inyu, ni uvithiya wowo. <verse eid="LEV 26:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 26:39" />Akina inyu anohalha uhalhelha velhaponi ayo, anookhwa vakani vakani wo nlhatu no uwonya waya, ni wo nlhatu wo uwonya wa manyaathumwanaya.<verse eid="LEV 26:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 26:40" />“Nansho akhoromaka uwonya waya ni uwonya wa manyaathumwanaya, yaakikhonte ni ukiwonya, <verse eid="LEV 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 26:41" />nkakaarukunuwa ni waahelha mmathathani wa amalhaponi aya. Ni mirima chaya cheetimarikhaka, ni ukhoroma uwonya ni ukikhota waya, <verse eid="LEV 26:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 26:42" />kinoowa koopuwelha malhehano kaalhupenlhe aka Aburahimu, Naisaka ni Nayakhobo ni wuupuwelha ilhapo yaavanhe aka ilhe. <verse eid="LEV 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 26:43" />Wo upacha, yayo ahinaaya ukhumelhelha, attu aka anowa ukhalha uchereshere ilhapo aya, ni yeyo ilhapo iyo inoowa yaateelhiya vanohalha aya ukhalha ni nipoohu. Yeyo ikatema iyo, ayo anowa ukhoroma uwonya waya, waapannge aya wo uhiya ulhoha malhehero aka ni uhivarechesha malheheriyo aka. <verse eid="LEV 26:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 26:44" />Nansho vamoka ni yayo onkhaye ayo, vanohalha aya ukhalha ilhapo ya amalhaponi aya vawo, mii akinaariha wala waavenganana, wiira kaarimeelhihe ni uhiya malhehano aka. Ukhalhawaya mii phi Apwiiya Nlhuku aya. <verse eid="LEV 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 26:45" />Nansho wo nlhatu waya, kinoowa koopuwelha malhehano apannge aka ni manyaathumwanaya vaathaminhe aka ilhapo yo Umisri, attu o ilhapo chikina oonecheshaka wiira mii kikhalhe Nlhuku aya. Mii phi Apwiiya Nlhuku.”<verse eid="LEV 26:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 26:46" />Yayo phi malhehero, malheheriyo ni ikano cha Apwiiya Nlhuku chaavanhe aya attu o Israeli umwaakoni Usinai ulhe wo iphiro ya ashinna Musa.<verse eid="LEV 26:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="LEV 27" />
  <para style="s1">Malheheriyo o chittu chinokumihiya wa Apwiiya Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 27:1" />Yamalheke, Apwiiya Nlhuku yaheerelha ashinna Musa wiira, <verse eid="LEV 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 27:2" />“Mwaahimerie attu o Israeli wiira, yakhalhaka ntu ahottuka ishaani yo waakumihera Apwiiya Nlhuku ntu wo unhika makhura, yoyo ntu uyo athaphulheke ishaani awe wo ulhiva nchurukhu uromolhiye, thoko chinolhikaana aya. <verse eid="LEV 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 27:3" />Nlhopwana o iyaakha makhumi meelhi mpaka makhumi sita oopolhiyeke wo isiliva ivipande makhumi nthanu, wo ulhikaana ni maphimelhiyo o Nihema Nitakatifu. <verse eid="LEV 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 27:4" />Yakhalhaka nthiyana, oopolhiyeke wo isiliva ivipande makhumi mararu. <verse eid="LEV 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 27:5" />Yakhalhaka yoyo ntu uyo o iyaakha uchokholha iyaakha nthanu mpaka makhumi meelhi oopolhiyeke wo isiliva ivipande makhumi meelhi, ni akhalhaka mmirawo oopolhiyeke wo isiliva ivipande makhumi meelhi, ni akhalhaka mwalhi isiliva ivipande khumi. <verse eid="LEV 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 27:6" />Yakhalhaka mwaana o mweeri mmoka mpaka iyaakha nthanu, oopolhiyeke wo isiliva ivipande nthanu akhalhaka mwanlhopwana. Ni akhalhaka mwanthiyana isiliva ivipande ttaru. <verse eid="LEV 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 27:7" />Akhalhaka yoyo ntu uyo iyaakha chawe chihothepa iyaakha makhumi sita, oopolhiyeke wo isiliva ivipande khumi ni nthanu akhalhaka nlhopwana, ni akhalhaka nthiyana isiliva ivipande khumi.<verse eid="LEV 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 27:8" />“Nansho akhalhaka yoyo ntu uyo mmashikini hinooria ulhiva nhakhu awe, paahi yoyo ntu uyo arweehiyeke wa opochera ishaani. Opochera ishaani aphimeke wo ulhikaana ni wooria wo yoyo ntu ttunke ishaani uyo.<verse eid="LEV 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 27:9" />“Yakhalhaka ishaani ene inaacha mwannama anonkumiha aya attu isadaka wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, paahi yoyo mwannama uyo nookhalha ittu itakatifu. <verse eid="LEV 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 27:10" />Khinothananiya umwakakaniha yoyo mwannama uyo ni nkina riyoothe, orera ni onanara ama onanara ni orera. Yakhalhaka anomwaakakaniha ni mwannama nkina, onkhaye oyeelhi anookhalha atakatifu, awaya Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 27:11" />Nansho yakhalhaka yeyo ishaani iyo inomwaacha mwannama hinorumelhelhiya wo iphiro cho waalhapelha Apwiiya Nlhuku, paahi ntu nkuminhe uyo ammwiiheke wa opochera ishaani, <verse eid="LEV 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 27:12" />ni opochera ishaani ayo anooromolha ibei wo ulhikaana ni urera wawe. Iphiro chinohalha aya uromolha opochera ishaani, phi chechiyo chinohalha aya ukhalha. <verse eid="LEV 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 27:13" />Nansho yakhalhaka mwanene nothanana umwoopolha, paahi oncherereke nifungu nimoka no mafungu nthanu o ibei yo mwannama uyo.<verse eid="LEV 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 27:14" />“Ntu akumihaka inupa awe wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, opochera ishaani aamulheke wo ulhikaana ni urera ama uhirera waya. Ibei inohalha aya uromolha phi nohalha aya ukhalha chiicho. <verse eid="LEV 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 27:15" />Yakhalhaka yoyo ntu kumihilhe inupa wa Apwiiya Nlhuku uyo nothanana woopolha yeyo inupa iyo, paahi oncherereke nifungu nimoka no mafungu nthanu no ibei aya, ni iyo inookhalha yawawe.<verse eid="LEV 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 27:16" />“Yakhalhaka ntu noomia imata awe ihiyeriye awe, ni ukumiha wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, paahi ibei aya iphimiyeke wo ulhikaana ni imbeyu chinaalhiya yeyo imata iyo, wo kila ikilo makhumi meelhi o ishayiri ibei aya ikhalheke isiliva makhumi nthanu. <verse eid="LEV 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 27:17" />Akumihaka wa Apwiiya Nlhuku imata awe iyaakha yo isikukuu yo wuupusheriya iyaakha yo makhumi nthanu, ibei aya inothananiya wiira ilhikaaneke ni maphimelhiyo inyu. <verse eid="LEV 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 27:18" />Nansho yakhalhaka nokumiha yaviraka yeyo iyaakha iyo, paahi opochera ishaani aamulheke ibei aya wo ulhikaana ni iyaakha chihanlhe uphiyelha iyaakha yo wuupusheriya iyaakha yo makhumi nthanu ni ibei aya iwukulhiyeke. <verse eid="LEV 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 27:19" />Yakhalhaka mwanene noothanana woopolha, paahi nothananiya wiira oncherereke nifungu nimoka no mafungu nthanu o ibei yo yeyo imata iyo, ni iyo inookhalha yawawe. <verse eid="LEV 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 27:20" />Nansho aahittuneke woopolha ama yakhalhaka opochera ishaani ahonthumihera ntu nkina, paahi yeyo imata iyo ihoopolhiye tho mena. <verse eid="LEV 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 27:21" />Iyaakha yo wuupusheriya iyaakha yo makhumi nthanu, yeyo imata iyo inoohiyereriya ni ukhalha ya Apwiiya Nlhuku, ni uvahiya opochera ishaani.<verse eid="LEV 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 27:22" />“Yakhalhaka ntu nookumiha wa Apwiiya Nlhuku imata ithumme awe, yaani kihiwe ya ashilhoko awe, <verse eid="LEV 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 27:23" />opochera ishaani aromolheke ibei yo yeyo imata iyo wo ulhikaana ni iyaakha ihanlhe uphiyelha iyaakha yo wuupusheriya iyaakha yo makhumi nthanu. Yoyo ntu uyo alhiveke nenno nihuku ibei aya, thoko ittu itakatifu wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 27:24" />Nansho iyaakha yo wuupusheriya iyaakha yo makhumi nthanu, yeyo imata iyo ahokolhosheriye ntu athumihilhe ulhe.<verse eid="LEV 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 27:25" />“Kila ibei iphimiyeke wo ibei iromolhiye u Nihema Nitakatifu, ulhemelha wo igera makhumi meelhi unolhikaana ni ulhemelha wo isiliva imoka.<verse eid="LEV 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 27:26" />“Nhikumihe nttara no mwannama. Wo ikekhiaye yoyo homalha ukhalha awaya Apwiiya Nlhuku, ikhalhe ing'ope ama ikhondoro. <verse eid="LEV 27:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 27:27" />Akhalhaka mwannama uyo khanorumelhelhiya wo waakumihera isadaka Apwiiya Nlhuku, ntu mwanene uyo anthumeke wo ulhiva ibei yonkhaye ni wuncherera nifungu nimoka no mafungu nthanu o ibei yo yoyo mwannama uyo. Yakhalhaka khanoopolhiya, paahi athumihiyeke wo ulhikaana ni ibei yeeshiye.<verse eid="LEV 27:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 27:28" />“Nansho ittu iriyoothe ikumihiye wa Apwiiya Nlhuku, ikhalhe ntu, ama mwannama ama ittu yo uhiyeriya, khinothumihiya wala woopolhiya. Ittu iriyoothe ikumihiye wa Apwiiya Nlhuku phi ittu itakatifu chinene. <verse eid="LEV 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 27:29" />Khaawo ntu riyoothe hukumulhiye wiiviya wo upanga ittu yo uhilhoka umihoolho waka, nohalha woopolhiya, eeviyeke.<verse eid="LEV 27:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 27:30" />“Nifungu nimoka no mafungu khumi o chittu cho mmatani, nikhalhe choolhia ama maphepu o miri, chonkhaye chawaya Apwiiya Nlhuku, phi chitakatifu wa Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 27:31" />Ni yakhalhaka ntu nothanana woopolha nifungu nimoka no mafungu khumi nikumihilhe awe nno, alhiveke ibei aya ni wuncherera vachulhu nifungu nimoka no mafungu nthanu o ibei aya iyo. <verse eid="LEV 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 27:32" />Vanaalhakelha inyu mihuwo, kila mwannama o khumi phi ntakatifu, awaya Apwiiya Nlhuku. <verse eid="LEV 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 27:33" />Ni ntu hiwehewehe wiira yoyo mwannama uyo orera ama onanara, ni mena yoyo mwannama uyo haakakhanihiye ni nkina. Aakakhanihiyaka ni nkina, ashinama onkhaye oyeelhi anookhalha a Apwiiya Nlhuku, anookushiya, khanooria woopolhiya.”<verse eid="LEV 27:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 27:34" />Yayo phi malheheriyo a Apwiiya Nlhuku yaalheheriye attu o Israeli, umwaakoni Usinai wo iphiro ya ashinna Musa.<verse eid="LEV 27:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 27" />
</usx>